window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["story-v-y2v2-index"]=[{"i":"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p6-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka amasawa-ichika","q":"amasawa ichika amasawa  white room prologue  her pov  in her own voice she explains she is a fifth generation white room student  that she has always been compared to the fourth generation  god  ayanokoji kiyotaka and found wanting  and that she worships only hatred  not him  she watched him through a visiting room and shivered at his figure  this is amasawa s interior monologue  her pov  no spoken line is quoted  driven by hatred rather than worship   she refuses to revere ayanokoji and treats him as her enemy  the obstacle to her being recognized as the white room s success story  to prove ayanokoji is not number one and to be recognized by the organization as the true success  the opportunity comes now that he has refused to return to the restarted white room  the fourth generation  god  she has been measured against her whole life  she has resolved to bury him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p6-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html#sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p6-1\">Amasawa: White Room prologue (her POV)<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.6–10<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In her own voice she explains she is a fifth-generation White Room student, that she has always been compared to the fourth-generation &quot;god&quot; Ayanokōji Kiyotaka and found wanting, and that she worships only hatred, not him; she watched him through a visiting room and shivered at his figure.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> This is Amasawa&#x27;s interior monologue (her POV); no spoken line is quoted.<span class=\"pg\">p.6–10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Driven by hatred rather than worship — she refuses to revere Ayanokōji and treats him as her enemy, the obstacle to her being recognized as the White Room&#x27;s success story.<span class=\"pg\">p.6–10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> To prove Ayanokōji is not number one and to be recognized by the organization as the true success; the opportunity comes now that he has refused to return to the restarted White Room.<span class=\"pg\">p.6–10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> The fourth-generation &quot;god&quot; she has been measured against her whole life; she has resolved to bury him.<span class=\"pg\">p.6–10<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p92-1\">→ After: Amasawa forces her way in and teases Kei<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"yukimura-teruhiko horikita-suzune sudou-ken ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the classroom erupts over his perfect math score back in class after tsukishiro s summons  the ayanokoji group waits anxiously  yukimura shakes his leg  haruka tries to calm him  sakura and miyake sit with them  when ayanokoji returns  yukimura confronts him about the 100 in math   no one else in the year  not even ichinose or sakayanagi  got full marks   it s not a question of whether it s hard or not  i didn t even understand the meaning of the question during the exam  the class speculates wildly   cheating  hacking  seeing the paper in advance   while sudo silences the cheating talk  there isn t even a shred of evidence  and hirata steps in to disperse the club members and defuse the tension   you seem to be getting rather excited  but there isn t even a shred of evidence of ayanokouji cheating  is there  don t just jump to conclusions when the person in question isn t here  he is calm and detached while his classmates panic and argue  he watches the chaos with analytical distance  the group s most academic member is the most agitated by his hidden strength  she stays behind to help him smooth things over  sudo defends him against the cheating accusations","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p12-1\">The classroom erupts over his perfect math score<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Back in class after Tsukishiro&#x27;s summons, the Ayanokōji group waits anxiously; Yukimura shakes his leg, Haruka tries to calm him, Sakura and Miyake sit with them. When Ayanokōji returns, Yukimura confronts him about the 100 in math — no one else in the year, not even Ichinose or Sakayanagi, got full marks. The class speculates wildly — cheating, hacking, seeing the paper in advance — while Sudō silences the cheating talk (&quot;there isn&#x27;t even a shred of evidence&quot;), and Hirata steps in to disperse the club members and defuse the tension.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s not a question of whether it&#x27;s hard or not. I didn&#x27;t even understand the meaning of the question during the exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;You seem to be getting rather excited, but there isn&#x27;t even a shred of evidence of Ayanokouji cheating, is there? Don&#x27;t just jump to conclusions when the person in question isn&#x27;t here.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is calm and detached while his classmates panic and argue; he watches the chaos with analytical distance.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> The group&#x27;s most academic member is the most agitated by his hidden strength.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She stays behind to help him smooth things over.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Sudō defends him against the cheating accusations.<span class=\"pg\">p.19–20<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-1\">→ After: Horikita&#x27;s cover story and the reconciliation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"hasebe-haruka","q":"hasebe haruka haruka waits with yukimura and backs the reconciliation she sits with yukimura  sakura and miyake  trying to calm him  after ayanokoji returns she stays silent  letting yukimura vent  she stays quiet during the hallway confrontation to let yukimura think  then forces ayanokoji and yukimura into a reconciliation handshake   alright  make up  perceptive and socially adept   she reads the room and acts to defuse tension","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html#sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p12-1\">Haruka waits with Yukimura and backs the reconciliation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She sits with Yukimura, Sakura and Miyake, trying to calm him; after Ayanokōji returns she stays silent, letting Yukimura vent. She stays quiet during the hallway confrontation to let Yukimura think, then forces Ayanokōji and Yukimura into a reconciliation handshake.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> &quot;Alright, make up!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Perceptive and socially adept — she reads the room and acts to defuse tension.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–45<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p12-2\">→ After: Hasebe tries to calm Yukimura<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p12-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"yukimura-teruhiko ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakura-airi miyake-akito hasebe-haruka","q":"hasebe haruka hasebe tries to calm yukimura  can you calm down a little  it hasn t even been 5 minutes since kiyopon left   i m calm  don t worry    yukimura s reply  hasebe isn t convinced  it s only been 6 minutes  huh  i don t think he ll come back yet  sits with sakura and miyake around the restless yukimura  knowing he doesn t normally shake his leg  decides there s no point calming him and stays to distract him  marvels that ayanokoji alone got a perfect score   not explainable by cramming or luck  gentle and intuitive   reads yukimura s agitation  notes the beautiful may sky and how the mood has darkened  and chooses to stay with him rather than leave him alone  tries to calm him  stays with him to distract him  wondering how incredible the perfect score feat is  sits with her and miyake  sits with the group  later leaves for archery club","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p12-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html#sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p12-2\">Hasebe tries to calm Yukimura<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–15<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html\">Sakura Airi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> &quot;Can you calm down a little? It hasn&#x27;t even been 5 minutes since Kiyopon left.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m calm… don&#x27;t worry.&quot; — Yukimura&#x27;s reply; Hasebe isn&#x27;t convinced<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s only been 6 minutes, huh… I don&#x27;t think he&#x27;ll come back yet.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.13<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Detail<\/span> Sits with Sakura and Miyake around the restless Yukimura, knowing he doesn&#x27;t normally shake his leg; decides there&#x27;s no point calming him and stays to distract him; marvels that Ayanokōji alone got a perfect score — not explainable by cramming or luck.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Gentle and intuitive — reads Yukimura&#x27;s agitation, notes the beautiful May sky and how the mood has darkened, and chooses to stay with him rather than leave him alone.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Tries to calm him; stays with him to distract him.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Wondering how incredible the perfect-score feat is.<span class=\"pg\">p.13–15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakura Airi<\/b> Sits with her and Miyake.<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Sits with the group; later leaves for archery club.<span class=\"pg\">p.12, 22<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p12-1\">← Before: Haruka waits with Yukimura and backs the reconciliation<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p46-1\">→ After: Haruka arrives with the group at Keyaki Mall<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke","q":"hirata yosuke hirata defuses the classroom tension he steps in to calm the class  dispersing club members and pressing pause on the speculation   let s all calm down a bit  we can t solve the problem by just getting heated up here  can we  he backs horikita s cover story  filling gaps in her logic and closing the topic cleanly   i see  i clearly understand what horikita san is trying to say  trusted by the entire class   he reads the situation and acts as the stabilizer","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html#sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p12-1\">Hirata defuses the classroom tension<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He steps in to calm the class, dispersing club members and pressing pause on the speculation. He backs Horikita&#x27;s cover story, filling gaps in her logic and closing the topic cleanly.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> &quot;Let&#x27;s all calm down a bit. We can&#x27;t solve the problem by just getting heated up here, can we?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> &quot;I see. I clearly understand what Horikita-san is trying to say.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Trusted by the entire class — he reads the situation and acts as the stabilizer.<span class=\"pg\">p.21–38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p21-1\">→ After: Hirata defuses the escalating argument<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji","q":"ike kanji ike suggests cheating via past papers he loudly recalls a past cheating incident where a classmate got past exam questions from a third year  suggesting ayanokoji might have done the same   it s definitely possible  like seeing the question paper beforehand or something  quick to jump to conspiratorial explanations","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html#sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p12-1\">Ike suggests cheating via past papers<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He loudly recalls a past cheating incident where a classmate got past exam questions from a third-year, suggesting Ayanokōji might have done the same.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s definitely possible. Like seeing the question paper beforehand or something.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Quick to jump to conspiratorial explanations.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p168-1\">→ After: Ike tries to form a group with Shinohara<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei argues with yukimura over the perfect score she laments that her scores are now visible to everyone via the oaa  then suggests ayanokoji might just be a  math genius  like in tv dramas   maybe ayanokouji kun is just a math genius  you know  sometimes in those tv dramas and stuff  she and yukimura clash heatedly  maezono sides with her   you ve got a big mouth  but couldn t it just be that you didn t understand the question  she covers for ayanokoji by drawing shinohara in to support horikita s story  defensive and quick to argue  but loyal and strategically helpful when needed","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p12-1\">Kei argues with Yukimura over the perfect score<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She laments that her scores are now visible to everyone via the OAA, then suggests Ayanokōji might just be a &quot;math genius&quot; like in TV dramas. She and Yukimura clash heatedly; Maezono sides with her. She covers for Ayanokōji by drawing Shinohara in to support Horikita&#x27;s story.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Maybe Ayanokouji-kun is just a math genius! You know, sometimes in those TV dramas and stuff…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;ve got a big mouth, but couldn&#x27;t it just be that you didn&#x27;t understand the question?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Defensive and quick to argue, but loyal and strategically helpful when needed.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–37<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p15-1\">→ After: Karuizawa&#x27;s &quot;math genius&quot; theory and the argument<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kitou-hayato-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"kitou-hayato","q":"kito hayato kito mentioned in passing named in the classroom discussion about ayanokoji s perfect score  named in the student council recruitment context  passing mentions  not a distinct scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kitou-hayato-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kitou-hayato.html#sc-kitou-hayato-y2v2-p12-1\">Kitō mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12, 27, 44, 53, 66<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kitou-hayato.html\">Kitō Hayato<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the classroom discussion about Ayanokōji&#x27;s perfect score. Named in the student council recruitment context.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.12, 27, 44, 53, 66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.12, 27, 44, 53, 66<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-maezono-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"maezono","q":"maezono maezono sides with kei in the classroom argument she backs karuizawa against yukimura during the heated exchange over ayanokoji s perfect score   yeah  yeah  isn t it weird that you re taking your anger out on karuizawa san  quick to defend her friends in a dispute","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-maezono-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html#sc-maezono-y2v2-p12-1\">Maezono sides with Kei in the classroom argument<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She backs Karuizawa against Yukimura during the heated exchange over Ayanokōji&#x27;s perfect score.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;Yeah, yeah! Isn&#x27;t it weird that you&#x27;re taking your anger out on Karuizawa-san?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Quick to defend her friends in a dispute.<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-minami-setsuya-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"minami-setsuya","q":"minami setsuya minami raises the cheating possibility he suggests ayanokoji might have done something shady to get the perfect score   that s why i was wondering  has this ayanokouji done something shady  suspicious and willing to voice uncomfortable theories","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-minami-setsuya-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/minami-setsuya.html#sc-minami-setsuya-y2v2-p12-1\">Minami raises the cheating possibility<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/minami-setsuya.html\">Minami Setsuya<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He suggests Ayanokōji might have done something shady to get the perfect score.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Minami Setsuya<\/b> &quot;That&#x27;s why I was wondering, has this Ayanokouji done something shady?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Suspicious and willing to voice uncomfortable theories.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-minami-setsuya-y2v2-p18-1\">→ After: Minami raises the &quot;didn&#x27;t do it himself&quot; doubt<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-miyake-akito-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"miyake-akito","q":"miyake akito miyake leaves for club activities he sits with the group and leaves early for archery club  sakura and haruka see him off  yukimura predicts miyake will accept ayanokoji s situation without issue  easygoing and adaptable   expected to take the news in stride","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-miyake-akito-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html#sc-miyake-akito-y2v2-p12-1\">Miyake leaves for club activities<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He sits with the group and leaves early for archery club; Sakura and Haruka see him off. Yukimura predicts Miyake will accept Ayanokōji&#x27;s situation without issue.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Easygoing and adaptable — expected to take the news in stride.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–44<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakura-airi-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"sakura-airi","q":"sakura airi sakura tries to lighten the mood she sits with the group and tries to defuse tension by praising ayanokoji  but her attempt backfires on yukimura   s so he solved such a question  kiyotaka kun sure is amazing  she suggests a reconciliation handshake between ayanokoji and yukimura   h how about you two do a reconciliation handshake  gentle and well meaning  if sometimes tone deaf","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakura-airi-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html#sc-sakura-airi-y2v2-p12-1\">Sakura tries to lighten the mood<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html\">Sakura Airi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She sits with the group and tries to defuse tension by praising Ayanokōji, but her attempt backfires on Yukimura. She suggests a reconciliation handshake between Ayanokōji and Yukimura.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakura Airi<\/b> &quot;S-so he solved such a question, Kiyotaka-kun sure is amazing!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakura Airi<\/b> &quot;H-how about you two do a…reconciliation handshake?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Gentle and well-meaning, if sometimes tone-deaf.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–45<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakura-airi-y2v2-p15-1\">→ After: Sakura&#x27;s praise of Kiyotaka<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"shinohara-satsuki","q":"shinohara satsuki shinohara joins the speculation she joins the group discussion  asking how hard the exam questions were   was the question that hard  she asks sudo how ayanokoji could have cheated   cheat  how would he even cheat  kei draws her in to support horikita s cover story  curious and outspoken   engages with the debate directly","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html#sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v2-p12-1\">Shinohara joins the speculation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She joins the group discussion, asking how hard the exam questions were. She asks Sudō how Ayanokōji could have cheated. Kei draws her in to support Horikita&#x27;s cover story.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> &quot;Was the question that hard?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> &quot;Cheat? How would he even cheat?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Curious and outspoken — engages with the debate directly.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–37<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v2-p168-1\">→ After: Shinohara is courted by Ike and Komiya<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p12-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yukimura-teruhiko","q":"yukimura teruhiko yukimura confronts ayanokoji over the perfect score he waits anxiously for ayanokoji s return  shaking his leg  when ayanokoji arrives  he demands to know how he got 100 in math when even ichinose and sakayanagi didn t  and argues the question was beyond high school level   it s not a question of whether it s hard or not  i didn t even understand the meaning of the question during the exam  he leads the class speculation about cheating and hacking  but hirata and sudo push back  he stays behind when club members leave  academically proud and meticulous   he analyzed the exam question afterward and is genuinely shaken by something he can t explain  confronts him about the score  hurt that his tutoring was unnecessary","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html#sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p12-1\">Yukimura confronts Ayanokōji over the perfect score<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He waits anxiously for Ayanokōji&#x27;s return, shaking his leg; when Ayanokōji arrives, he demands to know how he got 100 in math when even Ichinose and Sakayanagi didn&#x27;t, and argues the question was beyond high-school level. He leads the class speculation about cheating and hacking, but Hirata and Sudō push back; he stays behind when club members leave.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s not a question of whether it&#x27;s hard or not. I didn&#x27;t even understand the meaning of the question during the exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Academically proud and meticulous — he analyzed the exam question afterward and is genuinely shaken by something he can&#x27;t explain.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Confronts him about the score; hurt that his tutoring was unnecessary.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–22<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p12-2\">→ After: Yukimura&#x27;s agitation over the perfect score<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p12-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei hasebe-haruka yukimura-teruhiko","q":"yukimura teruhiko yukimura s agitation over the perfect score waits restlessly in the classroom for ayanokoji  called away by chabashira  his right leg trembling repeatedly despite hasebe s attempts to calm him   it s not a question of whether it s hard or not  i didn t even understand the meaning of the question during the exam   this was a question that we shouldn t have been able to solve   ayanokouji got a perfect score  which should be impossible  i it s like i m witnessing a magic trick   i ve worked to understand everyone s academic abilities during our first year  at least at a certain level   not a single student  not even ichinose or sakayanagi  got a perfect score   if you can t even understand that  then keep your mouth shut  the academically strongest in class d   analyzed the questions from memory and found them beyond a high school scope  his resentment shows in calling ayanokoji by his last name  grows irritated with karuizawa s math genius and cramming theories and bluntly rebukes her  deeply unsettled that the  impossible  perfect score came from someone whose ability he d judged  later leads the questioning  argues with her over her dismissive theories  snaps at her  she tries to calm his trembling leg","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p12-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html#sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p12-2\">Yukimura&#x27;s agitation over the perfect score<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.12–18<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Waits restlessly in the classroom for Ayanokōji (called away by Chabashira), his right leg trembling repeatedly despite Hasebe&#x27;s attempts to calm him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s not a question of whether it&#x27;s hard or not. I didn&#x27;t even understand the meaning of the question during the exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> &quot;this was a question that we shouldn&#x27;t have been able to solve.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji got a perfect score, which should be impossible. I…it&#x27;s like I&#x27;m witnessing a magic trick!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;ve worked to understand everyone&#x27;s academic abilities during our first year, at least at a certain level.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Not a single student, not even Ichinose or Sakayanagi, got a perfect score.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If you can&#x27;t even understand that, then keep your mouth shut.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> The academically strongest in Class D — analyzed the questions from memory and found them beyond a high-school scope; his resentment shows in calling Ayanokōji by his last name; grows irritated with Karuizawa&#x27;s math-genius and cramming theories and bluntly rebukes her.<span class=\"pg\">p.12–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Deeply unsettled that the &quot;impossible&quot; perfect score came from someone whose ability he&#x27;d judged; later leads the questioning.<span class=\"pg\">p.14–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Argues with her over her dismissive theories; snaps at her.<span class=\"pg\">p.16–17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> She tries to calm his trembling leg.<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p12-1\">← Before: Yukimura confronts Ayanokōji over the perfect score<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p23-1\">→ After: Yukimura&#x27;s reconciliation with Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p15-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yukimura-teruhiko maezono karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei karuizawa s  math genius  theory and the argument  maybe ayanokouji kun is just a math genius   sometimes in those tv dramas and stuff  isn t there  like  a protagonist that only uses math or something to solve the murder case   waaah  i hate this  wouldn t this mean that a lot of people will know my scores  this is the worst   you ve got a big mouth  but couldn t it just be that you didn t understand the question   you re pissing me off  laments that the tablet lets other classes see everyone s scores  offers the off the point  math genius  theory and plays the fool deliberately even knowing her words are far fetched  grows angry at yukimura s blunt dismissal  speculates he s a  math genius  or hid his ability  arguments escalate with him  he calls her words stupid  maezono backs her up and fires back at yukimura","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p15-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p15-1\">Karuizawa&#x27;s &quot;math genius&quot; theory and the argument<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.15–18<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Maybe Ayanokouji-kun is just a math genius!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;sometimes in those TV dramas and stuff, isn&#x27;t there, like, a protagonist that only uses math or something to solve the murder case?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Waaah, I hate this! Wouldn&#x27;t this mean that a lot of people will know my scores? This is the worst!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;ve got a big mouth, but couldn&#x27;t it just be that you didn&#x27;t understand the question?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;re pissing me off.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Laments that the tablet lets other classes see everyone&#x27;s scores; offers the off-the-point &quot;math genius&quot; theory and plays the fool deliberately even knowing her words are far-fetched; grows angry at Yukimura&#x27;s blunt dismissal.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Speculates he&#x27;s a &quot;math genius&quot; or hid his ability.<span class=\"pg\">p.16–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Arguments escalate with him; he calls her words stupid.<span class=\"pg\">p.16–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> Maezono backs her up and fires back at Yukimura.<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p12-1\">← Before: Kei argues with Yukimura over the perfect score<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p83-1\">→ After: Kei visits Ayanokōji&#x27;s room<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakura-airi-y2v2-p15-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yukimura-teruhiko sakura-airi","q":"sakura airi sakura s praise of kiyotaka  s so he solved such a question  kiyotaka kun sure is amazing  tries to lighten the dreary mood with a sage smile and praise of ayanokoji   but it has the opposite effect  tightening yukimura s face  admires him  calls him  kiyotaka kun  her well meant comment irritates him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakura-airi-y2v2-p15-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html#sc-sakura-airi-y2v2-p15-1\">Sakura&#x27;s praise of Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.15<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html\">Sakura Airi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakura Airi<\/b> &quot;S-so he solved such a question, Kiyotaka-kun sure is amazing!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Tries to lighten the dreary mood with a sage smile and praise of Ayanokōji — but it has the opposite effect, tightening Yukimura&#x27;s face.<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Admires him; calls him &quot;Kiyotaka-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Her well-meant comment irritates him.<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakura-airi-y2v2-p12-1\">← Before: Sakura tries to lighten the mood<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p15-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei ayanokouji-kiyotaka shinohara","q":"shinohara shinohara in the perfect score uproar joins the class discussion of ayanokoji s perfect math score  takes the tablet and swipes in disbelief at results from every class in the year   do tell me more   i didn t even notice  you can even see the results of the other classes  why is that   cheat  how would he even cheat  kei draws her in to back the  hiding our strength  cover story about ayanokoji and horikita  she supplies the corroborating detail about their supposedly secret talks   that s right  i feel like i ve been seeing horikita san and ayanokouji kun talking secretly for a long time now  but it turns out that they re really just doing it for the class  an engaged  outspoken classmate   quick to join speculation about the perfect score  and a willing accomplice to kei s redirection  her claim that they are often seen talking gives the cover story credibility  kei s friend  called on to back her reframing of ayanokoji and horikita  speculates about his perfect score  then helps cover for him at kei s prompting","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p15-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara.html#sc-shinohara-y2v2-p15-1\">Shinohara in the perfect-score uproar<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.15–19, 37<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara.html\">Shinohara<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Joins the class discussion of Ayanokōji&#x27;s perfect math score; takes the tablet and swipes in disbelief at results from every class in the year. Kei draws her in to back the &quot;hiding our strength&quot; cover story about Ayanokōji and Horikita; she supplies the corroborating detail about their supposedly secret talks.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara<\/b> &quot;Do tell me more.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara<\/b> &quot;I didn&#x27;t even notice. You can even see the results of the other classes. Why is that?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara<\/b> &quot;Cheat? How would he even cheat?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That&#x27;s right! I feel like I&#x27;ve been seeing Horikita-san and Ayanokouji-kun talking secretly for a long time now, but it turns out that they&#x27;re really just doing it for the class!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> An engaged, outspoken classmate — quick to join speculation about the perfect score, and a willing accomplice to Kei&#x27;s redirection; her claim that they are often seen talking gives the cover story credibility.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Kei&#x27;s friend, called on to back her reframing of Ayanokōji and Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Speculates about his perfect score, then helps cover for him at Kei&#x27;s prompting.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–37<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p168-1\">→ After: Shinohara: Ike&#x27;s clumsy proposal, Komiya&#x27;s comfort<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-minami-setsuya-y2v2-p18-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yukimura-teruhiko minami-setsuya","q":"minami setsuya minami raises the  didn t do it himself  doubt  ayanokouji getting a perfect score is indeed confusing  and i don t think there s anything strange with what yukimura said   isn t this happening too suddenly  after all  he s never gotten any amazing marks before   that s why i was wondering  has this ayanokouji done something shady   hacking the school computers and stealing the answers or something  isn t that possible  throws himself into the discussion  agreeing with yukimura from a different angle   introducing the doubt that ayanokoji didn t achieve the score through his own strength  hacking stealing answers  his theory is called stupid  suggests he may have cheated  adds to his line of doubt","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-minami-setsuya-y2v2-p18-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/minami-setsuya.html#sc-minami-setsuya-y2v2-p18-1\">Minami raises the &quot;didn&#x27;t do it himself&quot; doubt<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.18–19<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/minami-setsuya.html\">Minami Setsuya<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Minami Setsuya<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji getting a perfect score is indeed confusing, and I don&#x27;t think there&#x27;s anything strange with what Yukimura said.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Minami Setsuya<\/b> &quot;isn&#x27;t this happening too suddenly? After all, he&#x27;s never gotten any amazing marks before.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Minami Setsuya<\/b> &quot;That&#x27;s why I was wondering, has this Ayanokouji done something shady?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Hacking the school computers and stealing the answers or something! Isn&#x27;t that possible!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Throws himself into the discussion, agreeing with Yukimura from a different angle — introducing the doubt that Ayanokōji didn&#x27;t achieve the score through his own strength (hacking/stealing answers); his theory is called stupid.<span class=\"pg\">p.18–19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Suggests he may have cheated.<span class=\"pg\">p.18–19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Adds to his line of doubt.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-minami-setsuya-y2v2-p12-1\">← Before: Minami raises the cheating possibility<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p19-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"sudou-ken","q":"sudo ken sudo defends ayanokoji against cheating accusations he stands up and silences the cheating speculation  arguing there s no evidence  miyamoto counters with oaa data   you seem to be getting rather excited  but there isn t even a shred of evidence of ayanokouji cheating  is there  after golden week  he runs into ayanokoji at the shoe lockers and confronts him about his hidden math and fighting strength  he grabs his bicep  concludes he is  someone we need to rise up to class a  and promises not to tell anyone about the hosen fight   so you were hiding the fact you re good at studying because of suzune s strategy  right   you  you surpassed that monster housen s strength and stopped him  i m not wrong  am i   it might be cold coming from a friend of haruki  but i m glad you didn t get expelled during the class vote  there s no doubt that you re someone we need to rise up to class a  matured and perceptive   he assesses the situation calmly  trusts ayanokoji  and keeps his secrets","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p19-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html#sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p19-1\">Sudō defends Ayanokōji against cheating accusations<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.19–20<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He stands up and silences the cheating speculation, arguing there&#x27;s no evidence; Miyamoto counters with OAA data. After Golden Week, he runs into Ayanokōji at the shoe lockers and confronts him about his hidden math and fighting strength; he grabs his bicep, concludes he is &quot;someone we need to rise up to Class A,&quot; and promises not to tell anyone about the Hōsen fight.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;You seem to be getting rather excited, but there isn&#x27;t even a shred of evidence of Ayanokouji cheating, is there?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;So you were hiding the fact you&#x27;re good at studying because of Suzune&#x27;s strategy, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;You… you surpassed that monster Housen&#x27;s strength and stopped him. I&#x27;m not wrong, am I?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It might be cold coming from a friend of Haruki, but I&#x27;m glad you didn&#x27;t get expelled during the class vote. There&#x27;s no doubt that you&#x27;re someone we need to rise up to Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Matured and perceptive — he assesses the situation calmly, trusts Ayanokōji, and keeps his secrets.<span class=\"pg\">p.19–63<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p19-2\">→ After: Sudō defends Ayanokōji against the cheating talk<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p19-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ike-kanji miyamoto-soshi horikita-suzune sudou-ken","q":"sudo ken sudo defends ayanokoji against the cheating talk  you seem to be getting rather excited  but there isn t even a shred of evidence of ayanokouji cheating  is there   don t just jump to conclusions when the person in question isn t here   that s not what i meant  but there is no way he was easily able to see the question paper  right   i just thought that it s more likely that he got that perfect score with his own abilities   that just means he s different from last year  anyone can grow  stands up  his 186cm frame gathering the class s attention  to reject the cheating speculation as unreasonable   surprising everyone  especially ike  argues ayanokoji more likely earned it and that people can improve  leaves quietly for club activities after hirata s nudge  glancing at the silent horikita  defends him against the class s suspicion  his longtime friend is displeased that he took ayanokoji s side  miyamoto insists ayanokoji s oaa was lower  sudo notes his own rise above miyamoto  54 vs 53  glances at her before leaving  she sat silent through the whole commotion","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p19-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html#sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p19-2\">Sudō defends Ayanokōji against the cheating talk<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.19–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/miyamoto-soshi.html\">Miyamoto Soshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;You seem to be getting rather excited, but there isn&#x27;t even a shred of evidence of Ayanokouji cheating, is there?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;Don&#x27;t just jump to conclusions when the person in question isn&#x27;t here.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;That&#x27;s not what I meant. But there is no way he was easily able to see the question paper, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I just thought that it&#x27;s more likely that he got that perfect score with his own abilities.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That just means he&#x27;s different from last year. Anyone can grow.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Stands up (his 186cm frame gathering the class&#x27;s attention) to reject the cheating speculation as unreasonable — surprising everyone, especially Ike; argues Ayanokōji more likely earned it and that people can improve; leaves quietly for club activities after Hirata&#x27;s nudge, glancing at the silent Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.19–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Defends him against the class&#x27;s suspicion.<span class=\"pg\">p.19–20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> His longtime friend is displeased that he took Ayanokōji&#x27;s side.<span class=\"pg\">p.19–20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyamoto Soshi<\/b> Miyamoto insists Ayanokōji&#x27;s OAA was lower; Sudō notes his own rise above Miyamoto (54 vs 53).<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Glances at her before leaving; she sat silent through the whole commotion.<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p19-1\">← Before: Sudō defends Ayanokōji against cheating accusations<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p169-1\">→ After: Sudō&#x27;s group situation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p21-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"sudou-ken hirata-yousuke","q":"hirata yosuke hirata defuses the escalating argument  let s all calm down a bit  we can t solve the problem by just getting heated up here  can we   sudo kun  isn t it almost time for your club activities   you know by now that the  i ll be late just this one time  excuse won t work  right  the class s unifier stays quiet until he s sure what everyone thinks  then presses pause   gently sending sudo and the club members off to activities  judging reducing numbers the primary goal  so the speculation doesn t derail into internal strife  gently reminds him of club activities to cool him down","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p21-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html#sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p21-1\">Hirata defuses the escalating argument<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.21–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> &quot;Let&#x27;s all calm down a bit. We can&#x27;t solve the problem by just getting heated up here, can we?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> &quot;Sudo-kun, isn&#x27;t it almost time for your club activities?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> &quot;You know by now that the &#x27;I&#x27;ll be late just this one time&#x27; excuse won&#x27;t work, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> The class&#x27;s unifier stays quiet until he&#x27;s sure what everyone thinks, then presses pause — gently sending Sudō and the club members off to activities (judging reducing numbers the primary goal) so the speculation doesn&#x27;t derail into internal strife.<span class=\"pg\">p.21–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Gently reminds him of club activities to cool him down.<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p12-1\">← Before: Hirata defuses the classroom tension<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p123-1\">→ After: Hirata questions the exam rules<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune yukimura-teruhiko hasebe-haruka hirata-yousuke karuizawa-kei ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka horikita s cover story and the reconciliation horikita takes the floor and spins the  reserve strategy    she claims she discovered his math talent last spring and asked him to hold back to avoid becoming a target  the class is skeptical  but yousuke and kei back her up   yukimura kun and i  no  the entire 2nd year couldn t get this perfect score  so how was ayanokouji kun able to achieve that  don t you all think that s inconceivable  yousuke supports horikita s logic  an unknown enemy is more dangerous  and kei draws shinohara in to reinforce credibility  even keisei is partially convinced  after class  the ayanokoji group corners him in the hallway  keisei is angry and hurt  and ayanokoji apologizes honestly without blaming horikita   i ve always trusted you guys  but i judged that not revealing it to anyone  keisei threatens to leave the group but relents  proposing to continue tutoring him as before  haruka forces a handshake to seal the reconciliation   i want out of this group  well  i d be lying if i said i didn t have that thought  he is grateful to horikita for handling the crisis without preparation  and careful not to betray her by blaming her  he chooses honesty with his friends over the easy excuse  she improvises a cover story for him and he is genuinely grateful  keisei s hurt and reconciliation   he proposes to continue tutoring  forces the reconciliation handshake  yousuke backs horikita s story and closes the topic  kei draws shinohara in to support the cover story","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-1\">Horikita&#x27;s cover story and the reconciliation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.23–38<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Horikita takes the floor and spins the &quot;reserve strategy&quot; — she claims she discovered his math talent last spring and asked him to hold back to avoid becoming a target; the class is skeptical, but Yousuke and Kei back her up. Yousuke supports Horikita&#x27;s logic (an unknown enemy is more dangerous), and Kei draws Shinohara in to reinforce credibility; even Keisei is partially convinced. After class, the Ayanokōji group corners him in the hallway; Keisei is angry and hurt, and Ayanokōji apologizes honestly without blaming Horikita. Keisei threatens to leave the group but relents, proposing to continue tutoring him as before; Haruka forces a handshake to seal the reconciliation.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Yukimura-kun and I- no, the entire 2nd year couldn&#x27;t get this perfect score, so how was Ayanokouji-kun able to achieve that? Don&#x27;t you all think that&#x27;s inconceivable?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ve always trusted you guys. But I judged that not revealing it to anyone&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.40<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I want out of this group- Well, I&#x27;d be lying if I said I didn&#x27;t have that thought.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is grateful to Horikita for handling the crisis without preparation, and careful not to betray her by blaming her; he chooses honesty with his friends over the easy excuse.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–45<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She improvises a cover story for him and he is genuinely grateful.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Keisei&#x27;s hurt and reconciliation — he proposes to continue tutoring.<span class=\"pg\">p.39–45<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Forces the reconciliation handshake.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–45<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Yousuke backs Horikita&#x27;s story and closes the topic.<span class=\"pg\">p.35–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Kei draws Shinohara in to support the cover story.<span class=\"pg\">p.36–37<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p12-1\">← Before: The classroom erupts over his perfect math score<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-2\">→ After: After Tsukishiro&#x27;s office; Chabashira&#x27;s carelessness<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae tsukishiro ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka after tsukishiro s office  chabashira s carelessness leaves the reception room after tsukishiro  breathing a short sigh  his left hand  from hosen s knife  still wounded  he reflects he  escaped to this school  but a chain now follows him forever   only expulsion could free him   looks like you re done talking   you ll be a bit of a celebrity from now on   there s no use in acting in advance  i ll start from this stage   this is going to be hard for you  prepare yourself to be bombarded with questions   can we stop here  if i m walking with a teacher alone from now on  it ll attract a lot of unnecessary attention  notes chabashira waiting for him after tsukishiro s summons is careless  tsukishiro might suspect a trap  her caution differs from his because she sees tsukishiro only as ayanokoji s father s connection  not knowing the white room s background  sees through her joy at his perfect score  keeps his distance from chabashira yet relies on her   she is overflowing with joy beneath a poker face and  despite her distance from students  might actually be the closest to them  secretly allied  she worries about the attention his perfect score will bring  he casts her from his mind as easy to manipulate  just left his office  the  chain  he can t escape","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-2\">After Tsukishiro&#x27;s office; Chabashira&#x27;s carelessness<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.23–26<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Leaves the reception room after Tsukishiro, breathing a short sigh; his left hand (from Hōsen&#x27;s knife) still wounded, he reflects he &quot;escaped to this school&quot; but a chain now follows him forever — only expulsion could free him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;Looks like you&#x27;re done talking?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;ll be a bit of a celebrity from now on.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;There&#x27;s no use in acting in advance. I&#x27;ll start from this stage.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;This is going to be hard for you. Prepare yourself to be bombarded with questions.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Can we stop here? If I&#x27;m walking with a teacher alone from now on, it&#x27;ll attract a lot of unnecessary attention.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> Notes Chabashira waiting for him after Tsukishiro&#x27;s summons is careless (Tsukishiro might suspect a trap); her caution differs from his because she sees Tsukishiro only as Ayanokōji&#x27;s father&#x27;s connection, not knowing the White Room&#x27;s background; sees through her joy at his perfect score.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–26<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Keeps his distance from Chabashira yet relies on her — she is overflowing with joy beneath a poker face and, despite her distance from students, might actually be the closest to them.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–26<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Secretly allied; she worries about the attention his perfect score will bring; he casts her from his mind as easy to manipulate.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–26<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Just left his office; the &quot;chain&quot; he can&#x27;t escape.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–24<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-1\">← Before: Horikita&#x27;s cover story and the reconciliation<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p27-1\">→ After: The class confronts him; Horikita&#x27;s cover story<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p23-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"chabashira-sae","q":"chabashira sae chabashira waits for ayanokoji after tsukishiro s summons she waits for ayanokoji near the reception room after his summons by tsukishiro  overjoyed by his perfect score  he worries her presence is unnatural and careless  but she can t suppress her joy  emotionally invested in his success   her poker face fails  which he finds comical and risky","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p23-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html#sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p23-1\">Chabashira waits for Ayanokōji after Tsukishiro&#x27;s summons<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.23–26<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She waits for Ayanokōji near the reception room after his summons by Tsukishiro, overjoyed by his perfect score; he worries her presence is unnatural and careless, but she can&#x27;t suppress her joy.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Emotionally invested in his success — her poker face fails, which he finds comical and risky.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–26<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-1\">→ After: Chabashira announces the uninhabited island exam<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p23-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita s cover story for ayanokoji s perfect score she takes the floor and spins the  reserve strategy    claiming she discovered his math talent last spring and asked him to hold back  the class is skeptical   yukimura kun and i  no  the entire 2nd year couldn t get this perfect score  so how was ayanokouji kun able to achieve that  she argues that hiding his strength protected him from becoming a target  and that the class has grown enough to protect him now  yousuke and kei back her up   from the very start he had the knowledge to get perfect scores in math  as i knew this before anyone else  i thought up a little strategy  she closes the topic and leaves first  letting ayanokoji handle the rest  quick witted and eloquent under pressure   she improvises a convincing cover story without prior preparation  she protects him by fabricating a strategic narrative","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p23-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p23-1\">Horikita&#x27;s cover story for Ayanokōji&#x27;s perfect score<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.23–38<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She takes the floor and spins the &quot;reserve strategy&quot; — claiming she discovered his math talent last spring and asked him to hold back; the class is skeptical. She argues that hiding his strength protected him from becoming a target, and that the class has grown enough to protect him now; Yousuke and Kei back her up. She closes the topic and leaves first, letting Ayanokōji handle the rest.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Yukimura-kun and I- no, the entire 2nd year couldn&#x27;t get this perfect score, so how was Ayanokouji-kun able to achieve that?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;From the very start he had the knowledge to get perfect scores in math. As I knew this before anyone else, I thought up a little strategy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Quick-witted and eloquent under pressure — she improvises a convincing cover story without prior preparation.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She protects him by fabricating a strategic narrative.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p27-1\">→ After: Horikita stays back to smooth things over<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p23-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"yukimura-teruhiko","q":"yukimura teruhiko yukimura s reconciliation with ayanokoji he listens to horikita s cover story with sharp skepticism  pressing on why hiding strength helped the class  yousuke s support partially convinces him   better than you in academics  hold on  i remember kiyotaka s scores being about average all around since school started  after class he corners ayanokoji in the hallway  he is angry and hurt  admits he considered leaving the group  but proposes to continue tutoring him as before   why didn t you tell us before  if it s to hide information as horikita said  does that mean that you don t trust us at all   i want out of this group  well  i d be lying if i said i didn t have that thought  rational and fair minded   he suppresses his hurt for the group s sake and chooses to keep tutoring ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p23-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html#sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p23-1\">Yukimura&#x27;s reconciliation with Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.23–45<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He listens to Horikita&#x27;s cover story with sharp skepticism, pressing on why hiding strength helped the class; Yousuke&#x27;s support partially convinces him. After class he corners Ayanokōji in the hallway; he is angry and hurt, admits he considered leaving the group, but proposes to continue tutoring him as before.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> &quot;Better than you in academics? Hold on. I remember Kiyotaka&#x27;s scores being about average all around since school started.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> &quot;Why didn&#x27;t you tell us before?… If it&#x27;s to hide information as Horikita said, does that mean that you don&#x27;t trust us at all?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.40<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> &quot;I want out of this group- Well, I&#x27;d be lying if I said I didn&#x27;t have that thought.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Rational and fair-minded — he suppresses his hurt for the group&#x27;s sake and chooses to keep tutoring Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–45<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p12-2\">← Before: Yukimura&#x27;s agitation over the perfect score<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p327-1\">→ After: Keisei worries about Ayanokōji going solo<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v2-p24-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari mashima mentioned in passing named in the context of ayanokoji s injured left hand  chabashira asks about it  passing mention  not a distinct scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v2-p24-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html#sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v2-p24-1\">Mashima mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.24<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the context of Ayanokōji&#x27;s injured left hand; Chabashira asks about it.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p27-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ishigami-kyou horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the class confronts him  horikita s cover story returns to the classroom to find students who didn t have club activities still waiting for him  keisei leads the charge  resentful  with haruka and airi gathered around   you  what s with the 100 points in math   you re the only one in the entire year   well  let me explain this   yukimura kun and i  no  the entire 2nd year couldn t get this perfect score  so how was ayanokouji kun able to achieve that   it s hard not to be suspicious  if i were a student who knew nothing  i would definitely feel the same way  however  that isn t the case here  had hoped most students would have left  realizes horikita stayed back  having not answered his call  specifically to smooth things over   an accurate judgment  and he is grateful  she steps in to speak for him  using a mystifying expression to gather attention and defuse the cheating accusation  presses him resentfully about the perfect score  he wanted to talk right after school","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p27-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p27-1\">The class confronts him; Horikita&#x27;s cover story<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.27–30<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Returns to the classroom to find students who didn&#x27;t have club activities still waiting for him; Keisei leads the charge, resentful, with Haruka and Airi gathered around.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ishigami-kyou.html\">Ishigami Kyō<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō<\/b> &quot;You… what&#x27;s with the 100 points in math?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;re the only one in the entire year.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Well, let me explain this.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Yukimura-kun and I- no, the entire 2nd year couldn&#x27;t get this perfect score, so how was Ayanokouji-kun able to achieve that?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;it&#x27;s hard not to be suspicious. If I were a student who knew nothing, I would definitely feel the same way… However, that isn&#x27;t the case here.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> Had hoped most students would have left; realizes Horikita stayed back (having not answered his call) specifically to smooth things over — an accurate judgment, and he is grateful.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She steps in to speak for him, using a mystifying expression to gather attention and defuse the cheating accusation.<span class=\"pg\">p.27–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō<\/b> Presses him resentfully about the perfect score; he wanted to talk right after school.<span class=\"pg\">p.27–30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p23-2\">← Before: After Tsukishiro&#x27;s office; Chabashira&#x27;s carelessness<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-1\">→ After: Keyaki Mall: Ichinose, Kanzaki, and Sudō<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p27-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ishigami-kyou horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita stays back to smooth things over remains in the classroom after ayanokoji s summons  having not answered his call  having assessed that the remaining students are waiting for him   well  let me explain this   yukimura kun and i  no  the entire 2nd year couldn t get this perfect score  so how was ayanokouji kun able to achieve that   it s hard not to be suspicious  if i were a student who knew nothing  i would definitely feel the same way  however  that isn t the case here  accurately judges the situation and stays to help  steps to ayanokoji s side  using a deliberately mystifying expression to gather the class s attention and pivot the cheating accusation   she is the one with the  answers  they seek  covers for him  he is grateful for her accurate reading  blocks keisei s direct questioning   he resents her as an  unnecessary outsider","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p27-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p27-1\">Horikita stays back to smooth things over<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.27–30<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Remains in the classroom after Ayanokōji&#x27;s summons (having not answered his call), having assessed that the remaining students are waiting for him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ishigami-kyou.html\">Ishigami Kyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Well, let me explain this.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Yukimura-kun and I- no, the entire 2nd year couldn&#x27;t get this perfect score, so how was Ayanokouji-kun able to achieve that?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;it&#x27;s hard not to be suspicious. If I were a student who knew nothing, I would definitely feel the same way… However, that isn&#x27;t the case here.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Accurately judges the situation and stays to help; steps to Ayanokōji&#x27;s side, using a deliberately mystifying expression to gather the class&#x27;s attention and pivot the cheating accusation — she is the one with the &quot;answers&quot; they seek.<span class=\"pg\">p.27–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Covers for him; he is grateful for her accurate reading.<span class=\"pg\">p.27–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō<\/b> Blocks Keisei&#x27;s direct questioning — he resents her as an &quot;unnecessary outsider.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.28–30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p23-1\">← Before: Horikita&#x27;s cover story for Ayanokōji&#x27;s perfect score<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p65-1\">→ After: Horikita and Ayanokōji theorize about the bounty<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v2-p29-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin in the shoplifting investigation she bursts into the student council meeting and exposes nagumo s shoplifting order  she stops ayanokoji outside the council room and asks him to investigate the shoplifting case  kiryuin was present in these scenes  entries already exist in the year 2  vol  9 block for the same character","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v2-p29-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html#sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v2-p29-1\">Kiryūin in the shoplifting investigation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.29–33, 76–78<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She bursts into the student council meeting and exposes Nagumo&#x27;s shoplifting order. She stops Ayanokōji outside the council room and asks him to investigate the shoplifting case.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Kiryūin was present in these scenes; entries already exist in the Year 2, Vol. 9 block for the same character.<span class=\"pg\">p.29–33, 76–78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yamauchi-haruki-y2v2-p33-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"yamauchi-haruki","q":"yamauchi haruki yamauchi mentioned in passing named in horikita s cover story   she mentions yamauchi as someone who was expelled  named    yamauchi would have been more careful  passing mentions  not a distinct scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yamauchi-haruki-y2v2-p33-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html#sc-yamauchi-haruki-y2v2-p33-1\">Yamauchi mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.33, 62<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in Horikita&#x27;s cover story — she mentions Yamauchi as someone who was expelled. Named — &quot;Yamauchi would have been more careful.&quot;<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.33, 62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.33, 62<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji sudou-ken hasebe-haruka ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka keyaki mall  ichinose  kanzaki  and sudo he arrives at keyaki mall at 6 30 a m  to wait for his friends  ichinose and kanzaki bump into him  and ichinose congratulates him on the perfect score while kanzaki accuses him of hiding more than math   judging from last year s oaa  you shouldn t have the strength to get a full score  kanzaki presses him on whether his legs and fighting strength are also hidden  ichinose defuses the argument  then privately tells him to trust his classmates and never let her get expelled   ayanokouji kun is not our enemy   class 1 b  the class that only you protected  that class doesn t exist anymore   i won t ever let you get expelled  after golden week  he runs into sudo at the shoe lockers  sudo confronts him about his hidden math and fighting strength  grabs his bicep  and concludes he is  someone we need to rise up to class a   so you were hiding the fact you re good at studying because of suzune s strategy  right   you  you surpassed that monster housen s strength and stopped him  i m not wrong  am i   it might be cold coming from a friend of haruki  but i m glad you didn t get expelled during the class vote  there s no doubt that you re someone we need to rise up to class a  he is patient  honest when pressed  and willing to be vulnerable with friends  he appreciates sudo s growth and trust  she tells him to trust his classmates and promises to protect him from expulsion  kanzaki is hostile and suspicious of his hidden strengths  sudo confronts him about his strength and ultimately trusts him  she arrives with the group and is suspicious about his talk with ichinose","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-1\">Keyaki Mall: Ichinose, Kanzaki, and Sudō<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.46–53<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He arrives at Keyaki Mall at 6:30 a.m. to wait for his friends; Ichinose and Kanzaki bump into him, and Ichinose congratulates him on the perfect score while Kanzaki accuses him of hiding more than math. Kanzaki presses him on whether his legs and fighting strength are also hidden; Ichinose defuses the argument, then privately tells him to trust his classmates and never let her get expelled. After Golden Week, he runs into Sudō at the shoe lockers; Sudō confronts him about his hidden math and fighting strength, grabs his bicep, and concludes he is &quot;someone we need to rise up to Class A.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Judging from last year&#x27;s OAA, you shouldn&#x27;t have the strength to get a full score.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji-kun is not our enemy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Class 1-B, the class that only you protected, that class doesn&#x27;t exist anymore.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I won&#x27;t ever let you get expelled.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;So you were hiding the fact you&#x27;re good at studying because of Suzune&#x27;s strategy, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You… you surpassed that monster Housen&#x27;s strength and stopped him. I&#x27;m not wrong, am I?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It might be cold coming from a friend of Haruki, but I&#x27;m glad you didn&#x27;t get expelled during the class vote. There&#x27;s no doubt that you&#x27;re someone we need to rise up to Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is patient, honest when pressed, and willing to be vulnerable with friends; he appreciates Sudō&#x27;s growth and trust.<span class=\"pg\">p.46–63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She tells him to trust his classmates and promises to protect him from expulsion.<span class=\"pg\">p.46–52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Kanzaki is hostile and suspicious of his hidden strengths.<span class=\"pg\">p.46–49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Sudō confronts him about his strength and ultimately trusts him.<span class=\"pg\">p.53–63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> She arrives with the group and is suspicious about his talk with Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p27-1\">← Before: The class confronts him; Horikita&#x27;s cover story<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-2\">→ After: Keyaki Mall: Ichinose and Kanzaki<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka keyaki mall  ichinose and kanzaki arrives at 6 30 a m   before the agreed 7  to wait alone in front of keyaki mall   his  special skill  of emptying his mind  learns airi is already leaving the dorm via the group chat   ayanokouji kun  are you waiting for someone   i m waiting for my friends to go eat   you actually got a perfect score in math  that s amazing   judging from last year s oaa  you shouldn t have the strength to get a full score   there s a lot of reasons for this  it was only after discussing with my comrades that i decided to hide the fact that i m good at math   ayanokouji kun is not our enemy   i want for you to trust your classmates  put their safety first and continue the fight   i won t ever let you get expelled   you are the same too  you certainly have such a weapon yourself  gives the explanation he knows ichinose kanzaki can fill in  judges kanzaki s guardedness correct and ichinose s trust unusual  ignites a  blazing fire  in ichinose s eyes to keep her from stopping  and analyzes that her inclusiveness kills her classmates  individuality  encourages her after class b s fall  promises never to let her be expelled   she departs embarrassed but resolved to stay  he is openly hostile suspicious  presses about other hidden abilities  he leaves first  ayanokoji notes his reaction is understandable given class b s fall","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-2\">Keyaki Mall: Ichinose and Kanzaki<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.46–52<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives at 6:30 a.m. (before the agreed 7) to wait alone in front of Keyaki Mall — his &quot;special skill&quot; of emptying his mind; learns Airi is already leaving the dorm via the group chat.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji-kun, are you waiting for someone?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m waiting for my friends to go eat.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;You actually got a perfect score in math, that&#x27;s amazing!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Judging from last year&#x27;s OAA, you shouldn&#x27;t have the strength to get a full score.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;There&#x27;s a lot of reasons for this. It was only after discussing with my comrades that I decided to hide the fact that I&#x27;m good at math.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ayanokouji-kun is not our enemy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I want for you to trust your classmates, put their safety first and continue the fight.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I won&#x27;t ever let you get expelled.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You are the same too. You certainly have such a weapon yourself.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Gives the explanation he knows Ichinose/Kanzaki can fill in; judges Kanzaki&#x27;s guardedness correct and Ichinose&#x27;s trust unusual; ignites a &quot;blazing fire&quot; in Ichinose&#x27;s eyes to keep her from stopping, and analyzes that her inclusiveness kills her classmates&#x27; individuality.<span class=\"pg\">p.46–52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Encourages her after Class B&#x27;s fall; promises never to let her be expelled — she departs embarrassed but resolved to stay.<span class=\"pg\">p.46–52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> He is openly hostile/suspicious, presses about other hidden abilities; he leaves first; Ayanokōji notes his reaction is understandable given Class B&#x27;s fall.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-1\">← Before: Keyaki Mall: Ichinose, Kanzaki, and Sudō<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p53-1\">→ After: The group after Ichinose; Sudō&#x27;s questions<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p46-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka hasebe-haruka","q":"hasebe haruka haruka arrives with the group at keyaki mall she arrives with miyake  yukimura and sakura and is suspicious about ayanokoji s conversation with ichinose  but drops it  suspicious about his talk with ichinose","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p46-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html#sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p46-1\">Haruka arrives with the group at Keyaki Mall<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.46–53<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She arrives with Miyake, Yukimura and Sakura and is suspicious about Ayanokōji&#x27;s conversation with Ichinose, but drops it.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Suspicious about his talk with Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y2v2-p12-2\">← Before: Hasebe tries to calm Yukimura<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p46-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ichinose meets ayanokoji at keyaki mall she bumps into ayanokoji at keyaki mall and congratulates him on the perfect score  kanzaki is suspicious and hostile   say  i ve seen your exam results  you actually got a perfect score in math  that s amazing  she defuses kanzaki s argument  then privately tells ayanokoji to trust his classmates and promises to protect him from expulsion   ayanokouji kun is not our enemy   class 1 b  the class that only you protected  that class doesn t exist anymore   i won t ever let you get expelled  pacifist but resolute   she stands up to kanzaki s hostility and reassures ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p46-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p46-1\">Ichinose meets Ayanokōji at Keyaki Mall<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.46–52<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She bumps into Ayanokōji at Keyaki Mall and congratulates him on the perfect score; Kanzaki is suspicious and hostile. She defuses Kanzaki&#x27;s argument, then privately tells Ayanokōji to trust his classmates and promises to protect him from expulsion.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Say, I&#x27;ve seen your exam results. You actually got a perfect score in math, that&#x27;s amazing!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji-kun is not our enemy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Class 1-B, the class that only you protected, that class doesn&#x27;t exist anymore.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I won&#x27;t ever let you get expelled.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Pacifist but resolute — she stands up to Kanzaki&#x27;s hostility and reassures Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.46–52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p47-1\">→ After: Ichinose at Keyaki Mall: praise and a warning<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p46-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji kanzaki confronts ayanokoji at keyaki mall he accompanies ichinose and is hostile toward ayanokoji  suspecting he is hiding more than math   his legs  his fighting strength   judging from last year s oaa  you shouldn t have the strength to get a full score   then  what else  is it just math  no  it can t be just math  sharp and on guard   he sees ayanokoji as a threat to class b s standing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p46-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html#sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p46-1\">Kanzaki confronts Ayanokōji at Keyaki Mall<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.46–49<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He accompanies Ichinose and is hostile toward Ayanokōji, suspecting he is hiding more than math — his legs, his fighting strength.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> &quot;Judging from last year&#x27;s OAA, you shouldn&#x27;t have the strength to get a full score.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> &quot;Then, what else? Is it just math? No, it can&#x27;t be just math.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sharp and on guard — he sees Ayanokōji as a threat to Class B&#x27;s standing.<span class=\"pg\">p.46–49<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p47-1\">→ After: Kanzaki&#x27;s hostility toward Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p47-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ichinose at keyaki mall  praise and a warning waiting at keyaki mall with kanzaki  bumps into ayanokoji and congratulates him on the perfect math score   ayanokouji kun  are you waiting for someone   you actually got a perfect score in math  that s amazing   ayanokouji kun is not our enemy   no matter what class it is  they ll have their own ideas  and of course  their own strategies   i want for you to trust your classmates  put their safety first and continue the fight   it s okay  i m definitely going to protect them  if there comes a time someone from my class has to leave  i think i will be the first one   y you  are really amazing  ayanokouji kun  pleasant to ayanokoji even after class b s fall  but still herself  choosing to trust  not merely ignoring kanzaki s warnings  vows she d be the first to leave rather than let a classmate be expelled  departs embarrassed but resolved to stay  her eyes lit with ayanokoji s  fire  defends him against kanzaki  receives his promise never to let her be expelled  and renews her resolve to protect her class  checks his hostility  insists ayanokoji isn t their enemy and stops his argument in a rare forceful tone","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p47-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p47-1\">Ichinose at Keyaki Mall: praise and a warning<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.47–52<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Waiting at Keyaki Mall with Kanzaki, bumps into Ayanokōji and congratulates him on the perfect math score.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji-kun, are you waiting for someone?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;You actually got a perfect score in math, that&#x27;s amazing!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji-kun is not our enemy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;No matter what class it is, they&#x27;ll have their own ideas, and of course, their own strategies.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I want for you to trust your classmates, put their safety first and continue the fight.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It&#x27;s okay. I&#x27;m definitely going to protect them. If there comes a time someone from my class has to leave, I think I will be the first one.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Y-you…. Are really amazing, Ayanokouji-kun…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Pleasant to Ayanokōji even after Class B&#x27;s fall, but still herself (choosing to trust, not merely ignoring Kanzaki&#x27;s warnings); vows she&#x27;d be the first to leave rather than let a classmate be expelled; departs embarrassed but resolved to stay, her eyes lit with Ayanokōji&#x27;s &quot;fire.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47–52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Defends him against Kanzaki, receives his promise never to let her be expelled, and renews her resolve to protect her class.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Checks his hostility; insists Ayanokōji isn&#x27;t their enemy and stops his argument in a rare forceful tone.<span class=\"pg\">p.48–50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p46-1\">← Before: Ichinose meets Ayanokōji at Keyaki Mall<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p203-1\">→ After: Ichinose meets Sakayanagi<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p47-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji kanzaki s hostility toward ayanokoji waiting with ichinose at keyaki mall  his gaze is fixed more on her than on ayanokoji   judging from last year s oaa  you shouldn t have the strength to get a full score   so you re saying that you ve been hiding it all this time  it looks like you re even more of an issue than i thought   what other abilities are you hiding   our overall scores in class c are much higher than that   it seems like i ve indeed lost my cool  openly suspicious and thorny   presses ayanokoji about the perfect score and other hidden abilities  argues class b can make up the points gap as a whole  and is stopped by ichinose s rare force  admits he lost his cool and leaves first  his reaction understandable given class b s fall to class c  views him as a hidden threat and potential enemy  rejects his explanation as incomplete  his classmate  her naivety frustrates him  but he accepts her criticism","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p47-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html#sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p47-1\">Kanzaki&#x27;s hostility toward Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.47–50<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Waiting with Ichinose at Keyaki Mall; his gaze is fixed more on her than on Ayanokōji.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> &quot;Judging from last year&#x27;s OAA, you shouldn&#x27;t have the strength to get a full score.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> &quot;So you&#x27;re saying that you&#x27;ve been hiding it all this time. It looks like you&#x27;re even more of an issue than I thought.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> &quot;What other abilities are you hiding?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Our overall scores in Class C are much higher than that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It seems like I&#x27;ve indeed lost my cool.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Openly suspicious and thorny — presses Ayanokōji about the perfect score and other hidden abilities, argues Class B can make up the points gap as a whole, and is stopped by Ichinose&#x27;s rare force; admits he lost his cool and leaves first, his reaction understandable given Class B&#x27;s fall to Class C.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Views him as a hidden threat and potential enemy; rejects his explanation as incomplete.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> His classmate; her naivety frustrates him, but he accepts her criticism.<span class=\"pg\">p.48–50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p46-1\">← Before: Kanzaki confronts Ayanokōji at Keyaki Mall<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p294-1\">→ After: Kanzaki asks Ayanokōji for help<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p53-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"hasebe-haruka sudou-ken ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the group after ichinose  sudo s questions  what were you talking about with ichinose san just now   my perfect score in math   so you were hiding the fact you re good at studying because of suzune s strategy  right   is the fact that you re good at fighting also a secret   that was the first time i ve ever felt scared in a fight  gives the group a sensible reason  notices haruka is  off  and doesn t ask further  declines to point out sudo s romantic view of horikita  admits sudo fought bravely against hosen  she asks about the ichinose conversation then quickly returns to her usual expression   something feels off  he accepts the explanation that he hid his ability for horikita s strategy  is more interested in his fighting secret  and describes hosen as a monster who scared him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p53-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p53-1\">The group after Ichinose; Sudō&#x27;s questions<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.53–56<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> &quot;What were you talking about with Ichinose-san just now?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;My perfect score in math.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;So you were hiding the fact you&#x27;re good at studying because of Suzune&#x27;s strategy, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;is the fact that you&#x27;re good at fighting also a secret?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.55<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That was the first time I&#x27;ve ever felt scared in a fight.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Gives the group a sensible reason; notices Haruka is &quot;off&quot; and doesn&#x27;t ask further; declines to point out Sudō&#x27;s romantic view of Horikita; admits Sudō fought bravely against Hōsen.<span class=\"pg\">p.53–56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> She asks about the Ichinose conversation then quickly returns to her usual expression — something feels off.<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> He accepts the explanation that he hid his ability for Horikita&#x27;s strategy, is more interested in his fighting secret, and describes Hōsen as a monster who scared him.<span class=\"pg\">p.54–56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p46-2\">← Before: Keyaki Mall: Ichinose and Kanzaki<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-1\">→ After: Ayanokōji and Horikita: the 20M bounty and Nagumo<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ayanokoji and horikita  the 20m bounty and nagumo he meets horikita at the lobby and they walk to school discussing the oaa results and the 20 million point bounty on his expulsion  they theorize it s not a school exam but a private bounty  possibly from nagumo   what do you think is the reason why the first years don t share information between them  horikita explains she is joining the student council to observe nagumo  he asks her to come with him to the meeting as evidence  analytical and cautious   he weighs multiple hypotheses about the bounty and supports horikita s council plan  they theorize together about the bounty and nagumo","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-1\">Ayanokōji and Horikita: the 20M bounty and Nagumo<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.65–74<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He meets Horikita at the lobby and they walk to school discussing the OAA results and the 20-million-point bounty on his expulsion; they theorize it&#x27;s not a school exam but a private bounty, possibly from Nagumo. Horikita explains she is joining the student council to observe Nagumo; he asks her to come with him to the meeting as evidence.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;What do you think is the reason why the first years don&#x27;t share information between them?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Analytical and cautious — he weighs multiple hypotheses about the bounty and supports Horikita&#x27;s council plan.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> They theorize together about the bounty and Nagumo.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–74<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p53-1\">← Before: The group after Ichinose; Sudō&#x27;s questions<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-2\">→ After: OAA updates; analyzing the 20-million bounty with Horikita<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune tsukishiro amasawa-ichika nagumo-miyabi ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka oaa updates  analyzing the 20 million bounty with horikita on a mid may morning waits for horikita  reviewing the updated oaa  his own academics jumped to a   81  from the perfect math score  overall b   62  sudo s academics rose to c  54  overall b   63  notes sudo s physical a   96  and amazing growth from a first year overall c  47    his overall now exceeds keisei and akito  others with low adaptability social scores all improved   thanks again  because of your quick witted speech  i didn t need to be baptized under the attentive eyes of my classmates for this to end    horikita  it s nothing  i just thought that it would be good for the class in the future   is your left hand alright now    horikita  not at all  i passed by housen and nanase once  but i didn t say anything   that  if someone gets you expelled  they get 20 million points  is that true    horikita  the other possibility is that it wasn t really a special exam  in other words  someone offered to pay 20 million private points in order to get me expelled  rules out a first year funded bounty  no trust capital  and reasons someone in the same or higher grade with 20 million points and first year trust is behind it  chabashira knew nothing  considers nagumo a possibility but doubts he d use unknown first years  notes nagumo s title would remove first years  doubts  feigns ignorance about what he d have done without horikita s intervention  appraises the brave first years who made a massive move without wavering  carefully hides that he has already secretly won chabashira to his side  walks to school with her  thanks her for the cover story  and reasons through the bounty together  she suspects nagumo  notes the white room student still hasn t acted    out of tsukishiro s control    and wonders what they re thinking  considers her almost certainly aware of the 20 million bounty  given she teamed with hosen  discusses him as a possible bounty source  plans for horikita to join the student council to investigate  and to observe his meritocratic reforms","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-2\">OAA updates; analyzing the 20-million bounty with Horikita<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.65–74<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On a mid-May morning waits for Horikita, reviewing the updated OAA: his own Academics jumped to A− (81) from the perfect math score, overall B− (62); Sudō&#x27;s Academics rose to C (54) overall B− (63).<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Thanks again. Because of your quick-witted speech, I didn&#x27;t need to be baptized under the attentive eyes of my classmates for this to end.&quot; — Horikita<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s nothing; I just thought that it would be good for the class in the future.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Is your left hand alright now?&quot; — Horikita<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Detail<\/span> Notes Sudō&#x27;s physical A+ (96) and amazing growth from a first-year overall C (47) — his overall now exceeds Keisei and Akito; others with low adaptability/social scores all improved.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Not at all. I passed by Housen and Nanase once, but I didn&#x27;t say anything.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That, if someone gets you expelled, they get 20 million points, is that true?&quot; — Horikita<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;The other possibility is that it wasn&#x27;t really a special exam. In other words, someone offered to pay 20 million private points in order to get me expelled.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> Rules out a first-year-funded bounty (no trust/capital) and reasons someone in the same or higher grade with 20 million points and first-year trust is behind it; Chabashira knew nothing; considers Nagumo a possibility but doubts he&#x27;d use unknown first-years; notes Nagumo&#x27;s title would remove first-years&#x27; doubts.<span class=\"pg\">p.70–73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Feigns ignorance about what he&#x27;d have done without Horikita&#x27;s intervention; appraises the brave first-years who made a massive move without wavering; carefully hides that he has already secretly won Chabashira to his side.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Walks to school with her, thanks her for the cover story, and reasons through the bounty together; she suspects Nagumo.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Notes the White Room student still hasn&#x27;t acted — &quot;out of Tsukishiro&#x27;s control&quot; — and wonders what they&#x27;re thinking.<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> Considers her almost certainly aware of the 20-million bounty, given she teamed with Hōsen.<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Discusses him as a possible bounty source; plans for Horikita to join the student council to investigate, and to observe his meritocratic reforms.<span class=\"pg\">p.71–74<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-1\">← Before: Ayanokōji and Horikita: the 20M bounty and Nagumo<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p72-1\">→ After: Why Horikita should join the student council<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p65-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita and ayanokoji theorize about the bounty she meets ayanokoji at the lobby and they walk to school  she confirms chabashira doesn t know about the bounty  and they theorize it s a private 20m point bounty  possibly connected to nagumo   could it be that president nagumo might have something to do with this  horikita explains she is joining the student council to observe nagumo s reforms  she asks ayanokoji to accompany her  analytical and determined   she works through the logic of the bounty and accepts the council role  they theorize together","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p65-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p65-1\">Horikita and Ayanokōji theorize about the bounty<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.65–74<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She meets Ayanokōji at the lobby and they walk to school; she confirms Chabashira doesn&#x27;t know about the bounty, and they theorize it&#x27;s a private 20M-point bounty, possibly connected to Nagumo. Horikita explains she is joining the student council to observe Nagumo&#x27;s reforms; she asks Ayanokōji to accompany her.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Could it be that President Nagumo might have something to do with this?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Analytical and determined — she works through the logic of the bounty and accepts the council role.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> They theorize together.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–74<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p27-1\">← Before: Horikita stays back to smooth things over<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p67-1\">→ After: Horikita joins the student council<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-wang-mei-yu-y2v2-p66-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"wang-mei-yu","q":"wang mei yu wang  mii chan  mentioned in passing named in the student council recruitment context  passing mention  not a distinct scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-wang-mei-yu-y2v2-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html#sc-wang-mei-yu-y2v2-p66-1\">Wang (Mii-chan) mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.66<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the student council recruitment context.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p67-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi horikita-manabu ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita joins the student council  sorry to keep you waiting   by the way  what would you have done if i hadn t been there at the time   i was troubled since the only member in the student council from the 2nd year was just honami    nagumo  horikita responds  i also want to walk the same path my brother has   that s right  just like the road my brother walked  i also want to become student council president   i don t think it s a distance that can t be recovered    on being a year behind ichinose  don t worry  i don t plan to graduate outside of class a  mixes truths to join the council   genuinely wants to follow manabu s path and become president  hiding that she lost the bet to ayanokoji  faces nagumo s lie detecting questions and commits to the goal without a hint of falsehood  becomes an official member and resolves to observe his reformist system with her own eyes  joins his student council  he calls her  suzune  and tells her past presidents graduated in class a  wants to walk the same path as her brother  nagumo notes she s a year behind ichinose in the quest for the presidency  she says the gap is recoverable  asked him to accompany her to the meeting  the narration notes part of horikita s answer about wanting to follow her brother was not from the heart   she covered her true reason  the bet  with several truths to blur nagumo s eyes","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p67-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p67-1\">Horikita joins the student council<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.67–80<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-manabu.html\">Horikita Manabu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Sorry to keep you waiting.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;By the way, what would you have done if I hadn&#x27;t been there at the time?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;I was troubled since the only member in the student council from the 2nd year was just Honami.&quot; — Nagumo; Horikita responds<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I also want to walk the same path my brother has.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That&#x27;s right. Just like the road my brother walked, I also want to become student council president.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I don&#x27;t think it&#x27;s a distance that can&#x27;t be recovered.&quot; — on being a year behind Ichinose<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Don&#x27;t worry. I don&#x27;t plan to graduate outside of Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Mixes truths to join the council — genuinely wants to follow Manabu&#x27;s path and become president, hiding that she lost the bet to Ayanokōji; faces Nagumo&#x27;s lie-detecting questions and commits to the goal without a hint of falsehood; becomes an official member and resolves to observe his reformist system with her own eyes.<span class=\"pg\">p.67–80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Joins his student council; he calls her &quot;Suzune&quot; and tells her past presidents graduated in Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.75–80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Manabu<\/b> Wants to walk the same path as her brother.<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Nagumo notes she&#x27;s a year behind Ichinose in the quest for the presidency; she says the gap is recoverable.<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Asked him to accompany her to the meeting.<span class=\"pg\">p.72–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The narration notes part of Horikita&#x27;s answer about wanting to follow her brother was not from the heart — she covered her true reason (the bet) with several truths to blur Nagumo&#x27;s eyes.<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p65-1\">← Before: Horikita and Ayanokōji theorize about the bounty<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p75-1\">→ After: Horikita joins the student council<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p72-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-manabu horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka why horikita should join the student council  i m preparing after school to go to the student council  and ask president nagumo about joining it    horikita  that s not the only reason  right   what your brother thinks is completely different from what nagumo thinks   now  i just want to see nagumo s reforms   if nagumo is going in the wrong direction  there s a need to stop him   will you come with me    horikita explains manabu valued tradition and opposed nagumo s reforms  the class is a community that should share the same fate  refuses to judge who s right  wanting only to observe   but would have horikita  manabu s sister  stop nagumo if needed  won her compliance via their bet  his values  tradition  shared class fate  differ from nagumo s  ayanokoji relays manabu s words from before graduation  she asks him to accompany her to the nagumo meeting as evidence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p72-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p72-1\">Why Horikita should join the student council<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.72–74<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-manabu.html\">Horikita Manabu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m preparing after school to go to the student council, and ask President Nagumo about joining it.&quot; — Horikita<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;that&#x27;s not the only reason, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;What your brother thinks is completely different from what Nagumo thinks.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Now, I just want to see Nagumo&#x27;s reforms.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If Nagumo is going in the wrong direction, there&#x27;s a need to stop him.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;will you come with me?&quot; — Horikita<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Explains Manabu valued tradition and opposed Nagumo&#x27;s reforms (&quot;the class is a community that should share the same fate&quot;); refuses to judge who&#x27;s right, wanting only to observe — but would have Horikita (Manabu&#x27;s sister) stop Nagumo if needed; won her compliance via their bet.<span class=\"pg\">p.72–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Manabu<\/b> His values (tradition, shared class fate) differ from Nagumo&#x27;s; Ayanokōji relays Manabu&#x27;s words from before graduation.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She asks him to accompany her to the Nagumo meeting as evidence.<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p65-2\">← Before: OAA updates; analyzing the 20-million bounty with Horikita<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-1\">→ After: Student council meeting: Horikita joins, Nagumo&#x27;s challenge<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi kiriyama-ikuto ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka student council meeting  horikita joins  nagumo s challenge horikita requests to join the student council  nagumo accepts with a condition and warns her that past presidents graduated in class a   i want to join the student council  nagumo invites ayanokoji to join too  he declines  then tells him to look forward to playing together in summer  kiriyama is shaken by nagumo s probing   i ll play with you  so look forward to it  he observes nagumo s power dynamics and stays uncommitted  nagumo challenges him directly  kiriyama is shaken by nagumo","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-1\">Student council meeting: Horikita joins, Nagumo&#x27;s challenge<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.75–82<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Horikita requests to join the student council; Nagumo accepts with a condition and warns her that past presidents graduated in Class A. Nagumo invites Ayanokōji to join too (he declines), then tells him to look forward to playing together in summer; Kiriyama is shaken by Nagumo&#x27;s probing.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I want to join the student council.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ll play with you, so look forward to it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He observes Nagumo&#x27;s power dynamics and stays uncommitted.<span class=\"pg\">p.75–82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Nagumo challenges him directly.<span class=\"pg\">p.79–82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> Kiriyama is shaken by Nagumo.<span class=\"pg\">p.82<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p72-1\">← Before: Why Horikita should join the student council<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-2\">→ After: The Nagumo meeting; Horikita joins; Nagumo&#x27;s challenge<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi horikita-suzune kiriyama ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the nagumo meeting  horikita joins  nagumo s challenge accompanies horikita to the student council office  nagumo  president  and kiriyama  vice president  react with surprise to her request to join   well  what a turn of events  i don t really want to obediently say yes   welcome to the student council  from today onward  i want you to work for me as a member of the council without any worries  suzune   as a congratulations for joining  i ll tell you something interesting  the past presidents of the student council have always graduated in class a   don t worry  i don t plan to graduate outside of class a   are you going to join the student council by the way  ayanokouji   i ll pass  my personality isn t suited to being on the council   i ll play with you  so look forward to it  observes nagumo see through horikita s half truths yet accept her  open to anyone  unlike manabu  declines nagumo s casual invitation  reads his parting  i ll play with you  as  an order from the strong to the weak  he invites him to the council and declares he ll  play  with him over summer   a veiled challenge  vice president  surprised at nagumo inviting ayanokoji  shakes horikita s hand","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-2\">The Nagumo meeting; Horikita joins; Nagumo&#x27;s challenge<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.75–81<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Accompanies Horikita to the student council office; Nagumo (president) and Kiriyama (vice president) react with surprise to her request to join.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama.html\">Kiriyama<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;Well, what a turn of events! I don&#x27;t really want to obediently say yes.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;Welcome to the student council. From today onward, I want you to work for me as a member of the council without any worries, Suzune.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;As a congratulations for joining, I&#x27;ll tell you something interesting. The past presidents of the student council have always graduated in Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Don&#x27;t worry. I don&#x27;t plan to graduate outside of Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Are you going to join the student council by the way? Ayanokouji.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;ll pass, my personality isn&#x27;t suited to being on the council.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;ll play with you, so look forward to it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Observes Nagumo see through Horikita&#x27;s half-truths yet accept her (open to anyone, unlike Manabu); declines Nagumo&#x27;s casual invitation; reads his parting &quot;I&#x27;ll play with you&quot; as &quot;an order from the strong to the weak.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75–81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> He invites him to the council and declares he&#x27;ll &quot;play&quot; with him over summer — a veiled challenge.<span class=\"pg\">p.75–81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> Vice president; surprised at Nagumo inviting Ayanokōji; shakes Horikita&#x27;s hand.<span class=\"pg\">p.78, 80<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-1\">← Before: Student council meeting: Horikita joins, Nagumo&#x27;s challenge<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p83-1\">→ After: Kei&#x27;s visit and Amasawa&#x27;s intrusion<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p75-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita joins the student council she requests membership  nagumo accepts with a condition  warning her that past presidents graduated in class a  she declares her ambition to become president   i want to join the student council   don t worry  i don t plan to graduate outside of class a  bold and direct   she challenges nagumo s condition head on","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p75-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p75-1\">Horikita joins the student council<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.75–78<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She requests membership; Nagumo accepts with a condition, warning her that past presidents graduated in Class A; she declares her ambition to become president.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;I want to join the student council.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Don&#x27;t worry. I don&#x27;t plan to graduate outside of Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Bold and direct — she challenges Nagumo&#x27;s condition head-on.<span class=\"pg\">p.75–78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p67-1\">← Before: Horikita joins the student council<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-1\">→ After: Horikita reacts to the island exam rules<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v2-p75-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka nagumo-miyabi","q":"nagumo miyabi nagumo accepts horikita and challenges ayanokoji he accepts horikita into the student council with a condition  warning her that past presidents graduated in class a  he invites ayanokoji to join too  declined   well  what a turn of events  i don t really want to obediently say yes  he tells ayanokoji to look forward to playing together in summer  then probes kiriyama about why he attended   i ll play with you  so look forward to it  calculating and playful   he tests both horikita and ayanokoji while keeping kiriyama off balance  accepts her into the council  challenges him directly","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v2-p75-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html#sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v2-p75-1\">Nagumo accepts Horikita and challenges Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.75–82<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He accepts Horikita into the student council with a condition, warning her that past presidents graduated in Class A; he invites Ayanokōji to join too (declined). He tells Ayanokōji to look forward to playing together in summer, then probes Kiriyama about why he attended.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;Well, what a turn of events! I don&#x27;t really want to obediently say yes.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ll play with you, so look forward to it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calculating and playful — he tests both Horikita and Ayanokōji while keeping Kiriyama off balance.<span class=\"pg\">p.75–82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Accepts her into the council.<span class=\"pg\">p.75–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Challenges him directly.<span class=\"pg\">p.79–82<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v2-p75-2\">→ After: Nagumo admits Horikita; challenges Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v2-p75-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka horikita-manabu kiriyama nagumo-miyabi","q":"nagumo miyabi nagumo admits horikita  challenges ayanokoji in the student council office  receives horikita and ayanokoji  welcomes the conversation but invites her straight to the point   so what did you want to talk to me about  you didn t come just to talk  right   well  what a turn of events  i don t really want to obediently say yes   in other words  can i assume that you have the intention to become the student council president   she doesn t look that similar to him  but she really is horikita senpai s little sister   welcome to the student council  from today onward  i want you to work for me as a member of the council without any worries  suzune   then show me that isn t just all talk   are you going to join the student council by the way  ayanokouji   i knew you would say that   i ll play with you  so look forward to it   sakayanagi  ichinose  ryuuen  those people would probably cry from the joy  meritocratic and open  admits anyone to the council regardless of reason  unlike manabu  with a sharp eye for lies   sees through horikita s half truths but values her ambition  after she joins  pivots to ayanokoji  inviting him then declaring he ll  play  with him over summer    an order from the strong to the weak  questions her closely  welcomes her to the council  calls her  suzune  and motivates her to aim for class a  invites him to the council  he declines  then issues a veiled challenge  horikita s brother  whose traditions he replaced with reforms  his vice president  who reacts with surprise at his invitation to ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v2-p75-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html#sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v2-p75-2\">Nagumo admits Horikita; challenges Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.75–81<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In the student council office, receives Horikita and Ayanokōji; welcomes the conversation but invites her straight to the point.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-manabu.html\">Horikita Manabu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama.html\">Kiriyama<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;So what did you want to talk to me about? You didn&#x27;t come just to talk, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;Well, what a turn of events! I don&#x27;t really want to obediently say yes.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> &quot;In other words, can I assume that you have the intention to become the student council president?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>12 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;She doesn&#x27;t look that similar to him, but she really is Horikita-senpai&#x27;s little sister!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Welcome to the student council. From today onward, I want you to work for me as a member of the council without any worries, Suzune.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Then show me that isn&#x27;t just all talk.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Are you going to join the student council by the way? Ayanokouji.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I knew you would say that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;ll play with you, so look forward to it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Sakayanagi, Ichinose, Ryuuen. Those people would probably cry from the joy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Meritocratic and open (admits anyone to the council regardless of reason, unlike Manabu), with a sharp eye for lies — sees through Horikita&#x27;s half-truths but values her ambition; after she joins, pivots to Ayanokōji, inviting him then declaring he&#x27;ll &quot;play&quot; with him over summer — &quot;an order from the strong to the weak.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75–81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Questions her closely, welcomes her to the council, calls her &quot;Suzune,&quot; and motivates her to aim for Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.75–80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Invites him to the council (he declines), then issues a veiled challenge.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Manabu<\/b> Horikita&#x27;s brother, whose traditions he replaced with reforms.<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> His vice president, who reacts with surprise at his invitation to Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.78, 80<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y2v2-p75-1\">← Before: Nagumo accepts Horikita and challenges Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiriyama-y2v2-p78-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiriyama","q":"kiriyama kiriyama  the student council vice president present in the student council office during horikita s joining  breaks his silence after nagumo s questioning   she doesn t look that similar to him  but she really is horikita senpai s little sister   i m kiriyama  the vice president   what are you thinking  nagumo  you would even invite him into the council  as ayanokoji leaves  nagumo pointedly asks why kiriyama showed up today when he ignored the first years  request to join  kiriyama is shaken but answers calmly  his voice sharp with nervousness   by the way  kiriyama  why did you get involved with this today   i just was interested in horikita senpai s little sister  anything wrong with that  the vice president   observant  notes horikita s resemblance to her brother  polite  shakes her hand  and surprised at nagumo s unusual invitation to ayanokoji  his nervousness at being questioned about why he attended betrays an undisclosed motive  his president  surprised by his openness  and uneasy when nagumo calls out his attendance  welcomes her as a new council member  uses her as his stated reason for attending  is startled that nagumo would invite him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiriyama-y2v2-p78-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama.html#sc-kiriyama-y2v2-p78-1\">Kiriyama, the student council vice president<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.78–82<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama.html\">Kiriyama<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Present in the student council office during Horikita&#x27;s joining; breaks his silence after Nagumo&#x27;s questioning. As Ayanokōji leaves, Nagumo pointedly asks why Kiriyama showed up today when he ignored the first-years&#x27; request to join; Kiriyama is shaken but answers calmly, his voice sharp with nervousness.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> &quot;She doesn&#x27;t look that similar to him, but she really is Horikita-senpai&#x27;s little sister!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;m Kiriyama, the Vice President.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> &quot;What are you thinking, Nagumo? You would even invite him into the council?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;By the way, Kiriyama, why did you get involved with this today?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I just was interested in Horikita-senpai&#x27;s little sister, anything wrong with that?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> The vice president — observant (notes Horikita&#x27;s resemblance to her brother), polite (shakes her hand), and surprised at Nagumo&#x27;s unusual invitation to Ayanokōji; his nervousness at being questioned about why he attended betrays an undisclosed motive.<span class=\"pg\">p.78–82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> His president; surprised by his openness, and uneasy when Nagumo calls out his attendance.<span class=\"pg\">p.78–82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Welcomes her as a new council member; uses her as his stated reason for attending.<span class=\"pg\">p.78–82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Is startled that Nagumo would invite him.<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiriyama-y2v2-p271-1\">→ After: Kiriyama: &quot;don&#x27;t get in my way&quot; at Keyaki Mall<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v2-p78-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi kiriyama-ikuto","q":"kiriyama ikuto kiriyama attends the council meeting and is shaken he attends horikita s council meeting  nagumo probes why he came  and kiriyama nervously claims he was just interested in horikita s sister   i just was interested in horikita senpai s little sister  anything wrong with that  nervous and on edge   the battle with nagumo is already settled against him  nagumo probes him  he is shaken","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v2-p78-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html#sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v2-p78-1\">Kiriyama attends the council meeting and is shaken<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.78–82<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He attends Horikita&#x27;s council meeting; Nagumo probes why he came, and Kiriyama nervously claims he was just interested in Horikita&#x27;s sister.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> &quot;I just was interested in Horikita-senpai&#x27;s little sister, anything wrong with that?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.82<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Nervous and on edge — the battle with Nagumo is already settled against him.<span class=\"pg\">p.78–82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Nagumo probes him; he is shaken.<span class=\"pg\">p.82<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v2-p272-1\">→ After: Kiriyama warns Ayanokōji about Horikita<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p83-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei amasawa-ichika ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka kei s visit and amasawa s intrusion kei messages him and comes to his room  they study  talk  and nearly kiss before the doorbell rings  amasawa arrives with ingredients  forces her way in by threatening to reveal his relationship with kei  she teases them about sex and gives kei a contraceptive as a  gift   senpai  you look like you are alone anyway  so cook for me   did you lie to me because you didn t want me to come into the room   i thought you would have an illicit sexual relationship for sure  i mean having sex   take this as a gift from me  no  take it as an apology  he is cautious and strategic  weighing risks of exposure  he admits defeat to amasawa s leverage  they nearly kiss  their relationship is threatened by exposure  she forces entry and teases them  he concedes","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p83-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p83-1\">Kei&#x27;s visit and Amasawa&#x27;s intrusion<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.83–108<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kei messages him and comes to his room; they study, talk, and nearly kiss before the doorbell rings. Amasawa arrives with ingredients, forces her way in by threatening to reveal his relationship with Kei; she teases them about sex and gives Kei a contraceptive as a &quot;gift.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Senpai, you look like you are alone anyway, so cook for me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Did you lie to me because you didn&#x27;t want me to come into the room?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.97<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I thought you would have an illicit sexual relationship for sure… I mean having sex.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Take this as a gift from me… No, take it as an apology.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is cautious and strategic, weighing risks of exposure; he admits defeat to Amasawa&#x27;s leverage.<span class=\"pg\">p.83–108<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> They nearly kiss; their relationship is threatened by exposure.<span class=\"pg\">p.83–91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> She forces entry and teases them; he concedes.<span class=\"pg\">p.92–108<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p75-2\">← Before: The Nagumo meeting; Horikita joins; Nagumo&#x27;s challenge<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p110-1\">→ After: Mid-June morning: Nanase&#x27;s apology and the ongoing bounty<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p83-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka amasawa-ichika karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei visits ayanokoji s room she messages him and comes to his room  they study  talk  and nearly kiss before the doorbell rings   i ll come  amasawa arrives and forces her way in  kei is angry and anxious about exposure   well isn t that normal  anyway  why did you come here all of a sudden  affectionate and vulnerable   she nearly kisses him  then is rattled by amasawa s intrusion  they nearly kiss  their secret relationship is threatened  amasawa teases her and threatens exposure","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p83-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p83-1\">Kei visits Ayanokōji&#x27;s room<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.83–91<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She messages him and comes to his room; they study, talk, and nearly kiss before the doorbell rings. Amasawa arrives and forces her way in; Kei is angry and anxious about exposure.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ll come!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.85<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Well isn&#x27;t that normal! Anyway, why did you come here all of a sudden!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.90<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Affectionate and vulnerable — she nearly kisses him, then is rattled by Amasawa&#x27;s intrusion.<span class=\"pg\">p.83–91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> They nearly kiss; their secret relationship is threatened.<span class=\"pg\">p.83–91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> Amasawa teases her and threatens exposure.<span class=\"pg\">p.87–91<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p15-1\">← Before: Karuizawa&#x27;s &quot;math genius&quot; theory and the argument<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p100-1\">→ After: Karuizawa and Amasawa in Ayanokōji&#x27;s room<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p92-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei amasawa-ichika","q":"amasawa ichika amasawa forces her way in and teases kei she arrives at ayanokoji s door with ingredients  demands entry  and reveals she watched kei enter his room   senpai  you look like you are alone anyway  so cook for me   did you lie to me because you didn t want me to come into the room  she enters  teases them about sex  and gives kei a contraceptive as a  gift  and apology for her role in the hosen attack   i thought you would have an illicit sexual relationship for sure  i mean having sex   take this as a gift from me  no  take it as an apology   i m not ayanokouji senpai s enemy  playful  shameless  and calculating   she uses leverage to force entry and gathers intelligence  she pressures him and he concedes  she teases kei and threatens exposure","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p92-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html#sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p92-1\">Amasawa forces her way in and teases Kei<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.92–108<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She arrives at Ayanokōji&#x27;s door with ingredients, demands entry, and reveals she watched Kei enter his room. She enters, teases them about sex, and gives Kei a contraceptive as a &quot;gift&quot; and apology for her role in the Hōsen attack.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;Senpai, you look like you are alone anyway, so cook for me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;Did you lie to me because you didn&#x27;t want me to come into the room?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.97<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;I thought you would have an illicit sexual relationship for sure… I mean having sex.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Take this as a gift from me… No, take it as an apology.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m not Ayanokouji-senpai&#x27;s enemy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.102<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playful, shameless, and calculating — she uses leverage to force entry and gathers intelligence.<span class=\"pg\">p.92–108<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She pressures him and he concedes.<span class=\"pg\">p.92–108<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> She teases Kei and threatens exposure.<span class=\"pg\">p.98–108<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p6-1\">← Before: Amasawa: White Room prologue (her POV)<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p100-1\">→ After: Amasawa&#x27;s visit: the condom &quot;gift&quot; and her hints<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p100-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei amasawa-ichika","q":"amasawa ichika amasawa s visit  the condom  gift  and her hints visits ayanokoji s room  where he and karuizawa were studying  teasing them about an illicit sexual relationship  then places a contraceptive on the table as a supposed gift and apology   i thought you would have an illicit sexual relationship for sure  i mean having sex   take this as a gift from me  no  take it as an apology   quit playing dumb  the wound on your hand  i had a part in that right  because i teamed up with housen   i m not ayanokouji senpai s enemy   ayanokouji senpai  haven t you told your girlfriend about that  then what about the 20 million point bounty   because senpai suddenly had a bounty for his head  and i thought that it was a pity that you would be expelled without even knowing the situation   go make a cup of coffee for amasawa    ayanokoji  she piles on requests  don t put garbage or sewage into my coffee because you don t like me   let s see  hmmm  what was the convention adopted at the general conference of the united nations educational  scientific and cultural organization in 1972    she correctly writes  world heritage convention  playful  shameless and razor sharp   probes the couple mercilessly  openly admits her role in the knife plot  claims she isn t his enemy  and reveals she left a deliberate  trace   her instant choice of the knife at the store  so ayanokoji could defend himself  answers a college level question with ease and has karuizawa make her coffee purely to tease her  then leaves without drinking it  admits helping hosen  claims not to be his enemy  and leaves clues that raise ayanokoji s vigilance that she could be the white room student  teases her mercilessly about the relationship  has her make coffee  with milk and sugar  and writes in her notebook  karuizawa shows undisguised disgust","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p100-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html#sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p100-1\">Amasawa&#x27;s visit: the condom &quot;gift&quot; and her hints<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.100–107<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Visits Ayanokōji&#x27;s room (where he and Karuizawa were studying), teasing them about an illicit sexual relationship, then places a contraceptive on the table as a supposed gift and apology.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;I thought you would have an illicit sexual relationship for sure… I mean having sex.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;Take this as a gift from me… No, take it as an apology.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.101<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;Quit playing dumb, the wound on your hand, I had a part in that right? Because I teamed up with Housen.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.101<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m not Ayanokouji-senpai&#x27;s enemy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.102<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ayanokouji-senpai, haven&#x27;t you told your girlfriend about that? Then what about the 20 million point bounty?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Because senpai suddenly had a bounty for his head, and I thought that it was a pity that you would be expelled without even knowing the situation.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.104<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Go make a cup of coffee for Amasawa.&quot; — Ayanokōji; she piles on requests<span class=\"pg\">p.105<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Don&#x27;t put garbage or sewage into my coffee because you don&#x27;t like me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.105<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Let&#x27;s see, hmmm? What was the convention adopted at the General Conference of the United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organization in 1972?&quot; — she correctly writes &quot;World Heritage Convention&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playful, shameless and razor-sharp — probes the couple mercilessly, openly admits her role in the knife plot, claims she isn&#x27;t his enemy, and reveals she left a deliberate &quot;trace&quot; (her instant choice of the knife at the store) so Ayanokōji could defend himself; answers a college-level question with ease and has Karuizawa make her coffee purely to tease her, then leaves without drinking it.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Admits helping Hōsen, claims not to be his enemy, and leaves clues that raise Ayanokōji&#x27;s vigilance that she could be the White Room student.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Teases her mercilessly about the relationship, has her make coffee (with milk and sugar), and writes in her notebook; Karuizawa shows undisguised disgust.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–107<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p92-1\">← Before: Amasawa forces her way in and teases Kei<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p345-1\">→ After: Short story: &quot;What is Reflected in Her Eyes&quot; — staking out Karuizawa<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p100-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"narration spoken","w":"amasawa-ichika ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei karuizawa and amasawa in ayanokoji s room studying with ayanokoji when amasawa arrives  she becomes angry  afraid amasawa will expose their secret relationship  but is lost for words at the lewd questions   i thought you would have an illicit sexual relationship for sure  i mean having sex  amasawa openly reveals she helped hosen with the knife plot and mentions the 20 million bounty   information ayanokoji hadn t told karuizawa  karuizawa is startled and asks what it means   wa wait a minute  you said you were going to get kiyotaka expelled  what does that mean   hey  don t go writing in my notebooks without permission   not at all   huh  what do you mean  not drinking  you told me to make it though  jealous  suspicious and short tempered   fears amasawa will expose the relationship  is goaded into making her coffee  with milk and sugar  rather than talk with her  warns her off her notebook  and is openly disgusted by amasawa s teasing  hostile toward her  learns she helped hosen and is forced to serve her coffee  his girlfriend  learns new details about the bounty and the knife plot from amasawa","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p100-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p100-1\">Karuizawa and Amasawa in Ayanokōji&#x27;s room<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.100–107<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Studying with Ayanokōji when Amasawa arrives; she becomes angry (afraid Amasawa will expose their secret relationship) but is lost for words at the lewd questions.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Wa-wait a minute. You said you were going to get Kiyotaka expelled… What does that mean?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.102<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Hey! Don&#x27;t go writing in my notebooks without permission!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Not at all!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;I thought you would have an illicit sexual relationship for sure… I mean having sex.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Amasawa openly reveals she helped Hōsen with the knife plot and mentions the 20-million bounty — information Ayanokōji hadn&#x27;t told Karuizawa; Karuizawa is startled and asks what it means.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Huh? What do you mean? Not drinking? You told me to make it though?!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Jealous, suspicious and short-tempered — fears Amasawa will expose the relationship, is goaded into making her coffee (with milk and sugar) rather than talk with her, warns her off her notebook, and is openly disgusted by Amasawa&#x27;s teasing.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> Hostile toward her; learns she helped Hōsen and is forced to serve her coffee.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> His girlfriend; learns new details about the bounty and the knife plot from Amasawa.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–107<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p83-1\">← Before: Kei visits Ayanokōji&#x27;s room<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p198-1\">→ After: Kei asks to group up with Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p110-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"nanase-tsubasa housen-kazuomi karuizawa-kei ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka mid june morning  nanase s apology and the ongoing bounty walking to school looking at the blue sky  is greeted by nanase  who may have deliberately waited for him  reflects summer is his favorite season and that the white room student still hasn t moved   i ve always felt sorry for what i did to you  ayanokouji senpai   senpai  do you hate me   i don t have any reason to hate you  it was for the special exam  right   besides  i saw how you were trying to protect me  nanase   no  the exam is still going on  the deadline is the start of the second semester   because of what happened last time  i m convinced that even with a plan  it might not work out that easily   and since even someone like housen failed  people judged that it wouldn t work out without good preparation  reasons it was fortunate hosen  who attracts all the attention  was the first to act  the other three first year classes now know of the bounty and are waiting to act with preparation  decides not to press nanase  she can t betray the insiders and only admitted the exam s existence to avoid disadvantaging class 1 d  recalls that he and kei still haven t kissed again   an  invisible wall  from the knife incident   but doesn t rush  letting her remove it naturally for her growth  notes nanase has shed her naivety and speaks of living  without regrets  she apologizes  reveals the bounty runs until second semester and that hosen has grown  more well behaved  toward first years  focusing on ayanokoji  and warns him not to leave regrets  now fixated on ayanokoji  let me fight the 2nd years  his attention shifted from first years  which helped them  still hasn t kissed again after the knife incident","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p110-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p110-1\">Mid-June morning: Nanase&#x27;s apology and the ongoing bounty<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.110–116<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Walking to school looking at the blue sky, is greeted by Nanase, who may have deliberately waited for him; reflects summer is his favorite season and that the White Room student still hasn&#x27;t moved.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/housen-kazuomi.html\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ve always felt sorry for what I did to you, Ayanokouji-senpai.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;Senpai, do you hate me?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I don&#x27;t have any reason to hate you. It was for the special exam, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Besides, I saw how you were trying to protect me, Nanase.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;No, the exam is still going on. The deadline is the start of the second semester.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Because of what happened last time, I&#x27;m convinced that even with a plan, it might not work out that easily.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.113<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;And since even someone like Housen failed, people judged that it wouldn&#x27;t work out without good preparation?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.113<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> Reasons it was fortunate Hōsen (who attracts all the attention) was the first to act; the other three first-year classes now know of the bounty and are waiting to act with preparation; decides not to press Nanase (she can&#x27;t betray the insiders and only admitted the exam&#x27;s existence to avoid disadvantaging Class 1-D).<span class=\"pg\">p.112–114<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Recalls that he and Kei still haven&#x27;t kissed again — an &quot;invisible wall&quot; from the knife incident — but doesn&#x27;t rush, letting her remove it naturally for her growth; notes Nanase has shed her naivety and speaks of living &quot;without regrets.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.110–116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> She apologizes, reveals the bounty runs until second semester and that Hōsen has grown &quot;more well-behaved&quot; toward first-years (focusing on Ayanokōji), and warns him not to leave regrets.<span class=\"pg\">p.111–116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/b> Now fixated on Ayanokōji (&quot;Let me fight the 2nd years&quot;); his attention shifted from first-years, which helped them.<span class=\"pg\">p.115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Still hasn&#x27;t kissed again after the knife incident.<span class=\"pg\">p.110<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p83-1\">← Before: Kei&#x27;s visit and Amasawa&#x27;s intrusion<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p111-1\">→ After: Nanase walks him to school; 1st-year exam results<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p111-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"nanase-tsubasa ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka nanase walks him to school  1st year exam results nanase greets him on the way to school and apologizes for the expulsion attempt  she reveals the special exam is still active until the second semester  that class 1 d placed third in their second exam  and that hosen is now focused on fighting 2nd years   i ve always felt sorry for what i did to you  ayanokouji senpai   one boy dropped out of class c in the first year   you must not leave any regrets in your school life as well  ayanokouji senpai  he is cautious but fair   he doesn t hate nanase and accepts her apology  she walks with him and shares 1st year intelligence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p111-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p111-1\">Nanase walks him to school; 1st-year exam results<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.111–116<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Nanase greets him on the way to school and apologizes for the expulsion attempt; she reveals the special exam is still active until the second semester, that Class 1-D placed third in their second exam, and that Hōsen is now focused on fighting 2nd years.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ve always felt sorry for what I did to you, Ayanokouji-senpai.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;One boy dropped out of Class C in the first year.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;You must not leave any regrets in your school life as well, Ayanokouji-senpai&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is cautious but fair — he doesn&#x27;t hate Nanase and accepts her apology.<span class=\"pg\">p.111–116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> She walks with him and shares 1st-year intelligence.<span class=\"pg\">p.111–116<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p110-1\">← Before: Mid-June morning: Nanase&#x27;s apology and the ongoing bounty<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-1\">→ After: Chabashira announces the uninhabited island survival exam<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v2-p111-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka nanase-tsubasa","q":"nanase tsubasa nanase walks with ayanokoji to school she greets him on the way to school  apologizes for the expulsion attempt  and shares 1st year intelligence  the special exam is still active until the second semester  class 1 d placed third in their second exam  and hosen is now focused on fighting 2nd years   i ve always felt sorry for what i did to you  ayanokouji senpai   one boy dropped out of class c in the first year   you must not leave any regrets in your school life as well  ayanokouji senpai  mature and remorseful   she has shed her naivety and fits in well with the school  she walks with him and shares intelligence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v2-p111-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html#sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v2-p111-1\">Nanase walks with Ayanokōji to school<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.111–116<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She greets him on the way to school, apologizes for the expulsion attempt, and shares 1st-year intelligence: the special exam is still active until the second semester, Class 1-D placed third in their second exam, and Hōsen is now focused on fighting 2nd years.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ve always felt sorry for what I did to you, Ayanokouji-senpai.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;One boy dropped out of Class C in the first year.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;You must not leave any regrets in your school life as well, Ayanokouji-senpai&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Mature and remorseful — she has shed her naivety and fits in well with the school.<span class=\"pg\">p.111–116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She walks with him and shares intelligence.<span class=\"pg\">p.111–116<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v2-p336-1\">→ After: Tsukishiro reveals Nanase as the enforcer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka chabashira announces the uninhabited island survival exam chabashira announces the summer special exam  two weeks on an uninhabited island  all school years competing  with a luxury cruise afterward  groups of up to 6 can form  with gender ratios   you will have to participate in the  uninhabited island survival  special exam and compete with each other  she explains the small group rules  max 3 per same year group  2 3 gender ratio  and that groups can t be switched after forming  he listens carefully  noting the rules and strategizing  she announces the exam","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-1\">Chabashira announces the uninhabited island survival exam<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.117–128<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Chabashira announces the summer special exam: two weeks on an uninhabited island, all school years competing, with a luxury cruise afterward; groups of up to 6 can form, with gender ratios. She explains the small-group rules (max 3 per same-year group, 2:3 gender ratio) and that groups can&#x27;t be switched after forming.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;You will have to participate in the &quot;Uninhabited Island Survival&quot; special exam and compete with each other.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He listens carefully, noting the rules and strategizing.<span class=\"pg\">p.117–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> She announces the exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.117–128<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p111-1\">← Before: Nanase walks him to school; 1st-year exam results<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-2\">→ After: The island survival exam announced; rules<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the island survival exam announced  rules in homeroom  chabashira teases a luxury cruise  aug 4 11  before revealing the  uninhabited island survival  special exam   bigger  two weeks  all school years competing together   you will have to participate in the  uninhabited island survival  special exam and compete with each other   the exam this year is very different from the previous one  it s probably going to be tougher and more unforgiving than any other special exam before   not all the rules will be made public today   a maximum of 6 people to form a big group to work with each other   which means  the students in the 2nd year  are our allies  small groups of up to 3  2nd 3rd years  or 4  1st years  same year only  formed by july 16  mixed gender groups need  2 girls per 3  50  in big groups  groups can t change  big groups of up to 6 form after the exam starts  the exam requires all abilities  academic  physical  mental  communication  if a member drops out the group continues   the more people  the more chances to survive  rewards  1st place 300 class points   1m private   1 protection point  2nd 200   500k  3rd 100   250k  top 50  50k  top 70  10k   collected from bottom groups  years  split by class  notices chabashira dangles the cruise then yanks it back   a tactic that works because the class has learned how to brace itself  realizes rewards penalties are given by group per class  so a mixed class winning group won t change standings  delivers the exam briefing  he notes she wants class d to prove they re different from a year ago","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-2\">The island survival exam announced; rules<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.117–132<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In homeroom, Chabashira teases a luxury cruise (Aug 4–11) before revealing the &quot;Uninhabited Island Survival&quot; special exam — bigger, two weeks, all school years competing together.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;You will have to participate in the &#x27;Uninhabited Island Survival&#x27; special exam and compete with each other.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;the exam this year is very different from the previous one. It&#x27;s probably going to be tougher and more unforgiving than any other special exam before.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;not all the rules will be made public today.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;a maximum of 6 people to form a big group to work with each other.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Which means… the students in the 2nd year, are our allies…?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Small groups of up to 3 (2nd/3rd years) or 4 (1st years), same-year only, formed by July 16; mixed-gender groups need ≥2 girls per 3 (≥50% in big groups); groups can&#x27;t change; big groups of up to 6 form after the exam starts.<span class=\"pg\">p.125–127<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> The exam requires all abilities (academic, physical, mental, communication); if a member drops out the group continues — the more people, the more chances to survive.<span class=\"pg\">p.128–130<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Numbers<\/span> Rewards: 1st place 300 class points + 1M private + 1 Protection Point; 2nd 200 + 500k; 3rd 100 + 250k; top 50% 50k, top 70% 10k — collected from bottom groups&#x27; years, split by class.<span class=\"pg\">p.130–131<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Notices Chabashira dangles the cruise then yanks it back — a tactic that works because the class has learned how to brace itself; realizes rewards/penalties are given by group per class, so a mixed-class winning group won&#x27;t change standings.<span class=\"pg\">p.117–132<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Delivers the exam briefing; he notes she wants Class D to prove they&#x27;re different from a year ago.<span class=\"pg\">p.117–132<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-1\">← Before: Chabashira announces the uninhabited island survival exam<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p152-1\">→ After: Ishizaki&#x27;s group proposal<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae","q":"chabashira sae chabashira announces the uninhabited island exam she announces the summer special exam  two weeks on an uninhabited island  all school years competing  with a luxury cruise afterward  she explains the group rules  max 3 per same year group  gender ratios   you will have to participate in the  uninhabited island survival  special exam and compete with each other  informative and measured   she delivers the rules clearly","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html#sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-1\">Chabashira announces the uninhabited island exam<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.117–128<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She announces the summer special exam: two weeks on an uninhabited island, all school years competing, with a luxury cruise afterward; she explains the group rules (max 3 per same-year group, gender ratios).<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;You will have to participate in the &quot;Uninhabited Island Survival&quot; special exam and compete with each other.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Informative and measured — she delivers the rules clearly.<span class=\"pg\">p.117–128<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p23-1\">← Before: Chabashira waits for Ayanokōji after Tsukishiro&#x27;s summons<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-2\">→ After: Chabashira&#x27;s island exam briefing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka horikita-suzune chabashira-sae","q":"chabashira sae chabashira s island exam briefing  it s true that we ll be discussing the topic of the special exam after this  but to maintain the suspense for a bit longer  i ll pick it up later   from august 4 to august 11  you can enjoy to your heart s content your summer vacation on this luxury cruise for a total of eight days and seven nights   but in order to fully enjoy this cruise trip  you must successfully complete the next special exam   looks like you re indeed learning   i know what you re saying  but i m going to state in advance that no exam can be 100  fair   this year s exam can be considered to require  all types of abilities  dangles the cruise then snatches it back    lifting us up and then bringing us down  a tactic that works because the class has learned to brace itself  wants class d to prove they differ from a year ago  explains the groups and rewards thoroughly  delivers the briefing  he reads her motivational intent  her smile of admiration at the class s alertness","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html#sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-2\">Chabashira&#x27;s island exam briefing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.117–132<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s true that we&#x27;ll be discussing the topic of the special exam after this, but to maintain the suspense for a bit longer, I&#x27;ll pick it up later.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;From August 4 to August 11, you can enjoy to your heart&#x27;s content your summer vacation on this luxury cruise for a total of eight days and seven nights.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.118<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;But in order to fully enjoy this cruise trip, you must successfully complete the next special exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.118<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Looks like you&#x27;re indeed learning.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I know what you&#x27;re saying, but I&#x27;m going to state in advance that no exam can be 100% fair.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;this year&#x27;s exam can be considered to require &#x27;all types of abilities&#x27;.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Dangles the cruise then snatches it back — &quot;lifting us up and then bringing us down,&quot; a tactic that works because the class has learned to brace itself; wants Class D to prove they differ from a year ago; explains the groups and rewards thoroughly.<span class=\"pg\">p.117–132<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Delivers the briefing; he reads her motivational intent.<span class=\"pg\">p.117–132<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Her smile of admiration at the class&#x27;s alertness.<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-1\">← Before: Chabashira announces the uninhabited island exam<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p328-1\">→ After: Chabashira&#x27;s pre-exam speech<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita reacts to the island exam rules she reacts to the group rules  noting that 2nd years can be allies  she and ayanokoji later discuss the ike shinohara situation   which means  the students in the 2nd year  are our allies  she discusses the ike shinohara komiya situation with ayanokoji and suggests making ike confess  strategic and practical   she focuses on group dynamics and class stability","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-1\">Horikita reacts to the island exam rules<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.119–128<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She reacts to the group rules, noting that 2nd years can be allies; she and Ayanokōji later discuss the Ike/Shinohara situation. She discusses the Ike/Shinohara/Komiya situation with Ayanokōji and suggests making Ike confess.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Which means… the students in the 2nd year, are our allies…?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Strategic and practical — she focuses on group dynamics and class stability.<span class=\"pg\">p.119–197<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p75-1\">← Before: Horikita joins the student council<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-2\">→ After: Horikita on the exam and group selection<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka hirata-yousuke horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita on the exam and group selection  when would the special exam begin   which means  the students in the 2nd year  are our allies   it seems like we can only form groups that leave us with no regrets   for me  i d like to select 2 people from class d to form a group    see note initially views all non class students as enemies  so the same year grouping rule gives her pause  as leader  plans to pick two from class d and struggles with the fairness of group formation   ayanokoji notes she has become more cheeky  or rather more difficult to deal with  he considers relying on her but knows she must avoid favoritism as leader  they discuss group formation  hirata worries about airi  last in academics  who plans to group with akito and haruka  and had hoped to scout ayanokoji for his mind","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-2\">Horikita on the exam and group selection<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.119, 174–179<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;When would the special exam begin?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Which means… the students in the 2nd year, are our allies…?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;It seems like we can only form groups that leave us with no regrets.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;For me, I&#x27;d like to select 2 people from Class D to form a group.&quot; — see note<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Initially views all non-class students as enemies, so the same-year grouping rule gives her pause; as leader, plans to pick two from Class D and struggles with the fairness of group formation — Ayanokōji notes she has become more cheeky, or rather more difficult to deal with.<span class=\"pg\">p.119–179<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He considers relying on her but knows she must avoid favoritism as leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–179<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> They discuss group formation; Hirata worries about Airi (last in academics), who plans to group with Akito and Haruka, and had hoped to scout Ayanokōji for his mind.<span class=\"pg\">p.178–179<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-1\">← Before: Horikita reacts to the island exam rules<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p316-1\">→ After: Horikita&#x27;s solo stance; agrees to meet Ibuki<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p123-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae hirata-yousuke","q":"hirata yosuke hirata questions the exam rules  wouldn t that  be extremely disadvantageous to the first year students  and advantageous for the third years   we can t change groups  but we could form a group of up to 6 for the special exam  right  hates inequality   objects to the cross year unfairness and asks about the small group big group mechanics  chabashira explains no exam is 100  fair and that younger students get higher rewards lighter penalties  questions her on the rules  she answers that there are gaps between years and that the groups combine later","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p123-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html#sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p123-1\">Hirata questions the exam rules<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.123, 126<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> &quot;Wouldn&#x27;t that… be extremely disadvantageous to the first-year students, and advantageous for the third years?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.123<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> &quot;We can&#x27;t change groups, but we could form a group of up to 6 for the special exam, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.126<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Hates inequality — objects to the cross-year unfairness and asks about the small-group/big-group mechanics; Chabashira explains no exam is 100% fair and that younger students get higher rewards/lighter penalties.<span class=\"pg\">p.123–126<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Questions her on the rules; she answers that there are gaps between years and that the groups combine later.<span class=\"pg\">p.123–126<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p21-1\">← Before: Hirata defuses the escalating argument<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p177-1\">→ After: Hirata discusses group strategy with Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p152-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ishizaki-daichi shiina-hiyori yamada-albert ryuuen-kakeru ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ishizaki s group proposal is approached by ishizaki daichi  class 2 c  at school  who proposes forming a group for the island exam  ayanokoji follows him and meets albert and hiyori   let s cut to the chase  here s my proposal  let s form a group for the next   form a group  can you give me more details   when the exam starts  you ll combine your group with another three person group from class b  so it ll be a perfect six person group   hiyori  did you carefully explain the exam rules to ishizaki  realizes the plan was ishizaki s own  not ryuen s    ishizaki tenses when asked  understands why ibuki hangs around him  hiyori and albert support him  declines to commit for now  knowing forming a group would draw others in  reads the group formation dynamics sharply  recognizes the rules mean same year grouping and that ryuen couldn t object to intra class grouping  his proposal   a 3 person small group with ishizaki albert hiyori combining with another class b group  ayanokoji declines to commit  supports ishizaki s plan  listens with interest  ishizaki s classmate  part of the proposed group  ayanokoji checks whether ryuen decided the invitation  it was ishizaki s own idea","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p152-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p152-1\">Ishizaki&#x27;s group proposal<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.152–166<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Is approached by Ishizaki Daichi (Class 2-C) at school, who proposes forming a group for the island exam; Ayanokōji follows him and meets Albert and Hiyori.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yamada-albert.html\">Yamada Albert<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> &quot;Let&#x27;s cut to the chase, here&#x27;s my proposal…. Let&#x27;s form a group for the next&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.159<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Form…a group? Can you give me more details?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.159<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> &quot;when the exam starts, you&#x27;ll combine your group with another three person group from Class B, so it&#x27;ll be a perfect six person group.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.159<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Hiyori, did you carefully explain the exam rules to Ishizaki?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.159<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> Realizes the plan was Ishizaki&#x27;s own (not Ryūen&#x27;s) — Ishizaki tenses when asked; understands why Ibuki hangs around him; Hiyori and Albert support him; declines to commit for now, knowing forming a group would draw others in.<span class=\"pg\">p.163–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Reads the group-formation dynamics sharply; recognizes the rules mean same-year grouping and that Ryūen couldn&#x27;t object to intra-class grouping.<span class=\"pg\">p.152–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> His proposal — a 3-person small group with Ishizaki/Albert/Hiyori combining with another Class B group; Ayanokōji declines to commit.<span class=\"pg\">p.152–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Supports Ishizaki&#x27;s plan; listens with interest.<span class=\"pg\">p.157–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamada Albert<\/b> Ishizaki&#x27;s classmate, part of the proposed group.<span class=\"pg\">p.153–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Ayanokōji checks whether Ryūen decided the invitation; it was Ishizaki&#x27;s own idea.<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p117-2\">← Before: The island survival exam announced; rules<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p160-1\">→ After: Ishizaki, Albert and Hiyori invite him to Ryūen&#x27;s group<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v2-p152-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiina-hiyori yamada-albert ryuuen-kakeru ishizaki-daichi","q":"ishizaki daichi ishizaki s group proposal to ayanokoji spots ayanokoji at school  calls out with a smile  and brings him to meet albert and hiyori   proposing they form a group for the island exam   we stand out here a lot  we should move  ishizaki kun    ayanokoji  let s cut to the chase  here s my proposal  let s form a group for the next   when the exam starts  you ll combine your group with another three person group from class b  so it ll be a perfect six person group   with five people from our class  and you being the sixth  ayanakouji  let s aim for first place   but ryuuen kun is indispensable   don t be ridiculous  do you think ryuuen kun will ever approve of our    hiyori  ishizaki continues cheerful  sociable and unexpectedly strategic   devises a cross class six person group plan on his own  not ryuen s orders  supported by albert and hiyori  grows flustered and panicked under ayanokoji s probing  his brow visibly sweating  but insists on the goal of first place  proposes the group  wants his academic strength   he calls his math  truly incredible    for the exam  his classmate and supporter  she corrects his plan s flaws  his classmate  part of the proposed group  the plan is his own idea  he knows ryuen wouldn t approve of certain group choices","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v2-p152-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html#sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v2-p152-1\">Ishizaki&#x27;s group proposal to Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.152–166<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Spots Ayanokōji at school, calls out with a smile, and brings him to meet Albert and Hiyori — proposing they form a group for the island exam.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yamada-albert.html\">Yamada Albert<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> &quot;We stand out here a lot. We should move, Ishizaki-kun?&quot; — Ayanokōji<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> &quot;Let&#x27;s cut to the chase, here&#x27;s my proposal…. Let&#x27;s form a group for the next&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.159<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> &quot;when the exam starts, you&#x27;ll combine your group with another three person group from Class B, so it&#x27;ll be a perfect six person group.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.159<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;With five people from our class, and you being the sixth, Ayanakouji, let&#x27;s aim for first place!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.159<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;but Ryuuen-kun is indispensable.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.161<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Don&#x27;t be ridiculous! Do you think Ryuuen-kun will ever approve of our&quot; — Hiyori; Ishizaki continues<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful, sociable and unexpectedly strategic — devises a cross-class six-person group plan on his own (not Ryūen&#x27;s orders), supported by Albert and Hiyori; grows flustered and panicked under Ayanokōji&#x27;s probing, his brow visibly sweating, but insists on the goal of first place.<span class=\"pg\">p.152–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Proposes the group; wants his academic strength — he calls his math &quot;truly incredible&quot; — for the exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.152–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> His classmate and supporter; she corrects his plan&#x27;s flaws.<span class=\"pg\">p.157–165<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamada Albert<\/b> His classmate, part of the proposed group.<span class=\"pg\">p.153–165<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The plan is his own idea; he knows Ryūen wouldn&#x27;t approve of certain group choices.<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v2-p160-1\">→ After: Ishizaki invites Ayanokōji to Ryūen&#x27;s group<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p157-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"ishizaki-daichi ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiina-hiyori","q":"shiina hiyori hiyori supports ishizaki s group plan approaches the group with a gentle smile  like a leader  having listened to ishizaki s proposal  hiyori supports ishizaki s plan and listens with great interest  but also points out its problems  along with ayanokoji  knowing forming a group with him won t be easy  she gently places a hand on his shoulder as he reluctantly agrees  gentle and socially skilled   acts as a calming  leader like presence  backs ishizaki while realistically acknowledging the difficulties  and helps soften the negotiation  supports his proposal  corrects its flaws  and comforts him when he s flustered  listens to his questions about the group plan  knew forming it wouldn t be easy","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p157-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html#sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p157-1\">Hiyori supports Ishizaki&#x27;s group plan<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.157–166<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Approaches the group with a gentle smile &quot;like a leader,&quot; having listened to Ishizaki&#x27;s proposal.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Hiyori supports Ishizaki&#x27;s plan and listens with great interest, but also points out its problems (along with Ayanokōji), knowing forming a group with him won&#x27;t be easy; she gently places a hand on his shoulder as he reluctantly agrees.<span class=\"pg\">p.159–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Gentle and socially skilled — acts as a calming, leader-like presence, backs Ishizaki while realistically acknowledging the difficulties, and helps soften the negotiation.<span class=\"pg\">p.157–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Supports his proposal, corrects its flaws, and comforts him when he&#x27;s flustered.<span class=\"pg\">p.157–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Listens to his questions about the group plan; knew forming it wouldn&#x27;t be easy.<span class=\"pg\">p.159–166<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p160-1\">→ After: Hiyori supports inviting Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p160-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ishizaki-daichi shiina-hiyori albert ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ishizaki  albert and hiyori invite him to ryuen s group ishizaki  albert and hiyori approach him after school and invite him to join ryuen s group for the uninhabited island exam  offering 20m points  he declines for now   then  the third  this proposal  how does it benefit me  hiyori suggests ryuuen  kaneda and ayanokoji as a group  ishizaki is excited  but ayanokoji says he ll think about it  he is cautious and non committal   he weighs the offer carefully  ishizaki invites him enthusiastically  hiyori supports the invitation  albert nods in agreement","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p160-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p160-1\">Ishizaki, Albert and Hiyori invite him to Ryūen&#x27;s group<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.160–167<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ishizaki, Albert and Hiyori approach him after school and invite him to join Ryūen&#x27;s group for the uninhabited island exam, offering 20M points; he declines for now. Hiyori suggests Ryuuen, Kaneda and Ayanokōji as a group; Ishizaki is excited, but Ayanokōji says he&#x27;ll think about it.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Then, the third… this proposal, how does it benefit me?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is cautious and non-committal — he weighs the offer carefully.<span class=\"pg\">p.160–167<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Ishizaki invites him enthusiastically.<span class=\"pg\">p.160–167<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Hiyori supports the invitation.<span class=\"pg\">p.160–167<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">albert<\/b> Albert nods in agreement.<span class=\"pg\">p.161–162<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p152-1\">← Before: Ishizaki&#x27;s group proposal<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p168-1\">→ After: Ike and Shinohara&#x27;s group dilemma<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v2-p160-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ishizaki-daichi","q":"ishizaki daichi ishizaki invites ayanokoji to ryuen s group he  albert and hiyori invite ayanokoji to join ryuen s group for the island exam  offering 20m points  he declines for now  he helps ayanokoji investigate komiya s feelings for shinohara by calling komiya  enthusiastic and loyal   he pushes the invitation and then helps his friend  he invites and then assists him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v2-p160-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html#sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v2-p160-1\">Ishizaki invites Ayanokōji to Ryūen&#x27;s group<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.160–167<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He, Albert and Hiyori invite Ayanokōji to join Ryūen&#x27;s group for the island exam, offering 20M points; he declines for now. He helps Ayanokōji investigate Komiya&#x27;s feelings for Shinohara by calling Komiya.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Enthusiastic and loyal — he pushes the invitation and then helps his friend.<span class=\"pg\">p.160–194<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He invites and then assists him.<span class=\"pg\">p.160–194<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y2v2-p152-1\">← Before: Ishizaki&#x27;s group proposal to Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p160-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"shiina-hiyori","q":"shiina hiyori hiyori supports inviting ayanokoji she supports ishizaki s invitation for ayanokoji to join ryuen s group   we didn t talk to anyone  and we don t intend to  right  thoughtful and supportive   she backs the invitation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p160-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html#sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p160-1\">Hiyori supports inviting Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.160–167<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She supports Ishizaki&#x27;s invitation for Ayanokōji to join Ryūen&#x27;s group.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;We didn&#x27;t talk to anyone, and we don&#x27;t intend to. Right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.161<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Thoughtful and supportive — she backs the invitation.<span class=\"pg\">p.160–167<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p157-1\">← Before: Hiyori supports Ishizaki&#x27;s group plan<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p342-1\">→ After: Short story: &quot;An excuse&quot; — the forced invitation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yamada-albert-y2v2-p160-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"yamada-albert","q":"yamada albert albert supports inviting ayanokoji he nods in agreement when ishizaki and hiyori invite ayanokoji to join ryuen s group   that was high praise  ayanokouji kun  but my opinion is also the same  loyal to ryuen s faction","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yamada-albert-y2v2-p160-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yamada-albert.html#sc-yamada-albert-y2v2-p160-1\">Albert supports inviting Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.160–167<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yamada-albert.html\">Yamada Albert<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He nods in agreement when Ishizaki and Hiyori invite Ayanokōji to join Ryūen&#x27;s group.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yamada Albert<\/b> &quot;That was high praise, Ayanokouji-kun, but my opinion is also the same.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.162<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Loyal to Ryūen&#x27;s faction.<span class=\"pg\">p.160–167<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ibuki-mio-y2v2-p163-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"ibuki-mio","q":"ibuki mio ibuki mentioned in passing named in the ryuen alliance meeting context  named in the ryuen katsuragi negotiation  passing mentions  not a distinct scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ibuki-mio-y2v2-p163-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ibuki-mio.html#sc-ibuki-mio-y2v2-p163-1\">Ibuki mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.163, 188, 315–325<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ibuki-mio.html\">Ibuki Mio<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the Ryūen alliance meeting context. Named in the Ryūen-Katsuragi negotiation.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.163, 188, 315–325<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.163, 188, 315–325<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v2-p165-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru kaneda mentioned in passing named in ishizaki s invitation scene   he mentions kaneda as a possible group member  passing mention  not a distinct scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v2-p165-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kaneda-satoru.html#sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v2-p165-1\">Kaneda mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.165–166<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kaneda-satoru.html\">Kaneda Satoru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in Ishizaki&#x27;s invitation scene — he mentions Kaneda as a possible group member.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.165–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.165–166<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p168-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"ike-kanji shinohara-satsuki hirata-yousuke ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ike and shinohara s group dilemma he overhears ike trying to recruit shinohara into his group  kushida interrupts with an invitation from kobashi  class c  he and yousuke discuss the situation and decide to investigate komiya s invitation to shinohara  he is concerned about ike s emotional vulnerability and the class s group dynamics  ike is trying to form a group with shinohara  shinohara is being courted by both ike and komiya  they agree to investigate together","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p168-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p168-1\">Ike and Shinohara&#x27;s group dilemma<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.168–177<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He overhears Ike trying to recruit Shinohara into his group; Kushida interrupts with an invitation from Kobashi (Class C). He and Yousuke discuss the situation and decide to investigate Komiya&#x27;s invitation to Shinohara.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is concerned about Ike&#x27;s emotional vulnerability and the class&#x27;s group dynamics.<span class=\"pg\">p.168–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Ike is trying to form a group with Shinohara.<span class=\"pg\">p.168–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> Shinohara is being courted by both Ike and Komiya.<span class=\"pg\">p.168–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> They agree to investigate together.<span class=\"pg\">p.177–178<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p160-1\">← Before: Ishizaki, Albert and Hiyori invite him to Ryūen&#x27;s group<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p169-1\">→ After: Class D group formation; Matsushita&#x27;s offer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p168-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"shinohara-satsuki komiya-kyogo ike-kanji","q":"ike kanji ike tries to form a group with shinohara he tries to recruit shinohara into his group  selling his boy scout skills  kushida interrupts with an invitation from kobashi  class c  he is upset when shinohara agrees to meet komiya at a cafe  anxious and emotionally invested   he worries about shinohara and wants to protect her  he is trying to form a group with her  he is jealous of komiya s invitation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p168-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html#sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p168-1\">Ike tries to form a group with Shinohara<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.168–177<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He tries to recruit Shinohara into his group, selling his boy-scout skills; Kushida interrupts with an invitation from Kobashi (Class C). He is upset when Shinohara agrees to meet Komiya at a café.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Anxious and emotionally invested — he worries about Shinohara and wants to protect her.<span class=\"pg\">p.168–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> He is trying to form a group with her.<span class=\"pg\">p.168–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Komiya Kyogo<\/b> He is jealous of Komiya&#x27;s invitation.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–177<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p12-1\">← Before: Ike suggests cheating via past papers<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p169-1\">→ After: Ike wants to group with Shinohara<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p168-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji komiya-kyogo kushida-kikyou shinohara","q":"shinohara shinohara  ike s clumsy proposal  komiya s comfort bumps into ayanokoji in the elevator  they barely know each other and exchange only a greeting   good morning  ike waits in the lobby  greets her and follows her outside to ask about grouping for the coming uninhabited island exam  she rebuffs his probing   no  not yet  why do you ask   the heck  look at you acting all high and mighty   huh  sacrifice what  i didn t ask for that  when kushida calls ike away with another girl s invitation  shinohara coldly tells her to take him  she watches them leave with a lonely look  her eyes red   no  it s alright  he s been bothering me since he first called out to me  take him  komiya notices her red eyes  she hides her hurt behind a  something got in my eyes  excuse  and they talk about his making the basketball team   ah  komiya kun  good morning   eh  w why do you ask  aloof but lonely   indifferent to ike s clumsy advances  yet visibly hurt when he abandons her for another girl  she puts up a front even to herself and accepts komiya s quiet concern  he awkwardly tries to form a group with her  then leaves eagerly for kushida  she calls him a bother and is secretly wounded  notices her tears and comforts her  she plays it down  hands ike over to her without a fight","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p168-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara.html#sc-shinohara-y2v2-p168-1\">Shinohara: Ike&#x27;s clumsy proposal, Komiya&#x27;s comfort<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.168–173<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara.html\">Shinohara<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Bumps into Ayanokōji in the elevator; they barely know each other and exchange only a greeting. Ike waits in the lobby, greets her and follows her outside to ask about grouping for the coming uninhabited-island exam; she rebuffs his probing. When Kushida calls Ike away with another girl&#x27;s invitation, Shinohara coldly tells her to take him; she watches them leave with a lonely look, her eyes red. Komiya notices her red eyes; she hides her hurt behind a &quot;something got in my eyes&quot; excuse, and they talk about his making the basketball team.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara<\/b> &quot;Good morning.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.168<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara<\/b> &quot;No, not yet… Why do you ask?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.169<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara<\/b> &quot;The heck? Look at you acting all high and mighty.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.170<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Huh!? Sacrifice what? I didn&#x27;t ask for that!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.171<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;No, it&#x27;s alright, he&#x27;s been bothering me since he first called out to me. Take him.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.171<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ah, Komiya-kun… Good morning.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Eh? W-why do you ask?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Aloof but lonely — indifferent to Ike&#x27;s clumsy advances, yet visibly hurt when he abandons her for another girl; she puts up a front even to herself and accepts Komiya&#x27;s quiet concern.<span class=\"pg\">p.168–173<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> He awkwardly tries to form a group with her, then leaves eagerly for Kushida; she calls him a bother and is secretly wounded.<span class=\"pg\">p.169–172<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Komiya Kyogo<\/b> Notices her tears and comforts her; she plays it down.<span class=\"pg\">p.172–173<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Hands Ike over to her without a fight.<span class=\"pg\">p.171<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p15-1\">← Before: Shinohara in the perfect-score uproar<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p175-1\">→ After: Shinohara already has a group<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v2-p168-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"ike-kanji komiya-kyogo shinohara-satsuki","q":"shinohara satsuki shinohara is courted by ike and komiya ike tries to recruit her into his group  kushida interrupts with an invitation from kobashi  class c  shinohara is annoyed by ike s persistence  she agrees to meet komiya at a cafe  ike is upset  pragmatic and slightly exasperated by ike s advances  she is annoyed by his recruitment attempt  she agrees to meet him at a cafe","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v2-p168-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html#sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v2-p168-1\">Shinohara is courted by Ike and Komiya<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.168–177<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ike tries to recruit her into his group; Kushida interrupts with an invitation from Kobashi (Class C); Shinohara is annoyed by Ike&#x27;s persistence. She agrees to meet Komiya at a café; Ike is upset.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Pragmatic and slightly exasperated by Ike&#x27;s advances.<span class=\"pg\">p.168–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> She is annoyed by his recruitment attempt.<span class=\"pg\">p.168–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Komiya Kyogo<\/b> She agrees to meet him at a café.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–177<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v2-p12-1\">← Before: Shinohara joins the speculation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p169-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"matsushita-chiaki ike-kanji horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka class d group formation  matsushita s offer fields classmates  questions about grouping   ike asks  wanting to pair with shinohara  then matsushita approach him with an offer   did you judge that your odds of survival are the highest if you grouped up  matsushita  holding a  trial card  that makes a group more likely to be expelled  offers to help ayanokoji despite the danger  saying she chose him because he seemed unlikely to be snapped up quickly  he decides not to settle his group  at least for this month  suspecting the others are scheming  is wary of committing early  others will get involved  watches ike shinohara dynamics and notes horikita has become  more difficult to deal with  considers relying on horikita but knows as leader she must avoid favoritism  she offers to assist him despite the risk of her trial card  he declined to decide immediately  he wants to group with shinohara  asks ayanokoji s advice  considers relying on her but recognizes her position  she plans to select two from class d","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p169-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p169-1\">Class D group formation; Matsushita&#x27;s offer<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.169–185<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Fields classmates&#x27; questions about grouping — Ike asks (wanting to pair with Shinohara), then Matsushita approach him with an offer.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> &quot;Did you judge that your odds of survival are the highest if you grouped up&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Matsushita (holding a &quot;trial card&quot; that makes a group more likely to be expelled) offers to help Ayanokōji despite the danger, saying she chose him because he seemed unlikely to be snapped up quickly; he decides not to settle his group &quot;at least for this month,&quot; suspecting the others are scheming.<span class=\"pg\">p.182–184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Is wary of committing early (others will get involved); watches Ike/Shinohara dynamics and notes Horikita has become &quot;more difficult to deal with&quot;; considers relying on Horikita but knows as leader she must avoid favoritism.<span class=\"pg\">p.169–185<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> She offers to assist him despite the risk of her trial card; he declined to decide immediately.<span class=\"pg\">p.182–184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> He wants to group with Shinohara; asks Ayanokōji&#x27;s advice.<span class=\"pg\">p.169–176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Considers relying on her but recognizes her position; she plans to select two from Class D.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–179<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p168-1\">← Before: Ike and Shinohara&#x27;s group dilemma<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p178-1\">→ After: Matsushita proposes an alliance<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hondou-ryoutaro-y2v2-p169-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"hondou-ryoutaro","q":"hondo ryotaro hondou mentioned as sudo s group partner shinohara mentions that sudo and hondou will be in a group together  mentioned in passing as a group member","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hondou-ryoutaro-y2v2-p169-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hondou-ryoutaro.html#sc-hondou-ryoutaro-y2v2-p169-1\">Hondou mentioned as Sudō&#x27;s group partner<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.169<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hondou-ryoutaro.html\">Hondō Ryōtaro<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Shinohara mentions that Sudō and Hondou will be in a group together.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Mentioned in passing as a group member.<span class=\"pg\">p.169<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p169-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"shinohara ayanokouji-kiyotaka ike-kanji","q":"ike kanji ike wants to group with shinohara  uh  it s gotta do with that  ya know  the groups for this new uninhabited island exam  have you talked to anyone about grouping up yet   you re feeling troubled  uh  i can form a group with you  yeah  ike essentially wants a reason to group with shinohara  he  just wanted a reason to group up with her  ayanokoji suggests he discuss it with her directly  ike is shocked to learn shinohara has already decided on a group  eager and lovestruck   wants to be shinohara s group partner  tries to help ayanokoji as a pretext  and is flustered when he learns she s already grouped  wants to form a group with her  asks his advice about grouping","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p169-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html#sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p169-1\">Ike wants to group with Shinohara<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.169–176<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara.html\">Shinohara<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> &quot;uh, it&#x27;s gotta do with that. Ya know, the groups for this new uninhabited island exam… Have you talked to anyone about grouping up yet?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.169<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> &quot;you&#x27;re feeling troubled… uh, I can form a group with you, yeah?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.170<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ike essentially wants a reason to group with Shinohara (he &quot;just wanted a reason to group up with her&quot;); Ayanokōji suggests he discuss it with her directly; Ike is shocked to learn Shinohara has already decided on a group.<span class=\"pg\">p.169–176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Eager and lovestruck — wants to be Shinohara&#x27;s group partner, tries to help Ayanokōji as a pretext, and is flustered when he learns she&#x27;s already grouped.<span class=\"pg\">p.169–176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara<\/b> Wants to form a group with her.<span class=\"pg\">p.169–176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Asks his advice about grouping.<span class=\"pg\">p.169–176<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v2-p168-1\">← Before: Ike tries to form a group with Shinohara<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p169-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"sudou-ken","q":"sudo ken sudo s group situation shinohara mentions that sudo and hondou will be in a group together  sudo s basketball commitment is noted  his group plans are discussed by others","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p169-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html#sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p169-1\">Sudō&#x27;s group situation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.169–170<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Shinohara mentions that Sudō and Hondou will be in a group together; Sudō&#x27;s basketball commitment is noted.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> His group plans are discussed by others.<span class=\"pg\">p.169–170<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v2-p19-2\">← Before: Sudō defends Ayanokōji against the cheating talk<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kobashi-yume-y2v2-p171-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"kobashi-yume","q":"kobashi yume kobashi invites ike to a class c group kushida relays kobashi s invitation for ike to join a class c group  proactive in recruiting group members","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kobashi-yume-y2v2-p171-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kobashi-yume.html#sc-kobashi-yume-y2v2-p171-1\">Kobashi invites Ike to a Class C group<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.171<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kobashi-yume.html\">Kobashi Yume<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kushida relays Kobashi&#x27;s invitation for Ike to join a Class C group.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Proactive in recruiting group members.<span class=\"pg\">p.171<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p171-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"kushida-kikyou","q":"kushida kikyo kushida relays kobashi s invitation to ike she interrupts ike and shinohara to relay kobashi s invitation for ike to join a class c group  mediating and helpful in group formation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p171-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html#sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p171-1\">Kushida relays Kobashi&#x27;s invitation to Ike<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.171<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She interrupts Ike and Shinohara to relay Kobashi&#x27;s invitation for Ike to join a Class C group.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Mediating and helpful in group formation.<span class=\"pg\">p.171<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p243-1\">→ After: Kushida arranges Ayanokōji&#x27;s meeting with Yagami<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p172-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya in the shinohara confession plot he is mentioned as sudo s friend  shinohara agrees to meet him at a cafe  he is called by ishizaki and reveals he plans to confess to shinohara on the uninhabited island  komiya is discussed but not present in these scenes  the confession plot is reported secondhand","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p172-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html#sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p172-1\">Komiya in the Shinohara confession plot<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.172–197<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He is mentioned as Sudō&#x27;s friend; Shinohara agrees to meet him at a café. He is called by Ishizaki and reveals he plans to confess to Shinohara on the uninhabited island.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Komiya is discussed but not present in these scenes; the confession plot is reported secondhand.<span class=\"pg\">p.172–197<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p174-1\">→ After: Komiya invites Shinohara and plans to confess<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p174-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"komiya-kyogo","q":"komiya kyogo komiya invites shinohara and plans to confess he invites shinohara to meet at a cafe  she agrees  ishizaki calls him and learns he plans to confess to shinohara on the uninhabited island  direct and bold   he pursues shinohara openly","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p174-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html#sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p174-1\">Komiya invites Shinohara and plans to confess<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.174–194<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He invites Shinohara to meet at a café; she agrees. Ishizaki calls him and learns he plans to confess to Shinohara on the uninhabited island.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Direct and bold — he pursues Shinohara openly.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–194<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-komiya-kyogo-y2v2-p172-1\">← Before: Komiya in the Shinohara confession plot<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p175-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji horikita-suzune shinohara","q":"shinohara shinohara already has a group  huh  you  er  found someone to group up with  shinohara has already decided on a group  with someone ike didn t expect  without horikita s permission  horikita questions who she chose  decisive and independent   formed her group early  surprising ike  he is surprised she already found a group  questions her group choice as class leader","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p175-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara.html#sc-shinohara-y2v2-p175-1\">Shinohara already has a group<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.175–176<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara.html\">Shinohara<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara<\/b> &quot;Huh? You, er… found someone to group up with?!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Shinohara has already decided on a group (with someone Ike didn&#x27;t expect) without Horikita&#x27;s permission; Horikita questions who she chose.<span class=\"pg\">p.175–176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Decisive and independent — formed her group early, surprising Ike.<span class=\"pg\">p.175–176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> He is surprised she already found a group.<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Questions her group choice as class leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shinohara-y2v2-p168-1\">← Before: Shinohara: Ike&#x27;s clumsy proposal, Komiya&#x27;s comfort<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p177-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka hirata-yousuke","q":"hirata yosuke hirata discusses group strategy with ayanokoji he and ayanokoji agree to investigate the ike shinohara situation  he plans to form a group with two class d members  thoughtful and strategic   he considers the class s overall group dynamics  they agree to investigate together","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p177-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html#sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p177-1\">Hirata discusses group strategy with Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.177–179<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He and Ayanokōji agree to investigate the Ike/Shinohara situation; he plans to form a group with two Class D members.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Thoughtful and strategic — he considers the class&#x27;s overall group dynamics.<span class=\"pg\">p.177–179<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> They agree to investigate together.<span class=\"pg\">p.177–179<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y2v2-p123-1\">← Before: Hirata questions the exam rules<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p178-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"matsushita-chiaki ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka matsushita proposes an alliance matsushita approaches him with her contact info  proposing they cooperate during the exam  he keeps his options open   i do  that s why i think it s important for me to cooperate with you to help  he is non committal but receptive to alliances  she proposes cooperation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p178-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p178-1\">Matsushita proposes an alliance<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.178–186<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Matsushita approaches him with her contact info, proposing they cooperate during the exam; he keeps his options open.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I do. That&#x27;s why I think it&#x27;s important for me to cooperate with you to help&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.182<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is non-committal but receptive to alliances.<span class=\"pg\">p.178–184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> She proposes cooperation.<span class=\"pg\">p.178–184<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p169-1\">← Before: Class D group formation; Matsushita&#x27;s offer<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p187-1\">→ After: Ishizaki helps investigate Komiya<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p178-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita proposes cooperation to ayanokoji she approaches him with her contact info  proposing they cooperate during the exam  he keeps his options open   i do  that s why i think it s important for me to cooperate with you to help  strategic and proactive   she seeks alliances early  she proposes cooperation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p178-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html#sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p178-1\">Matsushita proposes cooperation to Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.178–184<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She approaches him with her contact info, proposing they cooperate during the exam; he keeps his options open.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> &quot;I do. That&#x27;s why I think it&#x27;s important for me to cooperate with you to help&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.182<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Strategic and proactive — she seeks alliances early.<span class=\"pg\">p.178–184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She proposes cooperation.<span class=\"pg\">p.178–184<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p182-1\">→ After: Matsushita&#x27;s offer to group with Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p182-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita s offer to group with ayanokoji  if you ve got any problems  i would like to help you  ayanokouji kun   did you judge that your odds of survival are the highest if you grouped up   i thought you d get snapped up quickly  ayanokouji kun  shrewd and calculating   holds a  trial card  that makes a group more likely to be expelled  yet offers to assist ayanokoji despite the danger  explains she chose him because she thought he d be snapped up quickly and preferred taking the risk with capable people over a  half assed group  with friends  offers to group with him  he declines to decide immediately  suspecting she is scheming","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p182-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html#sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p182-1\">Matsushita&#x27;s offer to group with Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.182–184<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> &quot;If you&#x27;ve got any problems, I would like to help you, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.182<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> &quot;Did you judge that your odds of survival are the highest if you grouped up&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> &quot;I thought you&#x27;d get snapped up quickly, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Shrewd and calculating — holds a &quot;trial card&quot; that makes a group more likely to be expelled, yet offers to assist Ayanokōji despite the danger; explains she chose him because she thought he&#x27;d be snapped up quickly and preferred taking the risk with capable people over a &quot;half-assed group&quot; with friends.<span class=\"pg\">p.182–184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Offers to group with him; he declines to decide immediately, suspecting she is scheming.<span class=\"pg\">p.182–184<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p178-1\">← Before: Matsushita proposes cooperation to Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p187-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ishizaki-daichi komiya-kyogo ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ishizaki helps investigate komiya he contacts ishizaki to ask about komiya s feelings for shinohara  ishizaki calls komiya and learns he plans to confess on the uninhabited island   that komiya guy  he s planning to confess to shinohara on the uninhabited island  he is concerned about ike s emotional state and tries to gather information  ishizaki helps him investigate  komiya plans to confess to shinohara","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p187-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p187-1\">Ishizaki helps investigate Komiya<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.187–194<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He contacts Ishizaki to ask about Komiya&#x27;s feelings for Shinohara; Ishizaki calls Komiya and learns he plans to confess on the uninhabited island.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;That Komiya guy, he&#x27;s planning to confess to Shinohara on the uninhabited island&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.194<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is concerned about Ike&#x27;s emotional state and tries to gather information.<span class=\"pg\">p.187–194<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Ishizaki helps him investigate.<span class=\"pg\">p.187–194<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Komiya Kyogo<\/b> Komiya plans to confess to Shinohara.<span class=\"pg\">p.193–194<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p178-1\">← Before: Matsushita proposes an alliance<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p195-1\">→ After: Horikita and Ayanokōji discuss Ike and Shinohara<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nishino-takeko-y2v2-p187-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"nishino-takeko","q":"nishino takeko nishino follows ishizaki to ayanokoji she follows ishizaki to his meeting with ayanokoji  asking questions about komiya and shinohara  curious and nosy   she inserts herself into the conversation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nishino-takeko-y2v2-p187-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nishino-takeko.html#sc-nishino-takeko-y2v2-p187-1\">Nishino follows Ishizaki to Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.187–189<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nishino-takeko.html\">Nishino Takeko<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She follows Ishizaki to his meeting with Ayanokōji, asking questions about Komiya and Shinohara.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Curious and nosy — she inserts herself into the conversation.<span class=\"pg\">p.187–189<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p195-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka horikita and ayanokoji discuss ike and shinohara he tells horikita about the ike shinohara komiya situation  she suggests making ike confess  but notes he s bad at romance   why don t we just make ike kun confess  he is concerned about ike being expelled due to emotional distraction  they discuss the group dilemma","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p195-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p195-1\">Horikita and Ayanokōji discuss Ike and Shinohara<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.195–197<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He tells Horikita about the Ike/Shinohara/Komiya situation; she suggests making Ike confess, but notes he&#x27;s bad at romance.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Why don&#x27;t we just make Ike-kun confess?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.196<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is concerned about Ike being expelled due to emotional distraction.<span class=\"pg\">p.195–197<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> They discuss the group dilemma.<span class=\"pg\">p.195–197<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p187-1\">← Before: Ishizaki helps investigate Komiya<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p198-1\">→ After: Kei asks to group up<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p198-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka kei asks to group up kei asks to be in his group  he explains he s going solo for flexibility  she worries about expulsion  and he offers to sell his trial card to get her points   kiyotaka  if it s you  are you able to take first place   it s more important to prevent you from getting expelled  he is protective of kei but strategically non committal about grouping  he offers to sell his trial card to protect her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p198-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p198-1\">Kei asks to group up<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.198–202<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kei asks to be in his group; he explains he&#x27;s going solo for flexibility; she worries about expulsion, and he offers to sell his Trial card to get her points.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Kiyotaka, if it&#x27;s you, are you able to take first place?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.198<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s more important to prevent you from getting expelled.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.201<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is protective of Kei but strategically non-committal about grouping.<span class=\"pg\">p.198–202<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> He offers to sell his Trial card to protect her.<span class=\"pg\">p.198–202<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p195-1\">← Before: Horikita and Ayanokōji discuss Ike and Shinohara<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p203-1\">→ After: Ichinose and Sakayanagi meet<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p198-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei asks to group up with ayanokoji she asks to be in his group  he explains he s going solo for flexibility  she worries about expulsion  short 760 000 points  and he offers to sell his trial card to get her points   kiyotaka  if it s you  are you able to take first place   it s more important to prevent you from getting expelled  anxious about expulsion but trusting   she accepts his offer to sell the card  he offers to protect her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p198-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p198-1\">Kei asks to group up with Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.198–202<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She asks to be in his group; he explains he&#x27;s going solo for flexibility; she worries about expulsion (short 760,000 points), and he offers to sell his Trial card to get her points.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Kiyotaka, if it&#x27;s you, are you able to take first place?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.198<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s more important to prevent you from getting expelled.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.201<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Anxious about expulsion but trusting — she accepts his offer to sell the card.<span class=\"pg\">p.198–202<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He offers to protect her.<span class=\"pg\">p.198–202<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v2-p100-1\">← Before: Karuizawa and Amasawa in Ayanokōji&#x27;s room<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p203-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ichinose and sakayanagi meet ichinose and sakayanagi meet at keyaki mall  sakayanagi invited her  saying she wanted to talk   is this a good time  since i asked so suddenly  i was also prepared for you  he is not present  the scene is reported secondhand  ayanokoji is not present at this meeting  the scene is between ichinose and sakayanagi only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p203-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p203-1\">Ichinose and Sakayanagi meet<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.203–218<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ichinose and Sakayanagi meet at Keyaki Mall; Sakayanagi invited her, saying she wanted to talk.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Is this a good time? Since I asked so suddenly, I was also prepared for you&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.203<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is not present; the scene is reported secondhand.<span class=\"pg\">p.203–218<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji is not present at this meeting; the scene is between Ichinose and Sakayanagi only.<span class=\"pg\">p.203–218<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p198-1\">← Before: Kei asks to group up<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p243-1\">→ After: Ayanokōji meets Yagami and learns about the bounty<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p203-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"sakayanagi-arisu ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ichinose meets sakayanagi sakayanagi invites ichinose to meet at keyaki mall  ichinose is surprised but agrees   is this a good time  since i asked so suddenly  i was also prepared for you  open and willing   she accepts the meeting despite the surprise  they meet at sakayanagi s invitation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p203-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p203-1\">Ichinose meets Sakayanagi<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.203–218<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sakayanagi invites Ichinose to meet at Keyaki Mall; Ichinose is surprised but agrees.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Is this a good time? Since I asked so suddenly, I was also prepared for you&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.203<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Open and willing — she accepts the meeting despite the surprise.<span class=\"pg\">p.203–218<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> They meet at Sakayanagi&#x27;s invitation.<span class=\"pg\">p.203–218<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v2-p47-1\">← Before: Ichinose at Keyaki Mall: praise and a warning<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v2-p203-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami sakayanagi-arisu","q":"sakayanagi arisu sakayanagi invites ichinose to meet she invites ichinose to meet at keyaki mall  surprising her   is this a good time  since i asked so suddenly  i was also prepared for you  calculating and composed   she reaches out to ichinose deliberately  she invites her to a meeting","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v2-p203-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html#sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v2-p203-1\">Sakayanagi invites Ichinose to meet<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.203–218<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She invites Ichinose to meet at Keyaki Mall, surprising her.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> &quot;Is this a good time? Since I asked so suddenly, I was also prepared for you&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.203<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calculating and composed — she reaches out to Ichinose deliberately.<span class=\"pg\">p.203–218<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She invites her to a meeting.<span class=\"pg\">p.203–218<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v2-p215-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi","q":"hashimoto masayoshi hashimoto mentioned in passing named in the group formation context  named in ryuen s alliance meeting  passing mentions  not a distinct scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v2-p215-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html#sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v2-p215-1\">Hashimoto mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.215, 299–300<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the group formation context. Named in Ryūen&#x27;s alliance meeting.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.215, 299–300<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.215, 299–300<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shibata-sou-y2v2-p215-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"shibata-sou","q":"shibata so shibata mentioned in passing named in the group formation context  named in ryuen s alliance meeting  passing mentions  not a distinct scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shibata-sou-y2v2-p215-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shibata-sou.html#sc-shibata-sou-y2v2-p215-1\">Shibata mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.215, 299<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the group formation context. Named in Ryūen&#x27;s alliance meeting.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.215, 299<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.215, 299<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-utomiya-riku-y2v2-p221-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"housen-kazuomi yagami-takuya takahashi-osamu hatano ayanokouji-kiyotaka tsubaki-sakurako utomiya-riku","q":"utomiya riku utomiya  representative and hosen plot mastermind arrives at the first year rep gathering  class 1 c  sent because his classmates avoid  troublesome matters  later approaches ayanokoji at the convenience store with tsubaki   although i don t think i m the type to be a leader  i came because the other students didn t want to come   we ve recently lost a comrade  honestly  it s quite a heavy loss   he had once said to me that he wanted us to join the student council together and create a livelier environment for everyone in this school    on hatano  housen  don t bring your violent tendencies here   i suspect that you re the one who got hatano expelled  he s not the kind of student who would easily break the school rules   i remember clearly the look on his face when he got expelled  he had been tricked by someone   it s about housen kazuomi   we want to take housen by surprise on the uninhabited island exam   in class c  a boy named hatano was expelled from the school  i think housen had something to do with it  calm  reliable and determined   stands up to hosen physically  grabs his arm  correctly suspects he engineered hatano s expulsion  and plots to force hosen out of class 1 d by denying him points bounty  notes class c lost 100 points from hatano s exit  confronts him and plots his expulsion  hosen finds his resolve  interesting  fellow representative  they debate strategy  utomiya wants to isolate class d  fellow representative  he proposes isolating class d  his class 1 c comrade  an a rated student expelled  suspected hosen s doing  approaches him for a deal to eliminate hosen  his classmate  who helps contact ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-utomiya-riku-y2v2-p221-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/utomiya-riku.html#sc-utomiya-riku-y2v2-p221-1\">Utomiya: representative and Hōsen-plot mastermind<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.221–231, 264–270<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/utomiya-riku.html\">Utomiya Riku<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives at the first-year rep gathering (Class 1-C), sent because his classmates avoid &quot;troublesome matters&quot;; later approaches Ayanokōji at the convenience store with Tsubaki.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/housen-kazuomi.html\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/takahashi-osamu.html\">Takahashi Osamu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/index.html#hatano\">Hatano<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/tsubaki-sakurako.html\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> &quot;Although I don&#x27;t think I&#x27;m the type to be a leader, I came because the other students didn&#x27;t want to come.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.222<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> &quot;We&#x27;ve recently lost a comrade. Honestly, it&#x27;s quite a heavy loss.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.222<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> &quot;He had once said to me that he wanted us to join the student council together and create a livelier environment for everyone in this school.&quot; — on Hatano<span class=\"pg\">p.222<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>13 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Housen, don&#x27;t bring your violent tendencies here.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I suspect that you&#x27;re the one who got Hatano expelled. He&#x27;s not the kind of student who would easily break the school rules.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.227<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I remember clearly the look on his face when he got expelled. He had been tricked by someone.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.228<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It&#x27;s about Housen Kazuomi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.264<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;We want to take Housen by surprise on the uninhabited island exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.266<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;In Class C, a boy named Hatano was expelled from the school. I think Housen had something to do with it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.267<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calm, reliable and determined — stands up to Hōsen physically (grabs his arm), correctly suspects he engineered Hatano&#x27;s expulsion, and plots to force Hōsen out of Class 1-D by denying him points/bounty; notes Class C lost 100 points from Hatano&#x27;s exit.<span class=\"pg\">p.221–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/b> Confronts him and plots his expulsion; Hōsen finds his resolve &quot;interesting.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.226–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> Fellow representative; they debate strategy (Utomiya wants to isolate Class D).<span class=\"pg\">p.221–231<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Takahashi Osamu<\/b> Fellow representative; he proposes isolating Class D.<span class=\"pg\">p.223–231<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hatano<\/b> His Class 1-C comrade, an A-rated student expelled (suspected Hōsen&#x27;s doing).<span class=\"pg\">p.222–267<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Approaches him for a deal to eliminate Hōsen.<span class=\"pg\">p.264–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/b> His classmate, who helps contact Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.264<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-takahashi-osamu-y2v2-p223-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"utomiya-riku housen-kazuomi yagami-takuya takahashi-osamu","q":"takahashi osamu takahashi at the first year rep gathering boisterously joins the gathering  class 1 a rep    unassuming  c  academics  but good at getting along with people  with many friends across classes years   osamu kun  did you come because you were given this troublesome task again    utomiya  the leader of my class is the type who dislikes these kinds of troublesome things  that s why i m the one coming to this discussion   so only kazuomi isn t here yet   you ve shown up at a great time  kazuomi   don t call out my name like we re close  or i ll kill ya    hosen  takahashi shrugs it off  wait a minute  wait a minute  wait  i just slipped and fell  so calm down  riku   calm down  both of you  if you start a fight here  you ll be doing exactly what kazuomi wants  friendly and peacekeeping   acts as mediator when utomiya and hosen nearly fight  holds a neutral position on isolating class d  and asks why only one strong group should be formed  suggesting more  he calms the situation when utomiya and hosen clash  hosen shoves him down and threatens him  takahashi doesn t shy away  wanting everyone to get along  fellow representative  he supports yagami s cooperation stance","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-takahashi-osamu-y2v2-p223-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/takahashi-osamu.html#sc-takahashi-osamu-y2v2-p223-1\">Takahashi at the first-year rep gathering<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.223–231<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/takahashi-osamu.html\">Takahashi Osamu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Boisterously joins the gathering (Class 1-A rep) — unassuming (C+ academics) but good at getting along with people, with many friends across classes/years.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/utomiya-riku.html\">Utomiya Riku<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/housen-kazuomi.html\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Takahashi Osamu<\/b> &quot;Osamu-kun, did you come because you were given this troublesome task again?&quot; — Utomiya<span class=\"pg\">p.224<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Takahashi Osamu<\/b> &quot;The leader of my class is the type who dislikes these kinds of troublesome things. That&#x27;s why I&#x27;m the one coming to this discussion.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.224<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Takahashi Osamu<\/b> &quot;So only Kazuomi isn&#x27;t here yet?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.224<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;ve shown up at a great time, Kazuomi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Don&#x27;t call out my name like we&#x27;re close, or I&#x27;ll kill ya.&quot; — Hōsen; Takahashi shrugs it off<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Wait a minute, wait a minute, wait. I just slipped and fell, so calm down, Riku.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Calm down, both of you. If you start a fight here, you&#x27;ll be doing exactly what Kazuomi wants.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Friendly and peacekeeping — acts as mediator when Utomiya and Hōsen nearly fight, holds a neutral position on isolating Class D, and asks why only one strong group should be formed (suggesting more).<span class=\"pg\">p.223–231<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> He calms the situation when Utomiya and Hōsen clash.<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/b> Hōsen shoves him down and threatens him; Takahashi doesn&#x27;t shy away, wanting everyone to get along.<span class=\"pg\">p.225–226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> Fellow representative; he supports Yagami&#x27;s cooperation stance.<span class=\"pg\">p.223–231<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-housen-kazuomi-y2v2-p225-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"utomiya-riku takahashi-osamu yagami-takuya hatano housen-kazuomi","q":"hosen kazuomi hosen at the first year rep gathering arrives last at the gathering   with his terrifying white teeth as usual  refusing to pay or cooperate   don t call out my name like we re close  or i ll kill ya   so y all decided upon paying up   oh  you want to get in my way   huh  interesting  come and try  if you can   looks like playing with ya is gonna be fun  i ll save it for next time   ah yea  it s a game    on whether violence is a game  ain t it just the small fry imploding as a result of fearing expulsion   if you beg me sincerely  i could also work with ya   your meek attitude is pissing me off  yagami  violent  arrogant and provocative   shoves takahashi down  nearly fights utomiya  treats violence as a game  and dismisses hatano s expulsion as  small fry imploding  insists he can crush the upperclassmen alone  the entire first year grade is being forced to negotiate around his refusal to cooperate  nearly fights him  utomiya suspects he got hatano expelled  shoves him down and threatens him  dismisses his cooperative   meek  attitude  claims hatano s expulsion was just fear driven implosion","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-housen-kazuomi-y2v2-p225-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/housen-kazuomi.html#sc-housen-kazuomi-y2v2-p225-1\">Hōsen at the first-year rep gathering<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.225–231<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/housen-kazuomi.html\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives last at the gathering, &quot;with his terrifying white teeth as usual,&quot; refusing to pay or cooperate.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/utomiya-riku.html\">Utomiya Riku<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/takahashi-osamu.html\">Takahashi Osamu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/index.html#hatano\">Hatano<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/b> &quot;Don&#x27;t call out my name like we&#x27;re close, or I&#x27;ll kill ya.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/b> &quot;So y&#x27;all decided upon paying up?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/b> &quot;Oh? You want to get in my way?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Huh, interesting. Come and try, if you can.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Looks like playing with ya is gonna be fun. I&#x27;ll save it for next time.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.227<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ah yea, it&#x27;s a game.&quot; — on whether violence is a game<span class=\"pg\">p.227<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ain&#x27;t it just the small fry imploding as a result of fearing expulsion?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.228<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If you beg me sincerely, I could also work with ya.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.228<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Your meek attitude is pissing me off, Yagami.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Violent, arrogant and provocative — shoves Takahashi down, nearly fights Utomiya, treats violence as a game, and dismisses Hatano&#x27;s expulsion as &quot;small fry imploding&quot;; insists he can crush the upperclassmen alone; the entire first-year grade is being forced to negotiate around his refusal to cooperate.<span class=\"pg\">p.225–231<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> Nearly fights him; Utomiya suspects he got Hatano expelled.<span class=\"pg\">p.226–229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Takahashi Osamu<\/b> Shoves him down and threatens him.<span class=\"pg\">p.225–226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> Dismisses his cooperative, &quot;meek&quot; attitude.<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hatano<\/b> Claims Hatano&#x27;s expulsion was just fear-driven implosion.<span class=\"pg\">p.228<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p243-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"yagami-takuya kushida-kikyou ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ayanokoji meets yagami and learns about the bounty kushida arranges a meeting with yagami  class 1 b  they go to keyaki mall  where yagami reveals the 20m point bounty on ayanokoji s expulsion  set by nagumo and approved by tsukishiro   nice to meet you  ayanokouji senpai  thank you very much for taking your time  yagami explains the special exam details  six participants  deadline at second semester  that he plans to drop out  and warns ayanokoji about housen and another suspicious person  he listens carefully and gathers intelligence about the bounty  yagami provides crucial information about the bounty  kushida arranges the meeting","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p243-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p243-1\">Ayanokōji meets Yagami and learns about the bounty<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.243–261<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kushida arranges a meeting with Yagami (Class 1-B); they go to Keyaki Mall, where Yagami reveals the 20M-point bounty on Ayanokōji&#x27;s expulsion, set by Nagumo and approved by Tsukishiro. Yagami explains the special exam details (six participants, deadline at second semester), that he plans to drop out, and warns Ayanokōji about Housen and another suspicious person.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Nice to meet you, Ayanokouji-senpai. Thank you very much for taking your time.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.246<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He listens carefully and gathers intelligence about the bounty.<span class=\"pg\">p.243–261<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> Yagami provides crucial information about the bounty.<span class=\"pg\">p.243–261<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Kushida arranges the meeting.<span class=\"pg\">p.243–261<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p203-1\">← Before: Ichinose and Sakayanagi meet<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p250-1\">→ After: Yagami&#x27;s revelation: Nagumo and Tsukishiro behind the bounty<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p243-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"kushida-kikyou","q":"kushida kikyo kushida arranges ayanokoji s meeting with yagami she relays yagami s request to meet ayanokoji and accompanies them to keyaki mall  after yagami leaves  she talks with ayanokoji and reveals her hostility toward him  she warns him about yagami and mentions she plans to get rid of him   i ll have to get rid of him as soon as possible  yagami kun  that is  manipulative and calculating   she uses the meeting to gather intelligence and threaten","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p243-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html#sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p243-1\">Kushida arranges Ayanokōji&#x27;s meeting with Yagami<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.243–261<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She relays Yagami&#x27;s request to meet Ayanokōji and accompanies them to Keyaki Mall. After Yagami leaves, she talks with Ayanokōji and reveals her hostility toward him; she warns him about Yagami and mentions she plans to get rid of him.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ll have to get rid of him as soon as possible. Yagami-kun, that is.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.262<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Manipulative and calculating — she uses the meeting to gather intelligence and threaten.<span class=\"pg\">p.243–263<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p171-1\">← Before: Kushida relays Kobashi&#x27;s invitation to Ike<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p250-1\">→ After: Kushida learns of the bounty from Yagami<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p250-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"yagami-takuya kushida-kikyou nagumo-miyabi tsukishiro ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka yagami s revelation  nagumo and tsukishiro behind the bounty walks with yagami and kushida to keyaki mall  yagami  having joined the student council  reveals he asked nagumo about the previous island exam  and starts explaining the bounty   there s something i want to tell you  ayanokouji senpai  there s a special exam that only a very small of 1st year students have been informed about   in april  i received a notification about this  however  since i wasn t interested in getting paid for setting people up  i decided not to participate   for the sake of protecting the first year students  i was going to be a complete bystander   it all started when i was contacted by president nagumo of the student council   the first year students there were takahashi osamu kun and ishigami kyou kun from class a  me from class b  utomiya riku kun from class c  and housen kazuomi kun and nanase tsubasa san from class d  a total of 6 students   the student council president nagumo senpai told the six of us that he ll give 20 million points to the student who got him expelled   president nagumo said that the student was selected at random from the 2nd years   in fact  i ve already confirmed with my own eyes that he has 20 million points   when the student council president announced the exam  the acting director was also present  learns the six first years summoned by nagumo  takahashi  ishigami  yagami  utomiya  hosen  nanase  amasawa s absence noted  the claimed random 1 in 157 selection is judged false  tsukishiro s presence confirms nagumo and the acting director are behind the 20 million bounty   giving horikita a clear direction  prudent   neither confirms nor denies  lets yagami talk  judges he isn t lying but weighs the risk to class 2 d  notes yagami is a defensive fighter who pre emptively strikes  spots tsubaki observing them from behind  he defects  revealing the whole bounty scheme to warn him  partly to protect kushida  is present  surprised by the revelation  ayanokoji worries the information could affect her  confirmed as the one who summoned the first years and offered the bounty  ayanokoji doubts the  random selection  story  his presence at the announcement confirms his involvement","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p250-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p250-1\">Yagami&#x27;s revelation: Nagumo and Tsukishiro behind the bounty<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.250–258<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Walks with Yagami and Kushida to Keyaki Mall; Yagami (having joined the student council) reveals he asked Nagumo about the previous island exam, and starts explaining the bounty.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> &quot;there&#x27;s something I want to tell you, Ayanokouji-senpai. There&#x27;s a special exam that only a very small of 1st year students have been informed about.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.252<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> &quot;In April, I received a notification about this. However, since I wasn&#x27;t interested in getting paid for setting people up, I decided not to participate.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.253<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> &quot;For the sake of protecting the first year students, I was going to be a complete bystander.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.254<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>12 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It all started when I was contacted by President Nagumo of the student council.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.254<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;The first year students there were Takahashi Osamu-kun and Ishigami Kyou-kun from Class A, me from Class B, Utomiya Riku-kun from Class C, and Housen Kazuomi-kun and Nanase Tsubasa-san from Class D. A total of 6 students.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.254<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;The student council president Nagumo-senpai told the six of us that he&#x27;ll give 20 million points to the student who got him expelled.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;President Nagumo said that the student was selected at random from the 2nd years&#x27;.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.256<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;In fact, I&#x27;ve already confirmed with my own eyes that he has 20 million points.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.257<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;When the student council president announced the exam, the acting director was also present.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.257<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> Learns the six first-years summoned by Nagumo (Takahashi, Ishigami, Yagami, Utomiya, Hōsen, Nanase); Amasawa&#x27;s absence noted; the claimed random 1-in-157 selection is judged false; Tsukishiro&#x27;s presence confirms Nagumo and the acting director are behind the 20-million bounty — giving Horikita a clear direction.<span class=\"pg\">p.254–257<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Prudent — neither confirms nor denies, lets Yagami talk; judges he isn&#x27;t lying but weighs the risk to Class 2-D; notes Yagami is a defensive fighter who pre-emptively strikes; spots Tsubaki observing them from behind.<span class=\"pg\">p.250–258<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> He defects, revealing the whole bounty scheme to warn him (partly to protect Kushida).<span class=\"pg\">p.250–258<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Is present; surprised by the revelation; Ayanokōji worries the information could affect her.<span class=\"pg\">p.252–255<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Confirmed as the one who summoned the first-years and offered the bounty; Ayanokōji doubts the &quot;random selection&quot; story.<span class=\"pg\">p.254–257<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> His presence at the announcement confirms his involvement.<span class=\"pg\">p.257<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p243-1\">← Before: Ayanokōji meets Yagami and learns about the bounty<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-1\">→ After: Tsubaki (Utomiya) approaches him<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p250-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"yagami-takuya ayanokouji-kiyotaka kushida-kikyou","q":"kushida kikyo kushida learns of the bounty from yagami walks with ayanokoji and yagami to keyaki mall  listens dumbfounded as yagami reveals the secret exam   excuse me  i have no idea what you guys are talking about   eh  to get ayanokouji kun expelled   th that s a lot of points  i is that sort of thing allowed   isn t it a bit strange that the student council president is conducting this special exam on his own  genuinely unaware of the bounty  she is surprised and uneasy at the 20 million points  ayanokoji worries the information could affect her  and notes she would tell yagami things anyway  her middle school kouhai  he arranged the meeting partly to protect her and explains everything  walks with him  learns about the bounty on him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p250-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html#sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p250-1\">Kushida learns of the bounty from Yagami<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.250–258<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Walks with Ayanokōji and Yagami to Keyaki Mall; listens dumbfounded as Yagami reveals the secret exam.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;Excuse me, I have no idea what you guys are talking about…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.253<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;Eh?! To get Ayanokouji-kun expelled?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.254<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;Th-that&#x27;s a lot of points… I-is that sort of thing allowed?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Isn&#x27;t it a bit strange that the student council president is conducting this special exam on his own…?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Genuinely unaware of the bounty, she is surprised and uneasy at the 20 million points; Ayanokōji worries the information could affect her, and notes she would tell Yagami things anyway.<span class=\"pg\">p.250–258<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> Her middle-school kouhai; he arranged the meeting partly to protect her and explains everything.<span class=\"pg\">p.252–258<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Walks with him; learns about the bounty on him.<span class=\"pg\">p.252–255<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y2v2-p243-1\">← Before: Kushida arranges Ayanokōji&#x27;s meeting with Yagami<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yagami-takuya-y2v2-p250-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kushida-kikyou nagumo-miyabi utomiya-riku yagami-takuya","q":"yagami takuya yagami defects  reveals the bounty to warn ayanokoji walks with ayanokoji and kushida to keyaki mall  joined the student council  asked nagumo about the prior island exam  then reveals the secret exam   there s something i want to tell you  ayanokouji senpai  there s a special exam that only a very small of 1st year students have been informed about   in april  i received a notification about this  however  since i wasn t interested in getting paid for setting people up  i decided not to participate   i recently heard that housen kun had failed in his first attempt   for the sake of protecting the first year students  i was going to be a complete bystander   if i don t do anything about it  ayanokouji senpai  depending on the situation there s a possibility that the situation will also affect your classmate  kushida senpai   it all started when i was contacted by president nagumo of the student council   the student council president nagumo senpai told the six of us that he ll give 20 million points to the student who got him expelled   in fact  i ve already confirmed with my own eyes that he has 20 million points   when the student council president announced the exam  the acting director was also present   i m already prepared to be hated by the 1st years  because i m going to have to face the other classes sooner or later  an honor student  a in academics  beautiful calligraphy from a calligraphy teacher grandfather  who is unobnoxious and principled   refuses the bounty  defects to warn ayanokoji out of concern for kushida and the first years  and accepts he ll be hated  a defensive fighter willing to strike pre emptively  warns him about the bounty and nagumo tsukishiro s involvement  his middle school senpai whom he admires  asks her to help arrange the meeting and worries the situation will affect her  summoned him and offered the bounty  he confirmed nagumo has 20 million points  fellow bounty participant from class 1 c  notes utomiya may have told someone in his class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yagami-takuya-y2v2-p250-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html#sc-yagami-takuya-y2v2-p250-1\">Yagami defects: reveals the bounty to warn Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.250–258<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Walks with Ayanokōji and Kushida to Keyaki Mall (joined the student council, asked Nagumo about the prior island exam), then reveals the secret exam.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/utomiya-riku.html\">Utomiya Riku<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> &quot;there&#x27;s something I want to tell you, Ayanokouji-senpai. There&#x27;s a special exam that only a very small of 1st year students have been informed about.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.252<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> &quot;In April, I received a notification about this. However, since I wasn&#x27;t interested in getting paid for setting people up, I decided not to participate.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.253<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> &quot;I recently heard that Housen-kun had failed in his first attempt.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.253<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>12 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;For the sake of protecting the first year students, I was going to be a complete bystander.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.254<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;if I don&#x27;t do anything about it, Ayanokouji-senpai… depending on the situation there&#x27;s a possibility that the situation will also affect your classmate, Kushida-senpai.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.254<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It all started when I was contacted by President Nagumo of the student council.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.254<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;The student council president Nagumo-senpai told the six of us that he&#x27;ll give 20 million points to the student who got him expelled.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;In fact, I&#x27;ve already confirmed with my own eyes that he has 20 million points.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.257<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;When the student council president announced the exam, the acting director was also present.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.257<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m already prepared to be hated by the 1st years, because I&#x27;m going to have to face the other classes sooner or later.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.258<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> An honor student (A in academics, beautiful calligraphy from a calligraphy-teacher grandfather) who is unobnoxious and principled — refuses the bounty, defects to warn Ayanokōji out of concern for Kushida and the first-years, and accepts he&#x27;ll be hated; a defensive fighter willing to strike pre-emptively.<span class=\"pg\">p.250–258<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Warns him about the bounty and Nagumo/Tsukishiro&#x27;s involvement.<span class=\"pg\">p.250–258<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> His middle-school senpai whom he admires; asks her to help arrange the meeting and worries the situation will affect her.<span class=\"pg\">p.252–258<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Summoned him and offered the bounty; he confirmed Nagumo has 20 million points.<span class=\"pg\">p.254–257<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> Fellow bounty participant from Class 1-C; notes Utomiya may have told someone in his class.<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-tsubaki-sakurako-y2v2-p258-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka utomiya-riku yagami-takuya tsubaki-sakurako","q":"tsubaki sakurako tsubaki observes  helps contact ayanokoji watches ayanokoji  yagami and kushida from behind in the crowded cafe store  taking a lookout position  later appears with utomiya   is it utomiya  tsubaki helps utomiya contact ayanokoji  she doesn t mention yagami s disclosure to him  and he doesn t mention it to her   both guard their separate contact  tsubaki knew ayanokoji would have been expelled if she d given up on the earlier exam  observant and calculating   quietly monitors the group  orchestrates the introduction to utomiya  and keeps her own counsel about what she knows  brings utomiya to him  neither reveals their separate knowledge  her classmate  helps him contact ayanokoji for the hosen plot  she observed his conversation with ayanokoji without his noticing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-tsubaki-sakurako-y2v2-p258-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/tsubaki-sakurako.html#sc-tsubaki-sakurako-y2v2-p258-1\">Tsubaki observes; helps contact Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.258–270<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/tsubaki-sakurako.html\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Watches Ayanokōji, Yagami and Kushida from behind in the crowded café/store, taking a lookout position; later appears with Utomiya.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/utomiya-riku.html\">Utomiya Riku<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yagami-takuya.html\">Yagami Takuya<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/b> &quot;Is it Utomiya?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.264<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Tsubaki helps Utomiya contact Ayanokōji; she doesn&#x27;t mention Yagami&#x27;s disclosure to him, and he doesn&#x27;t mention it to her — both guard their separate contact. Tsubaki knew Ayanokōji would have been expelled if she&#x27;d given up on the earlier exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.264–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Observant and calculating — quietly monitors the group, orchestrates the introduction to Utomiya, and keeps her own counsel about what she knows.<span class=\"pg\">p.258–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Brings Utomiya to him; neither reveals their separate knowledge.<span class=\"pg\">p.264–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> Her classmate; helps him contact Ayanokōji for the Hōsen plot.<span class=\"pg\">p.264<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yagami Takuya<\/b> She observed his conversation with Ayanokōji without his noticing.<span class=\"pg\">p.258<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-tsubaki-sakurako-y2v2-p351-1\">→ After: Short story: &quot;What Could Be Seen From That Back&quot; — trailing Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"utomiya-riku ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka tsubaki  utomiya  approaches him tsubaki  a class 1 c girl  approaches him at the cafe and asks for his help against hosen  she reveals she and utomiya were also bounty participants but have given up   there is something that we wanted to tell you  that s why i approached  she explains class 1 c s revenge motive  hatano s expulsion  and he declines to commit  he is cautious and non committal   he weighs the risks  tsubaki and utomiya seek his help against hosen","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-1\">Tsubaki (Utomiya) approaches him<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.264–270<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Tsubaki (a Class 1-C girl) approaches him at the café and asks for his help against Hōsen; she reveals she and Utomiya were also bounty participants but have given up. She explains Class 1-C&#x27;s revenge motive (Hatano&#x27;s expulsion), and he declines to commit.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/utomiya-riku.html\">Utomiya Riku<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;There is something that we wanted to tell you, that&#x27;s why I approached&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.265<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is cautious and non-committal — he weighs the risks.<span class=\"pg\">p.264–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> Tsubaki and Utomiya seek his help against Hōsen.<span class=\"pg\">p.264–270<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p250-1\">← Before: Yagami&#x27;s revelation: Nagumo and Tsukishiro behind the bounty<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-2\">→ After: Utomiya and Tsubaki&#x27;s plot to expel Hōsen<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"utomiya-riku tsubaki-sakurako housen-kazuomi ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka utomiya and tsubaki s plot to expel hosen at the convenience store  tsubaki and utomiya approach him  utomiya reveals they want to take hosen by surprise on the island and force him out of class 1 d   we want to take housen by surprise on the uninhabited island exam   in class c  a boy named hatano was expelled from the school  i think housen had something to do with it   are you trying to force housen out of the school   if you re able to get housen expelled from this school   did you ever consider that i might be housen s comrade   if we get you expelled  news of that ll spread throughout the school  sees through their plan  hosen lacks points and would be forced out if he can t get the bounty  pretends not to know about yagami s disclosure or his own role  neither he nor tsubaki mentions their separate contact with him  declines to be drawn in  wants to force hosen out  hatano s expulsion cost class c 100 points  and offers him a deal  ayanokoji is wary  facilitated the contact  didn t mention yagami s disclosure  target of their plot  ayanokoji is asked about his past partnership with him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-2\">Utomiya and Tsubaki&#x27;s plot to expel Hōsen<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.264–270<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the convenience store, Tsubaki and Utomiya approach him; Utomiya reveals they want to take Hōsen by surprise on the island and force him out of Class 1-D.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/utomiya-riku.html\">Utomiya Riku<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/tsubaki-sakurako.html\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/housen-kazuomi.html\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> &quot;We want to take Housen by surprise on the uninhabited island exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.266<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> &quot;In Class C, a boy named Hatano was expelled from the school. I think Housen had something to do with it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.267<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Are you trying to force Housen out of the school?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.267<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;if you&#x27;re able to get Housen expelled from this school.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.268<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Did you ever consider that I might be Housen&#x27;s comrade?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.269<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If we get you expelled, news of that&#x27;ll spread throughout the school.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sees through their plan (Hōsen lacks points and would be forced out if he can&#x27;t get the bounty); pretends not to know about Yagami&#x27;s disclosure or his own role; neither he nor Tsubaki mentions their separate contact with him; declines to be drawn in.<span class=\"pg\">p.264–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Utomiya Riku<\/b> Wants to force Hōsen out (Hatano&#x27;s expulsion cost Class C 100 points), and offers him a deal; Ayanokōji is wary.<span class=\"pg\">p.264–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/b> Facilitated the contact; didn&#x27;t mention Yagami&#x27;s disclosure.<span class=\"pg\">p.264–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hōsen Kazuomi<\/b> Target of their plot; Ayanokōji is asked about his past partnership with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.266–270<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-1\">← Before: Tsubaki (Utomiya) approaches him<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p272-1\">→ After: Kiriyama warns him about Horikita<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiriyama-y2v2-p271-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka nagumo-miyabi horikita-suzune kiryuin-fuuka kiriyama","q":"kiriyama kiriyama   don t get in my way  at keyaki mall the student council vp calls ayanokoji out to keyaki mall a week before the small group deadline  he has been trying to stop nagumo s rampage by backing the graduated president manabu  and wants the second year to stay out of his duel with nagumo   i ve formed a group of 3 without anyone from class a   but based on my evaluation of myself  i don t think i m any weaker than nagumo   i don t want you to get in my way   to put it politely  don t do anything  admits  when ayanokoji asks if he is in trouble  that he is   the real reason for the meeting is to protect himself by keeping horikita and ayanokoji quiet  his voice grows impatient   yeah   is it really that strange  wanting to graduate from class a  proud  calculating and resigned   a b  oaa student convinced he can beat nagumo one on one  but in truth chasing nagumo s individual promotion policy to escape class b  he frames the plea as concern while protecting his own safety  and refuses to admit he has given up  summons him to demand he stay out of the nagumo horikita affair  warns that he may become an enemy  depending on the situation  his president  whom he no longer believes he can overthrow  wants a fair personal duel and hides his fear of him  sees her student council entry as an obstacle and wants ayanokoji to restrain her  his class 3 b classmate  whom he openly dislikes   calls her a lone wolf like koenji   an alien in the class  she needles him back  and nagumo has to step between them  returns with nagumo after leaving ayanokoji with kiryuuin  kiryuuin mocks him as nagumo s  loyal dog  and he bristles before nagumo interrupts on his behalf   hey hey  the loyal dog came back with his master eh   this woman s a real pain in the ass   you ve got a dirty mouth  kiriyama  it doesn t suit the image of a serious vice president   nagumo  you re wasting your time on this woman  you know that  right   kiryuuin  please don t mock my beloved student council member","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiriyama-y2v2-p271-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama.html#sc-kiriyama-y2v2-p271-1\">Kiriyama: &quot;don&#x27;t get in my way&quot; at Keyaki Mall<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.271–288<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama.html\">Kiriyama<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The student council VP calls Ayanokōji out to Keyaki Mall a week before the small-group deadline; he has been trying to stop Nagumo&#x27;s rampage by backing the graduated president Manabu, and wants the second-year to stay out of his duel with Nagumo. Admits, when Ayanokōji asks if he is in trouble, that he is — the real reason for the meeting is to protect himself by keeping Horikita and Ayanokōji quiet; his voice grows impatient. Returns with Nagumo after leaving Ayanokōji with Kiryuuin; Kiryuuin mocks him as Nagumo&#x27;s &quot;loyal dog,&quot; and he bristles before Nagumo interrupts on his behalf.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ve formed a group of 3 without anyone from Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.272<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> &quot;But based on my evaluation of myself, I don&#x27;t think I&#x27;m any weaker than Nagumo.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.273<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> &quot;I don&#x27;t want you to get in my way.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.274<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>13 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;To put it politely, don&#x27;t do anything.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.275<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;…Yeah.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.276<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Is it really that strange… Wanting to graduate from Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.277<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Proud, calculating and resigned — a B+ OAA student convinced he can beat Nagumo one-on-one, but in truth chasing Nagumo&#x27;s individual-promotion policy to escape Class B; he frames the plea as concern while protecting his own safety, and refuses to admit he has given up.<span class=\"pg\">p.271–281<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Summons him to demand he stay out of the Nagumo/Horikita affair; warns that he may become an enemy &quot;depending on the situation.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.271–281<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> His president, whom he no longer believes he can overthrow; wants a fair personal duel and hides his fear of him.<span class=\"pg\">p.271–281<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Sees her student-council entry as an obstacle and wants Ayanokōji to restrain her.<span class=\"pg\">p.274–276<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> His Class 3-B classmate, whom he openly dislikes — calls her a lone wolf like Kōenji, &quot;an alien in the class&quot;; she needles him back, and Nagumo has to step between them.<span class=\"pg\">p.278–288<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Hey hey, the loyal dog came back with his master eh?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.285<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;This woman&#x27;s a real pain in the ass…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.285<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;ve got a dirty mouth, Kiriyama, it doesn&#x27;t suit the image of a serious vice president.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.286<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Nagumo, you&#x27;re wasting your time on this woman. You know that, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.286<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Kiryuuin, please don&#x27;t mock my beloved student council member.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.286<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiriyama-y2v2-p78-1\">← Before: Kiriyama, the student council vice president<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p272-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"kiriyama-ikuto ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka kiriyama warns him about horikita kiriyama meets him and warns him not to interfere with nagumo  he reveals he wanted to battle nagumo personally but has given up   i don t want you to get in my way  horikita appears and kiriyama warns him about her involvement in the student council  he observes the nagumo kiriyama power dynamic and stays neutral  kiriyama warns him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p272-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p272-1\">Kiriyama warns him about Horikita<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.272–278<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kiriyama meets him and warns him not to interfere with Nagumo; he reveals he wanted to battle Nagumo personally but has given up. Horikita appears and Kiriyama warns him about her involvement in the student council.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I don&#x27;t want you to get in my way.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.274<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He observes the Nagumo-Kiriyama power dynamic and stays neutral.<span class=\"pg\">p.272–278<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> Kiriyama warns him.<span class=\"pg\">p.272–278<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p264-2\">← Before: Utomiya and Tsubaki&#x27;s plot to expel Hōsen<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-1\">→ After: Kanzaki asks Ayanokōji for help with Ichinose<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v2-p272-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiriyama-ikuto","q":"kiriyama ikuto kiriyama warns ayanokoji about horikita he meets ayanokoji and warns him not to interfere with nagumo  he reveals he wanted to battle nagumo personally but has given up  horikita appears and he warns about her involvement   i don t want you to get in my way  defeated and cautious   he advises ayanokoji to stay out of nagumo s way  he warns him about horikita and nagumo","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v2-p272-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html#sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v2-p272-1\">Kiriyama warns Ayanokōji about Horikita<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.272–278<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He meets Ayanokōji and warns him not to interfere with Nagumo; he reveals he wanted to battle Nagumo personally but has given up; Horikita appears and he warns about her involvement.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> &quot;I don&#x27;t want you to get in my way.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.274<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Defeated and cautious — he advises Ayanokōji to stay out of Nagumo&#x27;s way.<span class=\"pg\">p.272–278<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He warns him about Horikita and Nagumo.<span class=\"pg\">p.272–278<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiriyama-ikuto-y2v2-p78-1\">← Before: Kiriyama attends the council meeting and is shaken<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka kanzaki asks ayanokoji for help with ichinose kanzaki meets him at keyaki mall and asks if he can trust ayanokoji  he reveals ichinose is struggling and asks for help changing her mind   ayanokouji  ichinose seems to trust you a lot  but can  we  really trust you  ayanokoji declines to help ichinose change her approach  saying he wants to see her own way of dealing with things  he is honest but non committal   he respects ichinose s autonomy  kanzaki asks for his help","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-1\">Kanzaki asks Ayanokōji for help with Ichinose<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.294–297<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kanzaki meets him at Keyaki Mall and asks if he can trust Ayanokōji; he reveals Ichinose is struggling and asks for help changing her mind. Ayanokōji declines to help Ichinose change her approach, saying he wants to see her own way of dealing with things.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji, Ichinose seems to trust you a lot, but can &#x27;we&#x27; really trust you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.295<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is honest but non-committal — he respects Ichinose&#x27;s autonomy.<span class=\"pg\">p.294–297<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Kanzaki asks for his help.<span class=\"pg\">p.294–297<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p272-1\">← Before: Kiriyama warns him about Horikita<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-2\">→ After: Kanzaki&#x27;s appeal about Ichinose<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka kanzaki s appeal about ichinose on the way to keyaki mall  summoned by ryuen  runs into kanzaki with two 2 liter bottles  kanzaki  growing more wary as his opinion rises  probes whether ayanokoji and horikita will act as  reinforcements   you and horikita  are both of you going to act as reinforcements for your class s groups   ayanokouji  ichinose seems to trust you a lot  but can  we  really trust you   although we ve broken off the alliance  i don t consider ichinose to be an enemy   kanazki  what do you want from me   i m simply going to come out and ask you for help  ichinose trusts you a lot  that is why i want you to tell her yourself  the way she is right now  she isn t good enough   sorry  but i can t help you  i d like to keep seeing her own way of dealing with things   well  fundamentally speaking  one has to care of their own class by themselves  isn t that right  sees through kanzaki s attempt to get a statement for ichinose to hear  is briefly conflicted about telling him his fear that ichinose s next fall would be her last  but stops himself  it would only contaminate them  notes a cornered rat can bite the cat  desperately asks him to warn ichinose  admits he was  too childish  and walks away  refuses to help because she must see things her own way  worries about her fragility","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-2\">Kanzaki&#x27;s appeal about Ichinose<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.294–297<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On the way to Keyaki Mall (summoned by Ryūen), runs into Kanzaki with two 2-liter bottles; Kanzaki (growing more wary as his opinion rises) probes whether Ayanokōji and Horikita will act as &quot;reinforcements.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;You and Horikita, are both of you going to act as reinforcements for your class&#x27;s groups?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.295<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji, Ichinose seems to trust you a lot, but can &#x27;we&#x27; really trust you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.295<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Although we&#x27;ve broken off the alliance, I don&#x27;t consider Ichinose to be an enemy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.296<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Kanazki, what do you want from me?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.296<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m simply going to come out and ask you for help. Ichinose trusts you a lot. That is why I want you to tell her yourself: the way she is right now, she isn&#x27;t good enough.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.296<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Sorry, but I can&#x27;t help you. I&#x27;d like to keep seeing her own way of dealing with things.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.297<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Well, fundamentally speaking, one has to care of their own class by themselves. Isn&#x27;t that right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.297<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sees through Kanzaki&#x27;s attempt to get a statement for Ichinose to hear; is briefly conflicted about telling him his fear that Ichinose&#x27;s next fall would be her last, but stops himself (it would only contaminate them); notes a cornered rat can bite the cat.<span class=\"pg\">p.294–297<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Desperately asks him to warn Ichinose; admits he was &quot;too childish&quot; and walks away.<span class=\"pg\">p.294–297<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Refuses to help because she must see things her own way; worries about her fragility.<span class=\"pg\">p.296–297<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-1\">← Before: Kanzaki asks Ayanokōji for help with Ichinose<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-1\">→ After: Ryūen&#x27;s three-class alliance meeting<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p294-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji kanzaki asks ayanokoji for help he meets ayanokoji at keyaki mall and asks if he can trust him  he reveals ichinose is struggling and asks for help changing her mind   ayanokouji  ichinose seems to trust you a lot  but can  we  really trust you  worried and desperate   he wants ayanokoji to help ichinose","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p294-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html#sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p294-1\">Kanzaki asks Ayanokōji for help<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.294–297<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He meets Ayanokōji at Keyaki Mall and asks if he can trust him; he reveals Ichinose is struggling and asks for help changing her mind.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> &quot;Ayanokouji, Ichinose seems to trust you a lot, but can &#x27;we&#x27; really trust you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.295<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Worried and desperate — he wants Ayanokōji to help Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.294–297<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p47-1\">← Before: Kanzaki&#x27;s hostility toward Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru katsuragi-kouhei ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ryuen s three class alliance meeting ryuen summons ayanokoji and katsuragi to a cafe and proposes a three class alliance  a  b  d  to take down sakayanagi  katsuragi is hostile   the reward for getting 1st to 3rd place is enough to get within shooting distance of class a  ryuen reveals he knows ayanokoji beat him and asks him to join  he declines  ryuen then tries to recruit katsuragi to class b   not just you  ayanokouji as well  who s spaced out over there just listening to us   come to class b  katsuragi  he observes the negotiation and stays uncommitted  ryuen summons him and tries to recruit him  katsuragi is hostile to the alliance","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-1\">Ryūen&#x27;s three-class alliance meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.298–311<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ryūen summons Ayanokōji and Katsuragi to a café and proposes a three-class alliance (A, B, D) to take down Sakayanagi; Katsuragi is hostile. Ryūen reveals he knows Ayanokōji beat him and asks him to join; he declines; Ryūen then tries to recruit Katsuragi to Class B.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;The reward for getting 1st to 3rd place is enough to get within shooting distance of Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.303<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Not just you. Ayanokouji as well, who&#x27;s spaced out over there just listening to us.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.304<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Come to Class B, Katsuragi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.308<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He observes the negotiation and stays uncommitted.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Ryūen summons him and tries to recruit him.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Katsuragi is hostile to the alliance.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p294-2\">← Before: Kanzaki&#x27;s appeal about Ichinose<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-2\">→ After: Ryūen and Katsuragi&#x27;s meeting; buying Katsuragi<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"katsuragi-kouhei ryuuen-kakeru ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ryuen and katsuragi s meeting  buying katsuragi arrives at the keyaki mall cafe to find ryuen  who summoned him  with katsuragi of class a   an oil and water pair  the atmosphere peculiar   you said there was someone else  were you talking about ayanokouji   you never had the vibe of an ordinary student  ayanokouji  but that was quite the trick you hid up your sleeve   then  let me make this simple for you  i m not going to tell you anything about this  you bastard   don t you want to crawl back to the top again   don t you think it ll be an interesting development if we manage to get sakayanagi expelled from the next special exam   the most important thing about this special exam is to not lose any points from the 2nd year   come to class b  katsuragi   this is your fate  accept it  sees ryuen s real aim  exploit katsuragi s buried vendetta against sakayanagi  and the totsuka expulsion wound  use  20 million points  5m to nullify his contract   class funds  to bring him to class b   never truly to expel sakayanagi  but to climb past class a  katsuragi signs the prepared contract  plays dumb  i echoed katsuragi and shrugged  watches the maneuvering  pours diluted coffee and when asked says he wondered what it d taste like 3 4x diluted  baffling them   a strange  detached presence  invites him  for his trial card  and uses him as a wedge against katsuragi  he refuses to join the group  the class a outsider  signs ryuen s contract to transfer to class b","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-2\">Ryūen and Katsuragi&#x27;s meeting; buying Katsuragi<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.298–311<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives at the Keyaki Mall café to find Ryūen (who summoned him) with Katsuragi of Class A — an oil-and-water pair; the atmosphere peculiar.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;You said there was someone else, were you talking about Ayanokouji?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.298<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;You never had the vibe of an ordinary student, Ayanokouji, but that was quite the trick you hid up your sleeve.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.298<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;Then, let me make this simple for you. I&#x27;m not going to tell you anything about this, you bastard.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.300<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Don&#x27;t you want to crawl back to the top again?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.301<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Don&#x27;t you think it&#x27;ll be an interesting development if we manage to get Sakayanagi expelled from the next special exam?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.301<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;The most important thing about this special exam is to not lose any points from the 2nd year.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.304<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Come to Class B, Katsuragi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.308<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;This is your fate. Accept it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> Sees Ryūen&#x27;s real aim: exploit Katsuragi&#x27;s buried vendetta against Sakayanagi (and the Totsuka-expulsion wound), use ~20 million points (5M to nullify his contract + class funds) to bring him to Class B — never truly to expel Sakayanagi, but to climb past Class A; Katsuragi signs the prepared contract.<span class=\"pg\">p.301–311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Plays dumb (&quot;I echoed Katsuragi and shrugged&quot;), watches the maneuvering; pours diluted coffee and when asked says he wondered what it&#x27;d taste like 3–4x diluted, baffling them — a strange, detached presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Invites him (for his Trial card) and uses him as a wedge against Katsuragi; he refuses to join the group.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> The Class A outsider; signs Ryūen&#x27;s contract to transfer to Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-1\">← Before: Ryūen&#x27;s three-class alliance meeting<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p313-1\">→ After: Selling the Trial card for the Half Off card<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v2-p298-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru katsuragi-kouhei","q":"katsuragi kohei katsuragi is summoned by ryuen he is summoned to a cafe by ryuen  who proposes a three class alliance  he is hostile and refuses  ryuen tries to recruit him to class b using money from nullifying his contract with sakayanagi   are you crazy  you re asking me to come to class b  proud and principled   he refuses ryuen s overtures  he is hostile to ryuen s alliance","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v2-p298-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html#sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v2-p298-1\">Katsuragi is summoned by Ryūen<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.298–311<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He is summoned to a café by Ryūen, who proposes a three-class alliance; he is hostile and refuses. Ryūen tries to recruit him to Class B using money from nullifying his contract with Sakayanagi.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;Are you crazy? You&#x27;re asking me to come to Class B?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.308<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Proud and principled — he refuses Ryūen&#x27;s overtures.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> He is hostile to Ryūen&#x27;s alliance.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v2-p298-2\">→ After: Katsuragi&#x27;s vendetta; signs Ryūen&#x27;s contract to transfer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v2-p298-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru sakayanagi-arisu totsuka-yahiko ayanokouji-kiyotaka katsuragi-kouhei","q":"katsuragi kohei katsuragi s vendetta  signs ryuen s contract to transfer joins ryuen s cafe meeting with ayanokoji  stiff and uneasy at being seen with ryuen   you said there was someone else  were you talking about ayanokouji   what kind of meeting is this supposed to be  anyway   there s no way i can chill  if people see me with you  i ll be in trouble   then  let me make this simple for you  i m not going to tell you anything about this  you bastard   didn t you also lose to ishizaki that one time   i don t know what you re planning to do  but that s impossible  even if you trap her on the island  she has plenty of private points for relief   if you wanted to make me angry  then you ve succeeded  ryuuen  are you satisfied now   you seem to be serious   although i don t really care that you brought me into your ranks  what exactly are you looking for  the isolated class a outsider  not in sakayanagi s faction  with a buried vendetta over yahiko totsuka s expulsion  refuses to betray sakayanagi s plans  but ryuen exploits his hatred  20 million points to nullify his contract and transfer him  and he signs   moving down to class b  the first individual class transfer in the school s history  manipulates him via his vendetta  he accepts the transfer despite knowing ryuen s self serving motives  his class leader and rival  refuses to reveal her plans  but agrees to leave after ryuen s offer  his admirer  whose expulsion  linked to ryuen  fuels his anger  calls his perfect score impressive  notices he beat ryuen  later questions why ryuen wants his trial card  he holds the half off card that gets swapped to class d","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v2-p298-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html#sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v2-p298-2\">Katsuragi&#x27;s vendetta; signs Ryūen&#x27;s contract to transfer<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.298–312<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Joins Ryūen&#x27;s café meeting with Ayanokōji, stiff and uneasy at being seen with Ryūen.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/totsuka-yahiko.html\">Totsuka Yahiko<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;You said there was someone else, were you talking about Ayanokouji?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.298<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;What kind of meeting is this supposed to be, anyway?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.298<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;There&#x27;s no way I can chill. if people see me with you, I&#x27;ll be in trouble.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.299<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Then, let me make this simple for you. I&#x27;m not going to tell you anything about this, you bastard.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.300<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Didn&#x27;t you also lose to Ishizaki that one time?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.301<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I don&#x27;t know what you&#x27;re planning to do, but that&#x27;s impossible. Even if you trap her on the island, she has plenty of private points for relief.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.301<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If you wanted to make me angry, then you&#x27;ve succeeded, Ryuuen. Are you satisfied now?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.308<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You seem to be serious.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Although I don&#x27;t really care that you brought me into your ranks, what exactly are you looking for?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.312<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> The isolated Class A outsider (not in Sakayanagi&#x27;s faction) with a buried vendetta over Yahiko Totsuka&#x27;s expulsion; refuses to betray Sakayanagi&#x27;s plans, but Ryūen exploits his hatred (~20 million points to nullify his contract and transfer him) and he signs — moving DOWN to Class B, the first individual class transfer in the school&#x27;s history.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–312<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Manipulates him via his vendetta; he accepts the transfer despite knowing Ryūen&#x27;s self-serving motives.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–312<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> His class leader and rival; refuses to reveal her plans, but agrees to leave after Ryūen&#x27;s offer.<span class=\"pg\">p.300–311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Totsuka Yahiko<\/b> His admirer, whose expulsion (linked to Ryūen) fuels his anger.<span class=\"pg\">p.301<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Calls his perfect score impressive; notices he beat Ryūen; later questions why Ryūen wants his Trial card; he holds the Half Off card that gets swapped to Class D.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–312<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v2-p298-1\">← Before: Katsuragi is summoned by Ryūen<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v2-p298-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka katsuragi-kouhei ryuuen-kakeru","q":"ryuen kakeru ryuen proposes a three class alliance he summons ayanokoji and katsuragi to a cafe and proposes a three class alliance  a  b  d  to take down sakayanagi   the reward for getting 1st to 3rd place is enough to get within shooting distance of class a  he reveals he knows ayanokoji beat him and tries to recruit katsuragi to class b   not just you  ayanokouji as well  who s spaced out over there just listening to us   come to class b  katsuragi  calculating and bold   he uses money and leverage to build alliances  he tries to recruit him  he tries to recruit him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v2-p298-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html#sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v2-p298-1\">Ryūen proposes a three-class alliance<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.298–311<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He summons Ayanokōji and Katsuragi to a café and proposes a three-class alliance (A, B, D) to take down Sakayanagi. He reveals he knows Ayanokōji beat him and tries to recruit Katsuragi to Class B.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;The reward for getting 1st to 3rd place is enough to get within shooting distance of Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.303<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Not just you. Ayanokouji as well, who&#x27;s spaced out over there just listening to us.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.304<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Come to Class B, Katsuragi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.308<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calculating and bold — he uses money and leverage to build alliances.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He tries to recruit him.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> He tries to recruit him.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–311<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v2-p298-2\">→ After: Ryūen&#x27;s three-class alliance and Katsuragi buyout<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v2-p298-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"katsuragi-kouhei ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakayanagi-arisu ryuuen-kakeru","q":"ryuen kakeru ryuen s three class alliance and katsuragi buyout summons ayanokoji and katsuragi to a keyaki mall cafe   an unlikely pair   to propose an alliance for the island exam   what  do you want to stand while we talk  sit down   kuku  don t admire him too much  katsuragi  that s in the past   fuck off  ichinose was off sinking on her own  she was never even on my radar   i don t want any of that diplomatic crap  i want just straight answers   it looks like it s the end of the road for the loser of the faction war  eh   even so  ichinose really did agree to team up with that woman   why would i call you here if you weren t    to ayanokoji  stop with that poor acting  you re the man who beat me and shut me up   come to class b  katsuragi   this is your fate  accept it   why  it s the trial card he received   sell it to me  bold and manipulative   taunts katsuragi about his loss and totsuka  proposes buying sakayanagi s expulsion  a joke to gauge him  then offers  20 million points to bring katsuragi to class b  wants ayanokoji not as a group member but to buy his trial card  aiming for 450 class points with first place  exploits his vendetta to transfer him to class b  knows he beat him  wants his trial card  the target of his fake expulsion talk  wants to climb past class a  ryuen s class b had been squeezed 20 000 points student monthly under the katsuragi contract  9 36 million year  nullifying it frees the class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v2-p298-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html#sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v2-p298-2\">Ryūen&#x27;s three-class alliance and Katsuragi buyout<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.298–314<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Summons Ayanokōji and Katsuragi to a Keyaki Mall café — an unlikely pair — to propose an alliance for the island exam.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;What, do you want to stand while we talk? Sit down.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.298<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Kuku, don&#x27;t admire him too much, Katsuragi– that&#x27;s in the past.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.298<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Fuck off. Ichinose was off sinking on her own, she was never even on my radar.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.299<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>14 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I don&#x27;t want any of that diplomatic crap, I want just straight answers.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.300<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It looks like it&#x27;s the end of the road for the loser of the faction war, eh?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.301<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Even so, Ichinose really did agree to team up with that woman.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.303<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Why would I call you here if you weren&#x27;t.&quot; — to Ayanokōji<span class=\"pg\">p.304<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Stop with that poor acting. You&#x27;re the man who beat me and shut me up.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.305<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Come to Class B, Katsuragi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.308<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;This is your fate. Accept it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.311<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Why, it&#x27;s the Trial card he received.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.313<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Sell it to me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.313<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Bold and manipulative — taunts Katsuragi about his loss and Totsuka, proposes buying Sakayanagi&#x27;s expulsion (a joke to gauge him), then offers ~20 million points to bring Katsuragi to Class B; wants Ayanokōji not as a group member but to buy his Trial card (aiming for 450 class points with first place).<span class=\"pg\">p.298–314<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Exploits his vendetta to transfer him to Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–312<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Knows he beat him; wants his Trial card.<span class=\"pg\">p.298–314<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> The target of his fake expulsion talk; wants to climb past Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.301–303<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ryūen&#x27;s Class B had been squeezed 20,000 points/student monthly under the Katsuragi contract (~9.36 million/year); nullifying it frees the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.309<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v2-p298-1\">← Before: Ryūen proposes a three-class alliance<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v2-p299-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"kamuro-masumi","q":"kamuro masumi kamuro mentioned in passing named in ryuen s alliance meeting  passing mention  not a distinct scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v2-p299-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html#sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v2-p299-1\">Kamuro mentioned in passing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.299<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html\">Kamuro Masumi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in Ryūen&#x27;s alliance meeting.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention; not a distinct scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.299<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.299<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p313-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru karuizawa-kei ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka selling the trial card for the half off card  why  it s the trial card he received   sell it to me   i have one condition  make a student in your class that has a half off card exchange their card with one of our students that has the free ride card  refuses to join ryuen s group but agrees to sell the trial card  500 000 points  on condition a half off card is swapped to class d   to keep kei safe  limiting relief cost to 1 million if she s hit with the penalty  with the trial card and first place ryuen could gain 450 class points  pushing class b past 1000  sells him the trial card in exchange for the half off card swap  arranges the half off card so she can be protected in the exam","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p313-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p313-1\">Selling the Trial card for the Half Off card<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.313–314<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Why, it&#x27;s the Trial card he received.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.313<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Sell it to me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.313<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I have one condition. Make a student in your class that has a Half Off card exchange their card with one of our students that has the Free Ride card.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.313<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Refuses to join Ryūen&#x27;s group but agrees to sell the Trial card (~500,000 points) on condition a Half Off card is swapped to Class D — to keep Kei safe (limiting relief cost to 1 million if she&#x27;s hit with the penalty); with the Trial card and first place Ryūen could gain 450 class points, pushing Class B past 1000.<span class=\"pg\">p.313–314<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Sells him the Trial card in exchange for the Half Off card swap.<span class=\"pg\">p.313–314<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Arranges the Half Off card so she can be protected in the exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.313<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p298-2\">← Before: Ryūen and Katsuragi&#x27;s meeting; buying Katsuragi<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p315-1\">→ After: Arranging a partner for Ibuki; the &quot;go alone&quot; debate with Horikita<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p315-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ibuki-mio ishizaki-daichi ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka arranging a partner for ibuki  the  go alone  debate with horikita  give me some time  i think i have an idea   what are you going to do about your group    horikita  i know you re doing that so you can act as the situation demands  but what if you get sick and are eliminated   you had a problem with your health during the uninhabited island exam last year   but  my risks and your risks are different   how about grouping up with her for the special exam  horikita  arranges for the unpaired ibuki  class b  to group with horikita  two girls can merge with another small group later  argues with horikita about going solo  citing her prior year illness and winter fever versus his perfect attendance  and wins her agreement to hear ibuki out  debates the risks of going alone  proposes she group with ibuki  she agrees to hear her out  left unpaired  he finds her a partner in horikita  calls him about ibuki being alone  he promises to help","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p315-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p315-1\">Arranging a partner for Ibuki; the &quot;go alone&quot; debate with Horikita<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.315–318<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ibuki-mio.html\">Ibuki Mio<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Give me some time. I think I have an idea.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.316<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;What are you going to do about your group?&quot; — Horikita<span class=\"pg\">p.316<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;I know you&#x27;re doing that so you can act as the situation demands. But what if you get sick and are eliminated?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.316<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You had a problem with your health during the uninhabited island exam last year.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.317<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;But, my risks and your risks are different.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.317<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;How about grouping up with her for the special exam, Horikita?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.318<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Arranges for the unpaired Ibuki (Class B) to group with Horikita (two girls can merge with another small group later); argues with Horikita about going solo, citing her prior-year illness and winter fever versus his perfect attendance, and wins her agreement to hear Ibuki out.<span class=\"pg\">p.315–318<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Debates the risks of going alone; proposes she group with Ibuki; she agrees to hear her out.<span class=\"pg\">p.316–318<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ibuki Mio<\/b> Left unpaired; he finds her a partner in Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.315–318<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Calls him about Ibuki being alone; he promises to help.<span class=\"pg\">p.315–316<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p313-1\">← Before: Selling the Trial card for the Half Off card<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-1\">→ After: Epilogue: Kōenji&#x27;s deal with Horikita<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p316-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ibuki-mio kouenji-rokusuke horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita s solo stance  agrees to meet ibuki  it s too late to bring that up  anyway  i m not going to group up with anyone this time   i can t believe you re bringing up something which happened a year ago  anyone can get sick   in terms of taking care of myself  i m more confident than you are   i see  it s true that i m not as good as you at taking care of myself  i admit that   it s enough that you know  i had no intention of opposing you   me and ibuki   that s true  having some kind of insurance would be better  all right  i ll hear her out  plans to go solo to act as the situation demands  defends her health  illness last island exam   winter fever  but concedes ayanokoji s perfect attendance  refuses to fight him  and agrees to hear out grouping with ibuki as insurance  debates the solo exam risks  he proposes she group with ibuki  agrees to hear out a partnership with her  one of the three in class d still ungrouped  with horikita and ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p316-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p316-1\">Horikita&#x27;s solo stance; agrees to meet Ibuki<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.316–318<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ibuki-mio.html\">Ibuki Mio<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s too late to bring that up. Anyway, I&#x27;m not going to group up with anyone this time.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.316<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;I can&#x27;t believe you&#x27;re bringing up something which happened a year ago. Anyone can get sick.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.317<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;In terms of taking care of myself, I&#x27;m more confident than you are.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.317<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I see. It&#x27;s true that I&#x27;m not as good as you at taking care of myself. I admit that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.317<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It&#x27;s enough that you know. I had no intention of opposing you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.317<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Me and Ibuki?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.318<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That&#x27;s true, having some kind of insurance would be better… All right, I&#x27;ll hear her out.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.318<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Plans to go solo to act as the situation demands; defends her health (illness last island exam + winter fever) but concedes Ayanokōji&#x27;s perfect attendance; refuses to fight him, and agrees to hear out grouping with Ibuki as insurance.<span class=\"pg\">p.316–318<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Debates the solo-exam risks; he proposes she group with Ibuki.<span class=\"pg\">p.316–318<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ibuki Mio<\/b> Agrees to hear out a partnership with her.<span class=\"pg\">p.318<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> One of the three in Class D still ungrouped (with Horikita and Ayanokōji).<span class=\"pg\">p.317<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p119-2\">← Before: Horikita on the exam and group selection<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p329-1\">→ After: Horikita negotiates with Kōenji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"kouenji-rokusuke horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka epilogue  koenji s deal with horikita on the morning before the exam  koenji approaches horikita and offers to get first place alone in exchange for  full freedom  until graduation  horikita counters with a condition   if he doesn t win first place  he must help in future exams   sorry kouenji kun  i put too much value on your talent to let you do  just alright  on this exam and be a spectator later on  koenji accepts  ayanokoji reflects on the fierce competition ahead  sakayanagi  ichinose  ryuen  hosen  amasawa  nagumo  kiriyama  kiryuin  he is analytical and forward looking   he sizes up the competition  koenji makes his deal with horikita  horikita negotiates the deal","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-1\">Epilogue: Kōenji&#x27;s deal with Horikita<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.327–335<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On the morning before the exam, Kōenji approaches Horikita and offers to get first place alone in exchange for &quot;full freedom&quot; until graduation; Horikita counters with a condition — if he doesn&#x27;t win first place, he must help in future exams. Kōenji accepts; Ayanokōji reflects on the fierce competition ahead (Sakayanagi, Ichinose, Ryūen, Hōsen, Amasawa, Nagumo, Kiriyama, Kiryūin).<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Sorry Kouenji-kun, I put too much value on your talent to let you do &quot;just alright&quot; on this exam and be a spectator later on.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.329<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is analytical and forward-looking — he sizes up the competition.<span class=\"pg\">p.327–335<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> Kōenji makes his deal with Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.327–335<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Horikita negotiates the deal.<span class=\"pg\">p.327–335<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p315-1\">← Before: Arranging a partner for Ibuki; the &quot;go alone&quot; debate with Horikita<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-2\">→ After: The eve of the island exam; Kōenji&#x27;s deal with Horikita<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-2","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ishigami-kyou chabashira-sae kouenji-rokusuke horikita-suzune tsubaki-sakurako ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the eve of the island exam  koenji s deal with horikita on the last day of the first semester  waits in the classroom  keisei comes to his seat  grim about surviving the island  you might as well ask me to catch a cloud  and vows to help his comrades despite being in a different group   honestly  surviving on an uninhabited island isn t something very good at   my perfect attendance record at least until now is one of the few things that i m proud of   you re starting to sound a bit sarcastic lately  you know  notes the girl specific hardships of the exam  promises keisei he ll lend a hand  chabashira warns the class not to be complacent and wishes none disappear  watches koenji negotiate with horikita  he fears the island exam and worries about ayanokoji going solo  6 million point penalty  vows to protect his comrades  gives the final checklist and a warning  hopes no one is expelled  negotiates with horikita for  full freedom  in exchange for a top result  ayanokoji admires her  beautifully added condition   if he fails to get first  he must contribute in future exams  she extracts a no lose deal from koenji  hopes class 2 d can take first while he takes 2nd 3rd to jump to class b  among the first year  up and coming  threats  with hosen  eyeing first place  competitors for first place include sakayanagi  ichinose  ryuen  first years hosen and amasawa  and third years nagumo  kiriyama and kiryuin  ayanokoji himself intends a high spot","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-2\">The eve of the island exam; Kōenji&#x27;s deal with Horikita<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.327–335<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On the last day of the first semester, waits in the classroom; Keisei comes to his seat, grim about surviving the island (&quot;you might as well ask me to catch a cloud&quot;) and vows to help his comrades despite being in a different group.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ishigami-kyou.html\">Ishigami Kyō<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/tsubaki-sakurako.html\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō<\/b> &quot;Honestly, surviving on an uninhabited island isn&#x27;t something very good at.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.327<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;My perfect attendance record at least until now is one of the few things that I&#x27;m proud of.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.328<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;re starting to sound a bit sarcastic lately, you know?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.328<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Notes the girl-specific hardships of the exam, promises Keisei he&#x27;ll lend a hand; Chabashira warns the class not to be complacent and wishes none disappear; watches Kōenji negotiate with Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.327–335<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō<\/b> He fears the island exam and worries about Ayanokōji going solo (6-million-point penalty); vows to protect his comrades.<span class=\"pg\">p.327–328<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Gives the final checklist and a warning; hopes no one is expelled.<span class=\"pg\">p.328–329<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> Negotiates with Horikita for &quot;full freedom&quot; in exchange for a top result; Ayanokōji admires her &quot;beautifully added condition&quot; (if he fails to get first, he must contribute in future exams).<span class=\"pg\">p.330–334<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She extracts a no-lose deal from Kōenji; hopes Class 2-D can take first while he takes 2nd/3rd to jump to Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.330–334<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/b> Among the first-year &quot;up and coming&quot; threats (with Hōsen) eyeing first place.<span class=\"pg\">p.335<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Competitors for first place include Sakayanagi, Ichinose, Ryūen, first-years Hōsen and Amasawa, and third-years Nagumo, Kiriyama and Kiryūin; Ayanokōji himself intends a high spot.<span class=\"pg\">p.335<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-1\">← Before: Epilogue: Kōenji&#x27;s deal with Horikita<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p336-1\">→ After: Tsukishiro&#x27;s bombshell: Nanase is the enforcer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p327-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yukimura-teruhiko","q":"yukimura teruhiko keisei worries about ayanokoji going solo he comes to ayanokoji s seat before the exam and worries about him going alone  ayanokoji promises to help if needed   but  are you alright going alone  if you get sick  it s over  caring and anxious   he worries about his friend  he worries about him going solo","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p327-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html#sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p327-1\">Keisei worries about Ayanokōji going solo<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.327–328<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He comes to Ayanokōji&#x27;s seat before the exam and worries about him going alone; Ayanokōji promises to help if needed.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> &quot;But, are you alright going alone? If you get sick, it&#x27;s over.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.328<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Caring and anxious — he worries about his friend.<span class=\"pg\">p.327–328<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He worries about him going solo.<span class=\"pg\">p.327–328<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y2v2-p23-1\">← Before: Yukimura&#x27;s reconciliation with Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p328-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae","q":"chabashira sae chabashira s pre exam speech she gives a serious pre exam speech  warning the class not to get complacent and hoping no one disappears   i ve only got one wish for all of you  if you can  don t let a single one of your classmates disappear  and return to this classroom once again  stern and caring   she warns the class about the difficulty ahead","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p328-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html#sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p328-1\">Chabashira&#x27;s pre-exam speech<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.328–329<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She gives a serious pre-exam speech, warning the class not to get complacent and hoping no one disappears.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;I&#x27;ve only got one wish for all of you. If you can, don&#x27;t let a single one of your classmates disappear, and return to this classroom once again.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.329<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Stern and caring — she warns the class about the difficulty ahead.<span class=\"pg\">p.328–329<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y2v2-p117-2\">← Before: Chabashira&#x27;s island exam briefing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p329-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"kouenji-rokusuke horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune horikita negotiates with koenji koenji offers to get first place alone in exchange for full freedom  she counters with a condition   if he doesn t win  he must help in future exams   sorry kouenji kun  i put too much value on your talent to let you do  just alright  on this exam and be a spectator later on   if you don t get first place  then you will have to help the class in the future  such as the next special exam  and get results  strategic and firm   she extracts a commitment from koenji  she negotiates with him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p329-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p329-1\">Horikita negotiates with Kōenji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.329–335<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kōenji offers to get first place alone in exchange for full freedom; she counters with a condition — if he doesn&#x27;t win, he must help in future exams.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Sorry Kouenji-kun, I put too much value on your talent to let you do &quot;just alright&quot; on this exam and be a spectator later on.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.329<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;If you don&#x27;t get first place, then you will have to help the class in the future, such as the next special exam, and get results.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.333<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Strategic and firm — she extracts a commitment from Kōenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.329–335<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> She negotiates with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.329–335<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p316-1\">← Before: Horikita&#x27;s solo stance; agrees to meet Ibuki<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p348-1\">→ After: Short story: &quot;He Who Stands Beside Me&quot; — joining the council<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v2-p329-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji negotiates with horikita he approaches horikita before the exam and offers to get first place alone in exchange for  full freedom  until graduation  horikita counters with a condition   promise you full freedom  that s an unexpected proposal   i see  i see  certainly  you seem like you will be satisfied if i get 1st place by myself  riiight  confident and calculating   he negotiates for freedom but accepts horikita s condition  he negotiates with her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v2-p329-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html#sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v2-p329-1\">Kōenji negotiates with Horikita<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.329–335<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He approaches Horikita before the exam and offers to get first place alone in exchange for &quot;full freedom&quot; until graduation; Horikita counters with a condition.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> &quot;Promise you full freedom… That&#x27;s an unexpected proposal.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.330<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> &quot;I see, I see. Certainly, you seem like you will be satisfied if I get 1st place by myself, riiight?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.332<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Confident and calculating — he negotiates for freedom but accepts Horikita&#x27;s condition.<span class=\"pg\">p.329–335<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> He negotiates with her.<span class=\"pg\">p.329–335<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p336-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"tsukishiro nanase-tsubasa ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka tsukishiro s bombshell  nanase is the enforcer in late july  tsukishiro   acting director  watches buses enter the school and presses a first year student to expel ayanokoji by any means in the island exam   please  are you done with your analysis yet  prolonging it anymore won t help you   you re saying i should  expel ayanokouji kiyotaka   i want you to expel ayanokouji kiyotaka by any means necessary  is that clear   once everything is taken care of  you will also return to your previous life   i m expecting great things from you  nanase tsubasa san  tsukishiro admits he pressured for budget increases and silenced school authorities over the exam s strict rules  with the allegations against chairman sakayanagi cleared  his tenure as temporary chairman is ending  so he s prepared  splendid fireworks  confirms nanase tsubasa is the white room enforcer sent to expel him   the girl s left hand clenches with  natural power  and tsukishiro smiles  expecting great things  revealed as the white room student   the mystery of the agent is solved for the reader  desperate to expel ayanokoji before losing his position  he and the enforcer will return to the place they re supposed to be","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p336-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p336-1\">Tsukishiro&#x27;s bombshell: Nanase is the enforcer<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.336–337<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In late July, Tsukishiro ( Acting Director) watches buses enter the school and presses a first-year student to expel Ayanokōji by any means in the island exam.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> &quot;Please, are you done with your analysis yet? Prolonging it anymore won&#x27;t help you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.336<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;re saying I should— expel Ayanokouji Kiyotaka?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.336<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> &quot;I want you to expel Ayanokouji Kiyotaka by any means necessary, is that clear?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Once everything is taken care of, you will also return to your previous life.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m expecting great things from you— Nanase Tsubasa-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> Tsukishiro admits he pressured for budget increases and silenced school authorities over the exam&#x27;s strict rules; with the allegations against Chairman Sakayanagi cleared, his tenure as temporary chairman is ending, so he&#x27;s prepared &quot;splendid fireworks.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.336–337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Confirms Nanase Tsubasa is the White Room enforcer sent to expel him — the girl&#x27;s left hand clenches with &quot;natural power,&quot; and Tsukishiro smiles, expecting great things.<span class=\"pg\">p.336–337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> Revealed as the White Room student — the mystery of the agent is solved for the reader.<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Desperate to expel Ayanokōji before losing his position; he and the enforcer will return to the place they&#x27;re supposed to be.<span class=\"pg\">p.336–337<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v2-p327-2\">← Before: The eve of the island exam; Kōenji&#x27;s deal with Horikita<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v2-p336-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"narration","w":"tsukishiro ayanokouji-kiyotaka nanase-tsubasa","q":"nanase tsubasa tsukishiro reveals nanase as the enforcer stands with tsukishiro as buses arrive  responding without emotion to his question about the late july heat  pressed to finally expel ayanokoji   yes  you are right    her emotionless reply  you re saying i should  expel ayanokouji kiyotaka   yes  i won t hesitate anymore  the white room enforcer whose left hand clenches as if brimming with natural power when tsukishiro names her   after his urging she resolves to stop hesitating and act in the island exam  tsukishiro calls her  nanase tsubasa san  her handler  pressures her to expel ayanokoji before his tenure ends and promises they ll return to their  previous life  her target  she agrees to act without hesitation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v2-p336-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html#sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v2-p336-1\">Tsukishiro reveals Nanase as the enforcer<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.336–337<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Stands with Tsukishiro as buses arrive, responding without emotion to his question about the late July heat; pressed to finally expel Ayanokōji.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;Yes, you are right.&quot; — her emotionless reply<span class=\"pg\">p.336<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;re saying I should— expel Ayanokouji Kiyotaka?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.336<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> &quot;—Yes. I won&#x27;t hesitate anymore.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> The White Room enforcer whose left hand clenches as if brimming with natural power when Tsukishiro names her — after his urging she resolves to stop hesitating and act in the island exam; Tsukishiro calls her &quot;Nanase Tsubasa-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.336–337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Her handler; pressures her to expel Ayanokōji before his tenure ends and promises they&#x27;ll return to their &quot;previous life.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.336–337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Her target; she agrees to act without hesitation.<span class=\"pg\">p.336–337<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-nanase-tsubasa-y2v2-p111-1\">← Before: Nanase walks with Ayanokōji to school<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-tsukishiro-y2v2-p336-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"nanase-tsubasa sakayanagi-arisu tsukishiro","q":"tsukishiro tsukishiro s final push before losing his position  we re in late july already  it s certainly getting hotter  right   please  are you done with your analysis yet  prolonging it anymore won t help you   you mean you ve been forced to be unreasonable   yes  i ve been quite unreasonable with pressuring for an increase in the budget for this special exam   i ve prepared some splendid fireworks for the end  i want you to expel ayanokouji kiyotaka by any means necessary  is that clear   i m expecting great things from you  nanase tsubasa san  under pressure   admits to forcing budget increases and silencing the school over the exam s strict rules  and that the allegations against chairman sakayanagi have cleared so his acting chairman role is nearly over  launches a final  desperate  fireworks  push to expel ayanokoji  his enforcer  he reveals her identity and orders her to act  the chairman whose allegations are clearing  ending tsukishiro s temporary tenure","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-tsukishiro-y2v2-p336-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/tsukishiro.html#sc-tsukishiro-y2v2-p336-1\">Tsukishiro&#x27;s final push before losing his position<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.336–337<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> &quot;We&#x27;re in late July already. It&#x27;s certainly getting hotter, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.336<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> &quot;Please, are you done with your analysis yet? Prolonging it anymore won&#x27;t help you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.336<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> &quot;You mean you&#x27;ve been forced to be unreasonable?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Yes. I&#x27;ve been quite unreasonable with pressuring for an increase in the budget for this special exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;ve prepared some splendid fireworks for the end. I want you to expel Ayanokouji Kiyotaka by any means necessary, is that clear?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m expecting great things from you— Nanase Tsubasa-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Under pressure — admits to forcing budget increases and silencing the school over the exam&#x27;s strict rules, and that the allegations against Chairman Sakayanagi have cleared so his acting-chairman role is nearly over; launches a final, desperate &quot;fireworks&quot; push to expel Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.336–337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> His enforcer; he reveals her identity and orders her to act.<span class=\"pg\">p.336–337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> The chairman whose allegations are clearing, ending Tsukishiro&#x27;s temporary tenure.<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p342-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"narration","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ishizaki-daichi yamada-albert shiina-hiyori","q":"shiina hiyori short story   an excuse    the forced invitation waits with albert around a corner while ishizaki invites ayanokoji to form a group  from her own pov  reveals she cooperated only as an excuse to get close to him   good day  ayanokouji kun   i have a really bad feeling about this so  can i leave now    ayanokoji  i am sorry ayanokouji kun  but we can t let you leave   we are attracting to much attention here so let s move on ishizaki kun  clever and quietly infatuated   predicts ishizaki s forceful invitation would be futile  he d go solo or with class d  yet helps anyway  holding ayanokoji s arm with albert so she can  meet ayanokouji kun  under the pretext of the group  looks forward to even a second longer beside him  her true reason for joining the invitation   she wanted an excuse to be close to him  helps his plan without advising him  using it as cover  together with her  physically restrains ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p342-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html#sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p342-1\">Short story: &quot;An excuse&quot; — the forced invitation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.342–344<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Waits with Albert around a corner while Ishizaki invites Ayanokōji to form a group; from her own POV, reveals she cooperated only as an excuse to get close to him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yamada-albert.html\">Yamada Albert<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;Good day, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.342<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;I have a really bad feeling about this so, can I leave now?&quot; — Ayanokōji<span class=\"pg\">p.343<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;I am sorry Ayanokouji-kun! But we can&#x27;t let you leave!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.343<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;We are attracting to much attention here so let&#x27;s move on Ishizaki-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.344<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Clever and quietly infatuated — predicts Ishizaki&#x27;s forceful invitation would be futile (he&#x27;d go solo or with Class D) yet helps anyway, holding Ayanokōji&#x27;s arm with Albert so she can &quot;meet Ayanokouji-kun&quot; under the pretext of the group; looks forward to even a second longer beside him.<span class=\"pg\">p.342–344<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Her true reason for joining the invitation — she wanted an excuse to be close to him.<span class=\"pg\">p.342–344<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Helps his plan without advising him, using it as cover.<span class=\"pg\">p.342–344<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamada Albert<\/b> Together with her, physically restrains Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.342–344<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v2-p160-1\">← Before: Hiyori supports inviting Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p345-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"narration","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei nomura-shuuji amasawa-ichika","q":"amasawa ichika short story   what is reflected in her eyes    staking out karuizawa from her own pov  spends two weeks watching karuizawa  then stalks her from the dorm to ayanokoji s floor  changes into cute clothes  buys ingredients and a  small amorous box  and tails another resident through the auto lock   will he think i m cute   hmm  perfect   se npai   it s me  obsessive  playful and calculating   delights in the  hardship  of the stakeout  carefully plans her outfit and props  aims at ayanokoji s few weaknesses to get invited in  and anticipates all his ways of rejecting her  two arrows  three arrows  obsessed with him   wants him to find her cute and to be invited into his room  stalks her for two weeks to confirm the secret  date  follows him through the dorm auto lock to reach room 401","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p345-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html#sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p345-1\">Short story: &quot;What is Reflected in Her Eyes&quot; — staking out Karuizawa<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.345–347<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/amasawa-ichika.html\">Amasawa Ichika<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">From her own POV, spends two weeks watching Karuizawa, then stalks her from the dorm to Ayanokōji&#x27;s floor, changes into cute clothes, buys ingredients and a &quot;small amorous box,&quot; and tails another resident through the auto-lock.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;Will he think I&#x27;m cute?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.345<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;Hmm, perfect!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.346<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Amasawa Ichika<\/b> &quot;Se~npai.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.347<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;It&#x27;s me!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.347<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Obsessive, playful and calculating — delights in the &quot;hardship&quot; of the stakeout, carefully plans her outfit and props, aims at Ayanokōji&#x27;s few weaknesses to get invited in, and anticipates all his ways of rejecting her (&quot;two arrows, three arrows&quot;).<span class=\"pg\">p.345–347<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Obsessed with him — wants him to find her cute and to be invited into his room.<span class=\"pg\">p.345–347<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Stalks her for two weeks to confirm the secret &quot;date.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.345–346<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">nomura-shuuji<\/b> Follows him through the dorm auto-lock to reach room 401.<span class=\"pg\">p.346<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-amasawa-ichika-y2v2-p100-1\">← Before: Amasawa&#x27;s visit: the condom &quot;gift&quot; and her hints<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p348-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"narration","w":"horikita-manabu ayanokouji-kiyotaka nagumo-miyabi horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune short story   he who stands beside me    joining the council from her own pov  recounts nagumo s condition that she state why she wants to join the student council at this point in time   you wish to join the student council    nagumo  tell me the reason why you  at this point in time  want to join the student council   i had a discord with my brother  and i enrolled into this school to make peace   i spent a whole year without being able to have a properly talk with with until the very last moments   welcome to the student council  i ll have you work hard as a council member from today  suzune    nagumo honest and self reflective   gives a truthful answer about her unresolved relationship with manabu  not mentioning ayanokoji  realizes she unconsciously values ayanokoji highly and wants  him  to acknowledge her  resolves to grow through learning from nagumo so they can reach class a  her brother  she joined to make peace but never could before he graduated  wants his acknowledgment   a feeling she only admits to herself here  sets the condition  welcomes her  calls her  suzune","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p348-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p348-1\">Short story: &quot;He Who Stands Beside Me&quot; — joining the council<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.348–350<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">From her own POV, recounts Nagumo&#x27;s condition that she state why she wants to join the student council at this point in time.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-manabu.html\">Horikita Manabu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;You wish to join the student council?&quot; — Nagumo<span class=\"pg\">p.348<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;Tell me the reason why you, at this point in time, want to join the student council.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.348<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;I had a discord with my brother. And I enrolled into this school to make peace.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.349<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;I spent a whole year without being able to have a properly talk with with until the very last moments.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.349<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;Welcome to the Student Council. I&#x27;ll have you work hard as a council member from today, Suzune.&quot; — Nagumo<span class=\"pg\">p.350<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Honest and self-reflective — gives a truthful answer about her unresolved relationship with Manabu (not mentioning Ayanokōji), realizes she unconsciously values Ayanokōji highly and wants *him* to acknowledge her; resolves to grow through learning from Nagumo so they can reach Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.348–350<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Manabu<\/b> Her brother; she joined to make peace but never could before he graduated.<span class=\"pg\">p.348–349<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Wants his acknowledgment — a feeling she only admits to herself here.<span class=\"pg\">p.349–350<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Sets the condition, welcomes her, calls her &quot;Suzune.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.348–350<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y2v2-p329-1\">← Before: Horikita negotiates with Kōenji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-tsubaki-sakurako-y2v2-p351-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"narration","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka tsubaki-sakurako","q":"tsubaki sakurako short story   what could be seen from that back    trailing ayanokoji from her own pov  silently tails ayanokoji back from keyaki mall  proud of her insight intuition  and calls out to him at the convenience store   excuse me   you were tsubaki  right  do you need something from me    ayanokoji  there s something i want to speak to you about  so could you wait outside for a moment  confident in her intuition  she notes he behaves  just like a normal student  yet is sure he noticed her  buys a lollipop to justify the stop and asks to speak outside  probes him about the earlier cafe incident indirectly  trails him  certain he noticed her despite his ordinary demeanor","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-tsubaki-sakurako-y2v2-p351-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/tsubaki-sakurako.html#sc-tsubaki-sakurako-y2v2-p351-1\">Short story: &quot;What Could Be Seen From That Back&quot; — trailing Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.351–352<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/tsubaki-sakurako.html\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">From her own POV, silently tails Ayanokōji back from Keyaki Mall, proud of her insight/intuition, and calls out to him at the convenience store.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/b> &quot;Excuse me~~?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.351<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/b> &quot;You were Tsubaki, right? Do you need something from me?&quot; — Ayanokōji<span class=\"pg\">p.352<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\"><b class=\"sp\">Tsubaki Sakurako<\/b> &quot;There&#x27;s something I want to speak to you about, so could you wait outside for a moment?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.352<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Confident in her intuition, she notes he behaves &quot;just like a normal student&quot; yet is sure he noticed her; buys a lollipop to justify the stop and asks to speak outside; probes him about the earlier café incident indirectly.<span class=\"pg\">p.351–352<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Trails him; certain he noticed her despite his ordinary demeanor.<span class=\"pg\">p.351–352<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-tsubaki-sakurako-y2v2-p258-1\">← Before: Tsubaki observes; helps contact Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"}];
